<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:34:13 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Taruuih Liêm Lu-ka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lu-ka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt">Lu-ka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Ơi taai bơk manưih ơi tabhlơng xaraq taruuih leq nôôq tarnêêng bâân têêng paxong dhiq kalóóng nôôq he, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />pakơi nôôq manưih tââq xók tââp val xar nôôq manưih đu lêi ting truuih đuui lơq dhơn ratơơq ưng paraaq Chuôq ơi truuih lóóiq leq nôôq he, <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />hayơq xók ơi chamet lêi dyóp tarnêêng tââq tââp kơi chagơn, aku lêi alua liêm leq aku đóng xaraq lóóiq matââq tââq leq amei, nhan móón parjơơk Thê-ô-phi-lơ bhi chap, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />hơq đóng amei ve chóóm n'nal leq rau lalua ưng nôôq taruuih đu ađêi ơi bâân pachóóm.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Xók đơơi Hê-rôôt, bhua xưưq Ju-đê, ve mưi takóh kadhâng bhanuôih tôôh achak Xa-cha-ri, tââq kabhuh A-bi-ja. Kađiêl ađó, tââq dhong nooi nôôq akóón pađiil A-rôôn, lơq achak amooq nek Ê-li-sa-beet. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Miq bơơr kayiik kađiêl maar bhơt liêm dhiq toom mat Yaang Pleng, ơi mamông yươq dhiq chóóm xuôq kalóóng dyóp paraaq pachóóm palơq nôôq gani ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Nhiđó kah ve akóón taai Ê-li-sa-beet kah pabhaq, lơq miq nhiđó maar ơi yaal tuôi.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih tơk gral ưng ađó têêng tarnêêng pabhuôih dhiq toom mat Yaang Pleng ting kơi matââq tââq ưng kabhuh ađêi, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />ting kơi kaxu ưng kabhuh kadhâng bhanuôih, ađó ơi bâân tachââih mót leq hót kalóóng đong bhanuôih ưng Yaang Pleng đóng boh dhaak. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Tabhơt ganơr manưih dhanuôr tơơt hót nguôi nhan gavơh xók boh dhaak. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Xók achêk, mưi dhơn pleng ưng Chuôq tabhral palơq ađó, dyương hót atươm baang bhanuôih boh dhaak. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Xa-cha-ri bâân nhok karnóq xók lêi dhơn pleng, lơq rau kakhin dhuum dhiq m'piing ađó. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Bơơi dhơn pleng praaq palơq ađó: “Xa-cha-ri, óóq kakhin, taai paraaq nhan gavơh ưng amei ơi bâân xâng, lơq kađiêl amei, Ê-li-sa-beet, e n'niên đóng amei mưi akóón padruuih, lơq amei e đóók achak akóón nek Jang. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ađek e nek rau bhuui marhaal, sương si leq amei, lơq bơk ngaai e yayar ơi rau n'niên ưng akóón paniên. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Ơi ađó e bâân bhi chap dhiq toom mat Yaang Pleng, ađó kah mơ ve ơm buôh môôiq rau đu chóóm têêng taból, lơq ađó e bâân bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm patơk mơ tââq kalóóng luônh ưng amêêq ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ađó e têêng đóng bơk akóón anaaq I-sơ-ra-êên val chô leq Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng ưng piđêi. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Chênh ađó e vôôiq toom mat Chuôq palơq lóóm kanóq lơq mataai raman ưng Ê-li, đóng têêng lóóm ama val chô palơq akóón, lơq manưih kah huuiq tơk leq rau tarbech ưng manưih bhơt liêm — đóng ravang leq Chuôq mưi dhanuôr ơi bâân ravang lơơi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Xa-cha-ri móón palơq dhơn pleng: “Ng'kơi têêng hơq aku e chóóm đơơp rau ađek? Taai aku ơi takóh, lơq kađiêl aku ơi yaal tuôi.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Đóng ââi bóóp, dhơn pleng praaq palơq ađó: “Aku nek Gaap-ri-êên, nek aku dyương dhiq toom mat Yaang Pleng, aku ơi bâân kayua tơk móón palơq amei lơq đââng taruuih đu bhuui ađô leq amei. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Nek chamet xâng ađôk, amei e bâân bơq lơq kah chóóm praaq patơk tangêi nôôq tarnêêng achêk yuur vaaih, ơi taai amei kah huuiq paraaq aku, nek nôôq paraaq e bâân tajaap dhalam leq bhêêl ađek ưng piđó.” <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Dhanuôr maar xók đương Xa-cha-ri, lơq piđó lêi chrih xók ađó tơơt đươnh kalóóng đong bhanuôih. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Bơơi xók gluh, ađó kah chóóm papraaq palơq piđó, hayơq piđó n'nal kơi ađó ơi lêi rau tapalêi kalóóng đong bhanuôih, dyơq ađó bhiêk paveq têi đóng piđó hơq dyơq bâân bơq. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih xók nôôq tangêi têêng tarnêêng yaauq pabhuôih ưng ađó ơi xong, ađó val chô leq đong ađêi.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Bơơi xong nôôq tangêi achêk, kađiêl ađó, Ê-li-sa-beet, đađââng, lơq ađó palââp ađêi kalóóng xââng kaxe, móón <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />kơi ađô: “Chuôq ơi têêng kơi ađôk leq aku, kalóóng nôôq tangêi đu Ađó kayô ka-er aku, đóng ha-ơu tabil đu kachiit ưng aku dhiq m'pơng dyóp ngaai.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Tơk kaxe đu chapat, dhơn pleng Gaap-ri-êên bâân Yaang Pleng kayua tơk leq mưi kanóón ưng xưưq Ga-li-lê, achak ưng kanóón nek Na-xa-reet, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />lum mưi pađiil kamór ơi hươq nhan palơq mưi padruuih ve achak nek Jô-seep, mađó dhong nooi Đa-viit, dyơq achak ưng pađiil kamór nek Ma-ri. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Xók tơk lum ađó, dhơn pleng praaq: “Chap yayar đóng amei ơi bâân phươk liêm! Chuôq tơơt palơq amei.” <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Bơơi ađó bâân nhok karnóq taai nôôq paraaq achêk lơq kanóq xâng paraaq chap yayar ađô ve hau kiêng móón. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Hayơq dhơn pleng praaq palơq ađó: “Ma-ri, nhan óóq kakhin, taai amei ơi bâân ơơn toom mat Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Xâng ađô, amei e đađââng dhiq luônh ađêi hayơq n'niên mưi akóón padruuih, lơq amei e đóók achak ưng akóón paniên nek Jê-su. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Akóón padruuih achêk e bâân bhi chap lơq e bâân đóók nek Akóón ưng Yaang Bhơt Yaal, lơq Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng e đóng leq Ađó tanơơt Đa-viit, abhươp avuôq Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Ađó e têêng kala dhiq đong Ja-kôôp tơk leq nh'chró, lơq katiêk ưng Ađó e nek taluôn luôn.” <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Ma-ri móón palơq dhơn pleng: “Ng'kơi tarnêêng achêk e ve chóóm vaaih, xók aku kah glêh tơơt cha palơq mưi manưih padruuih?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ââi lóóiq, dhơn pleng praaq palơq ađó: “Chuôq Yaang Liêm e tơk dhiq amei lơq mataai raman ưng Yaang Bhơt Yaal e dhuum amei. Kơi ađek, Akóón Tabah ơi n'niên e bâân đóók nek Akóón Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Nek lêi tôôh, Ê-li-sa-beet, bhuh xóng ưng amei — ađó kung ơi đađââng mưi akóón padruuih xók ađó yaal tuôi, lơq bhanaq achêk xók bâân chapat kaxe kalóóng ađó, nek ađó ơi bâân đóók kah pabhaq. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Taai kah rau paraaq ơi praaq e xar kah chóóm têêng palơq Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Xók achêk, Ma-ri ââi: “Aku ađôk, dhơn ratơơq ưng Chuôq. Nhan tarnêêng vaaih leq aku ting kơi paraaq ưng Amei.” Hayơq dhơn pleng xooq tââq ađó.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Kalóóng nôôq tangêi achêk, Ma-ri yuur dyương palơq lóóm tahươk tahââm, ađó vôôiq leq parah booiq, tơk leq mưi kanóón mađó xưưq Ju-đa, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />hayơq ađó mót leq kalóóng đong Xa-cha-ri lơq tamóh tham Ê-li-sa-beet. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Tarnêêng val vaaih xók Ê-li-sa-beet xâng dhariêng chap yayar ưng Ma-ri, akóón paniên dhiq kalóóng luônh ađó yuur chadhơp bhuui marhaal, dyơq Ê-li-sa-beet bâân bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Ađó praaq karơ dhariêng hơq móón: “Amei bâân phươk lơh dhiq kalóóng kabhuh manưih pađiil, akóón paniên kalóóng luônh amei kung bâân phươk. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />N'tââq hơq rau ađô tơk leq aku, nek amêêq ưng Chuôq aku ơi tơk palơq aku? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Ơi lêi ađô, dhalam xók dhariêng chap yayar ưng amei tơk leq katór aku, akóón paniên kalóóng luônh aku ơi yuur chadhơp kalóóng bhuui marhaal. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Phươk đóng amei huuiq kơi nôôq paraaq tââq Chuôq ơi bâân praaq palơq ađêi e tajaap.” <verse eid="LUK 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Hayơq Ma-ri praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Ravaai aku bhi haanh Chuôq,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />lóóm ravaai aku pabhlơng bhuui marhaal dhiq Yaang Pleng nek Yaang Paq ưng aku.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Taai Ađó ơi chamet lêi tơk manưih xaryô xangaat ưng dhơn pađiil Ađó.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Ơi lêi tôôh, tââq ađôk leq ng'ki, dyóp n'đó klaang e haanh aku ve phươk,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />ơi Yaang Bhơt Mataai ơi têêng nôôq tarnêêng gamak đóng aku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">dhanóók Ađó nek tabah,<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />lóóm kayô ka-er ưng Ađó tââq klaang đơơi ađô tơk leq klaang đơơi tôôh palơq nôôq ngaai bhi kakhin Ađó.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Ađó ơi têêng nôôq tarnêêng mataai raman palơq têi ưng Ađó;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Ađó ơi têêng leq nôôq manưih parlaach tachêh tavươk ting nôôq karnóq dhiq lóóm piđó.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Ađó bhlêh nôôq bhua chuôq tââq tanơơt piđó,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">lơq hayuur nôôq manưih xaryô xangaat leq yaal.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Ađó têêng manưih ha-ul kabhôôq bing rau đu liêm,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">lơq đuôi manưih kavaan chô têi kagóh.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Ađó ơi paq jóói I-sơ-ra-êên, dhơn ratơơq Ađó,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">đóng bâân pahei lóóiq lóóm kayô ka-er,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />dhalam kơi Ađó ơi praaq palơq nôôq abhươp avuôq nôôq yi — palơq Ap-ra-haam nek palơq dhong nooi ađó tơk nh'chró.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Ma-ri tơơt palơq ađó kalóóng pe kaxe, hayơq ađó val chô leq đong ađêi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ganah bhêêl ưng Ê-li-sa-beet đóng ađó phaai n'niên akóón ơi tơk, lơq ađó n'niên mưi akóón padruuih. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Dharing tapóóng lơq xóng anó ưng ađó xâng n'nal kơi ađô Chuôq ơi pakah lóóm kayô ka-er ưng Ađó gamak leq ađó, nek piđó ting tabhuui palơq ađó.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih leq tangêi takóól, piđó tơk đóng iêt ng'kar leq akóón paniên, lơq piđó kiêng đóók achak đóng akóón paniên ađek ting kơi achak akonh ưng ađó, nek Xa-cha-ri. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ââi lóóiq tarnêêng chêk, amêêq ađó vil móón: “Kah, bơơi paniên e đóók nek Jang.” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Piđó móón palơq ađó kơi ađô: “Kah ve ngaai kalóóng xóng anó ưng amei hơq bâân đóók achak kơi ađek.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Piđó paveq têi đóng akonh ađó, lêi konh kiêng đóók achak leq ađó nek hau. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Xong xók kayua đââng mưi tala bhaan, ađó xaraq kơi ađô: “Achak ađó nek Jang.” Dyóp ngaai maar hêq lêi bhlơng. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Hayơq n'drươh ađek, bóóp lơq n'taak ađó tarlóng, hayơq ađó yuur papraaq bhi haanh Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Rau kakhin kapơn tơk dhiq tabhơt nôôq manưih mamông xirvir piđó, lơq dyóp rau chiên ađek bâân taxêi plok kalóóng đu tơơt parah bôôl bang ưng Ju-đê. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Dyóp ngaai xâng nek katiêu leq lóóm ađêi, tamóh ađêi kala: “Tatun ki, akóón n'niên ađô e val xar ng'kơi dhơq?” Ơi lalua têi Chuôq tơơt palơq ađó.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Xa-cha-ri, ama akóón paniên, bâân bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm, lơq praaq đââng taruuih, kơi ađô:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Bhi haanh Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng ưng I-sơ-ra-êên,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">taai Ađó ơi mót tham lơq têêng tarnêêng paq jóói leq dhanuôr Ađó.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Ađó ơi hayuur đóng nôôq yi mưi beq tagê paq jóói</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">kalóóng đong ưng Đa-viit, dhơn ratơơq Ađó<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />(kơi Ađó ơi praaq tââq hanua hana tââq bóóp nôôq manưih đââng taruuih liêm ưng Ađó),<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />nek rau paq jóói tââq brau ưng nôôq yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">lơq tââq têi ưng dyóp nak dyââng lêi nôôq yi;<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />đóng pakah lóóm kayô ka-er palơq abhươp avuôq nôôq yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">lơq đóng bâân pahei lóóiq raket liêm ưng Ađó,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />chênh nek paraaq raket đu Ađó ơi ng'kóh palơq Ap-ra-haam, abhươp avuôq nôôq yi, đóng leq nôôq yi<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />xók ơi bâân tapaq lơh tââq têi brau ađêi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">hơq đóng têêng yaauq Ađó kơi yươq rau kakhin kapơn,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />kalóóng đu sek tabah lơq bhơt liêm dhiq toom mat Ađó, dyóp nôôq tangêi ưng nôôq yi.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Dyơq akóón, akóón paniên ơơi, akóón e bâân đóók nek manưih đââng taruuih ưng Yaang Yaal bhơt Yaal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">ơi akóón e vôôiq toom mat Chuôq đóng dhoon kalơng ưng Ađó,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />đóng đââng rau bâân n'nal ơơn paq jóói leq dhanuôr Ađó kalóóng rau lơơi nôôq matu lơt ưng piđó,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />ganơơm lóóm kayô ka-er lơơi lơt ưng Yaang Pleng nôôq he,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">taai ađek, mat blo tââq đu yaal e vôôiq tham nôôq he,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />đóng dyóól brương ngaai dhơơm đu tơơt dhiq a-ô kanam lơq dhiq a-ô ưng kan chêt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">đóng kađââng tapaang dyung nôôq he mót leq kalơng đu yươq rauha.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Akóón paniên taha gamak lơq bâân khe karơ yaang lóóm, ađó tơơt kalóóng kruung vơng đóng patơk tangêi pakah tabhral ưng ađó dhiq toom mat dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih kalóóng nôôq tangêi achêk, ađek nek mưi tala bha-aar tââq Xê-xa Au-guut-tơ ơi praaq pakarơ plok dyóp katiêk đóng yaap lêi dhanuôr. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ganhuh yaap lêi dhanuôr laloom ađô ơi vaaih xók Kui-ri-ni-u kadhâng lêi xưưq Si-ri. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Tabhơt maar yuur vôôiq đóng xaraq achak leq bha-aar, dyóp nak chô leq kanóón ưng ađêi kala. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Jô-seep kung vôôiq tââq xưưq Ga-li-lê, lơơi kanóón Na-xa-reet tơk xưưq Ju-đê, mót leq kanóón Đa-viit, dham bâân đóók nek Bêêt-lê-heem, taai ađó mađó leq kabhuh lơq dhong nooi Đa-viit, <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />đóng xaraq achak leq bha-aar palơq Ma-ri, nek manưih đu ơi hươq tarđơơp palơq ađêi, xók ve đađââng. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Tarnêêng val vaaih xók bhêêl nhiđó dyơq tơơt dhiq ađô, ađek nek tangêi ađó ayaai ơi tơk. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Ađó n'niên mưi akóón padruuih, nek akóón tame ưng ađêi, lơq ađó oom akóón palơq nôôq tala bhaai, hayơq tabêch akóón n'niên dhiq mưi taloong abhơơi, taai kah ve dham đóng nhiđó kalóóng đong tơơt.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Kung kalóóng parah ađek, ve nôôq manưih jư trưưu xók tơơt dhiq klung, kalóóng hayum đương jư kabhuh trưưu ưng piđó. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Mưi dhơn pleng ưng Chuôq tabhral palơq piđó, cha-iil tabah Chuôq dyóól xirvir piđó, lơq piđó bâân kadrêq lêi palơq kakhin kapơn bhlơng. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Dhơn pleng móón palơq piđó: “Óóq kakhin, nek xâng nô, aku đââng leq nôôq pe taruuih liêm bhuui marhaal bhlơng, taruuih achêk e đóng leq dyóp nak. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Ơi tangêi mađôk, dhiq kanóón Đa-viit, Yaang Paq Jóói ơi bâân n'niên đóng nôôq pe, Ađó nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek Chuôq! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Lơq ađô nek kanal đóng nôôq pe: Nôôq pe e chêk lum mưi akóón par-aang oom palơq nôôq tala bhaai, bêch dhiq taloong bhơơi.” <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />N'drươh ađek, ve mưi tanóói dhơn pleng tabhral nek palơq dhơn pleng achêk babóóch haanh Yaang Pleng, kơi ađô:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Brương cha-iil chô leq Yaang Pleng kalóóng dhiq đu bhơt yaal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">lơq dhiq katiêk, yươq rau ha kalóóng nôôq manưih chô leq karnóq liêm kre ưng Chuôq.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Tarnêêng vaaih drươh xók nôôq dhơn pleng ơi xooq tââq piđó chô leq pleng, nôôq manưih jư trưưu tapraaq xóng piđó: “Lalua kơi ađek, nôôq he phaai vôôiq tơk leq Bêêt-lê-heem lơq lêi taruuih achêk nek rau tame vaaih, đu Chuôq ơi pakah đóng nôôq he.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Piđó tahươk tahââm yuur vôôiq, hayơq bâân lum miq Ma-ri lơq Jô-seep, palơq akóón paniên par-aang bêch dhiq kalóóng taloong bhơơi. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Xong xók bâân lêi, piđó truuih đuui leq taruuih ơi bâân truuih đóng ađêi leq akóón paniên ađô. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />La ngaai xâng kung maar bâân hêq xâng leq rau dhơơm bâân truuih lóóiq leq ađêi tââq nôôq manưih jư trưưu. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Dyơq Ma-ri bhiêk katiêu dyóp paraaq achêk, kanóq kalóóng lóóm ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Hayơq nôôq manưih jư trưưu val chô, bhi haanh lơq babóóch haanh Yaang Pleng ơi dyóp rau đu piđó ơi xâng lơq lêi, dhalam kơi taruuih bhuui ơi bâân truuih leq piđó.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Xók bhêêl takóól tangêi đóng iêt ng'kar leq akóón paniên ơi bâân têêng, nek achak akóón paniên achêk bâân đóók nek Jê-su, nek achak ơi bâân đóók tââq dhơn pleng xók loom akóón paniên kah ơi vaaih kalóóng luônh amêêq.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Lơq xók nôôq tangêi têêng pasek ưng piđó ting kơi gani Môôi-se ơi bâân têêng, nhiđó đââng akóón paniên leq Jê-ru-sa-leem đóng tapôông leq Chuôq <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />(kơi ơi xaraq kalóóng gani ưng Chuôq, kơi ađô: “Dyóp akóón padruuih n'niên laloom e bâân đóók nek tabah liêm leq Chuôq”), <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />lơq đóng tapôông bhanuôih dhah ting kơi rau bâân pachóóm kalóóng gani ưng Chuôq: “makap achim paraap môôiq bơơr panong achim katru akóón”. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Lơq lêi tôôh, ve mưi nak dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, achak ưng ađó nek Si-mê-ôôn, manưih padruuih ađô bhơt liêm lơq jêi tarang, xók đương rââm rau tabhơơl lóóm dhanuôr ưng I-sơ-ra-êên, lơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm jaq dhiq ađó. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Rau ơi bâân pakah leq ađó tââq Chuôq Yaang Liêm nek e yươq lêi kan chêt laloom xók ađó ve bâân lêi Yaang Paq Manưih ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Lơq tââq Yaang Liêm, ađó vôôiq mót leq đong bhanuôih, xók akonh akan đââng akóón paniên Jê-su tơk đóng palââng têêng tarnêêng ting kơi kaxu bâân xêi kalóóng gani tapâng tơk akóón paniên achêk, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />ađó gabê akóón paniên dhiq têi, bhi haanh Yaang Pleng, lơq ađó móón:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Kakoh Chuôq, xók ađôk, Amei đóng dhơn ratơơq Amei yuur vôôiq kalóóng yươq rauha ting kơi paraaq ưng Amei.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ơi mat akóón ve lêi rau paq jóói ưng Amei,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />đu Amei ơi ravang toom mat dyóp dhanuôr:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Brương đóng rau tapakah tơk palơq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, lơq cha-iil tabah đóng dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên ưng Amei.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Akonh lơq akan akóón paniên nek hêq xâng đu rau dhơơm abhươp praaq leq akóón paniên. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Hayơq Si-mê-ôôn nhan phươk đóng piđó lơq móón palơq Ma-ri, amêêq akóón paniên: “Xâng ađô, akóón paniên ađô ơi chaleq đóng đu kalơm môôiq yuur dyương ưng bơk nak kalóóng I-sơ-ra-êên, lơq têêng mưi karnal bâân palââng praaq tamôôp — <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Kơi lââng, mưi pala bhươt e tak tơk leq ravaai ưng chênh amei — hơq đóng lóóm karnóq hót kalóóng bơk lóóm bâân tapakah.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Dhiq ađek kung ve pađiil An-ne manưih đââng taruuih, akóón pađiil Pha-nu-êên, mađó dhong nooi A-se. Amooq yaal tuôi bhlơng, ơi mamông palơq kayiik tapól kamó xong tââq ganah dyơq kamór ưng amooq, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />hayơq amooq tơơt kamaai tơk ađôk ơi takóól jêt puôn tuôi, hơq kah ve xooq tââq đong bhanuôih, bhiêk yaauq tangêi lơq hayum palơq tarnêêng điêng cha lơq nhan gavơh. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Xók ve mat leq chênh xók ađek, amooq pơơh bóóp ma-ơ Yaang Pleng, lơq praaq leq akóón paniên đóng dyóp ngaai xók đương rââm đu paq jóói ưng Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="LUK 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Xók piđó ơi têêng xong dyóp tarnêêng ting kơi gani ưng Chuôq, piđó chô lóóiq leq xưưq Ga-li-lê, chô leq kanóón ưng ađêi nek Na-xa-reet.<verse eid="LUK 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Akóón paniên gamak taha lơq vaaih praan karơ, bâân bing rau tarbech, lơq ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng tơơt dhiq akóón paniên achêk.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Dyóp kamó, amêêq ama Ađó đơk leq Jê-ru-sa-leem đóng tơơt bhiêk Jalơh. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Xók Ađó đuôh majêt bơơr tuôi, piđó đơk leq ađek ting kơi kaxu ưng ganah bhiêk. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Xong xók nôôq tangêi bhiêk ơi luch, bhêêl piđó xók vôôiq kalơng val chô, paniên Jê-su dyơq tơơt dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem hơq amêêq ama Ađó kah ve n'nal. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bơơi ơi ngóq Ađó dhiq kalóóng tanóói manưih tââq changaai, hayơq nhiđó ơi vôôiq mưi tangêi kalơng, hayơq ve chik chêk Ađó bhlưa kalóóng kabhuh xóng lơq parjơơk. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Lơq xók chêk kah ve lêi, nhiđó val lóóiq leq Jê-ru-sa-leem, bhiêk chik chêk Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Chiên ơi vaaih ađek nek tatun pe tangêi, nhiđó bâân lêi Ađó kalóóng đong bhanuôih, xók tơơt dhiq m'pơng nôôq takóh tarbech, n'drươh tameng xâng piđó n'drươh tamóh piđó. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Dyóp ngaai xâng Ađó maar hêq xâng leq rau n'nal kung kơi paraaq tar-ââi tamóh ưng Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Akonh akan hêq lêi xók lêi Ađó, lơq akan Ađó móón palơq Ađó: “Avok ơơi, hau amei chóóm têêng palơq amêêq ama kơi ađô? Nek lêi, ama akóón lơq amêêq ơi ranguôq lóóm karaang bhlơng chik chêk akóón.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ađó ââi palơq nhiđó: “Hau chóóm amêêq ama chik chêk aku? Amêêq ama kah ơi n'nal nek aku phaai tơơt kalóóng đong Ama ưng aku hơ?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Bơơi nhiđó kah n'nal paraaq đu Ađó móón palơq nhiđó. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Hayơq Ađó dhaluônh palơq akonh akan, chô leq kanóón Na-xa-reet, lơq đơơp xâng bóóp nhiđó. Bơơi akan Ađó katiêu dyóp rau tarnêêng achêk kalóóng lóóm ađêi.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Chuôq Jê-su bhiêk taha kalóóng rau tarbech lơq achak araang, kung kơi kalóóng đu liêm lóóm toom mat Yaang Pleng lơq palââng.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mót kamó đu majêt xââng raal bhua Sê-sa Ti-be-rơ — xók dyơq Bôôn-xơ Phi-laat têêng kuôn gamak kadhâng xưưq Ju-đê, Hê-rôôt têêng bhua katưưiq xưưq Ga-li-lê, dyơq Phi-liip, adhi padruuih ađó ađek têêng bhua katưưiq xưưq I-tu-rê palơq xưưq Tra-kô-niit, lơq Li-sa-ni-a têêng bhua katưưiq xưưq A-bi-leen, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />xók ganah An-ne lơq Kaai-phe jư tarnêêng takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm — paraaq Yaang Pleng ơi tơk palơq Jang, akóón padruuih Xa-cha-ri, dhiq kruung vơng. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Lơq kơi ađek, ađó vôôiq tơk plok parah paroong karuung Jô-đen, truuih pachóóm pheep bap-teem leq rau klôôq lóóm đóng bâân ơơn lơơi matu. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Kơi rau ơi bâân xaraq kalóóng bha-aar leq nôôq paraaq ưng abhươp Ê-saai manưih đââng taruuih:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Ve dhariêng lalơu karơ kalóóng kruung vơng:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Phaai dhoon kalơng ưng Chuôq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">têêng tapat nôôq kalơng ưng Ađó.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Dyóp dhaluq klung e bâân bhơn tabing,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">dyóp bôôl bang e bâân bhlêh pa-êêp,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">kalơng vang ving e xar tapat liêm,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">kalơng bhachuq bhachơp e xar klung bhang,<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />lơq dyóp ng'kar m'bech e lêi rau paq jóói ưng Yaang Pleng.’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Kơi ađek, Jang praaq palơq tanóói manưih ganơr tơk đóng đơơp ađó têêng bap-teem: “Dhong nooi kaxênh karviêng tôôh, ngaai ơi loom kamêch leq nôôq pe đóng mut klôôn tââq rau jarnah ravang tơk? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Taai kơi ađek, phaai machak maraang đóng ađaang palơq rau klôôq lóóm, lơq óóq bhiêk jư karnóq tư ađêi kala móón: ‘Nôôq he ve Ap-ra-haam nek abhươp avuôq,’ nek aku móón palơq nôôq pe kơi Yaang Pleng ve chóóm yuur paxar akóón chachau Ap-ra-haam tââq nôôq kaliêng dhơl ađô. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Kơi lââng, pla chuung kung ơi ng'gơq đan tââm n'lóóng. Taai ađek, n'đó n'lóóng kah bóóng pale liêm nek bâân takươl lơq m'peq leq óih.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Manưih dhanuôr tamóh ađó kơi ađô: “Kơi ađek, Harau nôôq yi phaai têêng?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Đóng ââi bóóp, ađó móón palơq piđó: “Ngaai ve bơơr beq aau phaai nh'xóóng đóng leq manưih kah ve, lơq ngaai ve tarmông, manưih achêk kung phaai têêng kơi ađek.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Kabhuh pagoop jêên kung tơk đóng đơơp têêng bap-teem; lơq piđó móón palơq ađó: “Nhan tamóh thêi, harau nôôq yi phaai têêng?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ađó ââi palơq piđó: “Óóq pei bơk lơh meen ơi bâân móón leq adhi anó.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Masôôq linh kung tamóh ađó, kơi ađô: “Dyơq nôôq yi, harau nôôq yi phaai têêng?” Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Óóq pei jeng mak rau, kung óóq baauq uôn ngaai, lơq nek phaai iêm lóóm palơq mơ jêên chaner ưng ađêi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Kơi lââng, taai manưih dhanuôr xók đương rââm lơq taai tabhơt maar kanóq kalóóng lóóm ađêi leq Jang, kah n'nal kơi ađó ve lua nek Chuôq Paq Manưih kah, <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Jang ơi móón đóng n'nal xók praaq palơq dyóp ngaai: “Aku têêng bap-teem đóng adhi anó palơq đơơk, bơơi Yaang ravang bhral ve mataai raman lơh aku, nek Yaang hayơq aku kah ve đaang lêh tarlêi jêi đóng Ađó. Ađó e têêng bap-teem đóng adhi anó palơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm lơq palơq óih, <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />nek Yaang ve kanaau dhiq têi Ađó đóng kaau pasek taang aviq ađêi, lơq ha-ơu aviq mi leq jơơng ưng ađêi, bơơi Ađó e óch pasek n'drang palơq óih kah đuôh chóóm tapat.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Kơi ađek, lalua xók praaq pachóóm bơk rau lââng, ađó truuih pachóóm taruuih liêm đóng manưih dhanuôr. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Bơơi Hê-rôôt bhua katưưiq, xong xók bâân Jang teng trêh leq chiên Hê-rô-đia, kađiêl ưng adhi ađêi, lơq leq dyóp rau tarnêêng aak lââng đu Hê-rôôt ơi têêng, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />patơk mơ ơi tagơơn tarnêêng ađô leq tabhơt tarnêêng aak ưng ađêi: chêk nek ađó đóng kóóp Jang król leq đong kanam.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Dhơ kơi ađek xók dyóp ngaai đơơp bap-teem, tarnêêng val vaaih ađek nek Chuôq Jê-su kung đơơp bap-teem, lơq xók Ađó nhan gavơh, nôôq klaang pleng bâân talương, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />hayơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm dhaluônh jaq dhiq Ađó kalóóng a-ô hót nguôi thê kơi achim paraap, lơq mưi dhariêng tơk tââq pleng: “Akóón nek Akóón nh'nhơr ưng Aku. Aku iêm lóóm leq Akóón.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Xók tââp têêng tarnêêng, Chuôq Jê-su ađó kala bâân mơ pe jêt tuôi, (ting kơi palââng dyơq kanóq) Ađó nek akóón ưng Jô-seep, Jô-seep akóón Hê-li, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Hê-li akóón Maat-taat, Maat-taat akóón Lê-vi, Lê-vi akóón Mêên-chi, Mêên-chi akóón Ja-nê, Ja-nê akóón Jô-seep, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Jô-seep akóón Ma-ta-thia, Ma-ta-thia akóón A-môôt, A-môôt akóón Na-huum, Na-huum akóón Êch-li, Êch-li akóón Na-gê, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Na-gê akóón Ma-aat, Ma-aat akóón Ma-ta-thia, Ma-ta-thia akóón Sê-mê-iin, Sê-mê-iin akóón Jô-sêch, Jô-sêch akóón Jô-đa, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Jô-đa akóón Jô-a-naan, Jô-a-naan akóón Rê-sa, Rê-sa akóón Xô-rô-ba-bêên, Xô-rô-ba-bêên akóón Sa-la-thi-êên, Sa-la-thi-êên akóón Nê-ri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Nê-ri akóón Mêên-chi, Mêên-chi akóón A-đi, A-đi akóón Kô-saam, Kô-saam akóón Êên-ma-đaam, Êên-ma-đaam akóón Ê-rơ, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ê-rơ akóón Jô-suê, Jô-suê akóón Ê-li-ê-se, Ê-li-ê-se akóón Jô-riim, Jô-riim akóón Maat-thaat, Maat-thaat akóón Lê-vi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lê-vi akóón Si-mê-ôôn, Si-mê-ôôn akóón Ju-đa, Ju-đa akóón Jô-seep, Jô-seep akóón Jô-naam, Jô-naam akóón Ê-li-a-kiim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Ê-li-a-kiim akóón Mê-lê-a, Mê-lê-a akóón Meen-na, Meen-na akóón Maat-ta-tha, Maat-ta-tha akóón Na-thaan, Na-thaan akóón Đa-viit, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Đa-viit akóón Je-sê, Je-sê akóón Ô-bêêt, Ô-bêêt akóón Bô-ô, Bô-ô akóón Sanh-môôn, Sanh-môôn akóón Na-et-soon, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Na-et-soon akóón A-mi-na-đaap, A-mi-na-đaap akóón At-miin, At-miin akóón A-rơ-ni, A-rơ-ni akóón Êch-rôôm, Êch-rôôm akóón Pha-rê, Pha-rê akóón Ju-đa, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Ju-đa akóón Ja-kôôp, Ja-kôôp akóón I-saak, I-saak akóón Ap-ra-haam, Ap-ra-haam akóón Tha-rê, Tha-rê akóón Na-kô, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Na-kô akóón Sê-ruk, Sê-ruk akóón Rê-hu, Rê-hu akóón Bê-leek, Bê-leek akóón Hê-be, Hê-be akóón Sa-la, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sa-la akóón Kaai-naam, Kaai-naam akóón A-baat-saat, A-baat-saat akóón Seem, Seem akóón Nô-ê, Nô-ê akóón Lê-meek, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lê-meek akóón Mê-tu-sê-la, Mê-tu-sê-la akóón Hê-nok, Hê-nok akóón Jê-rêêt, Jê-rêêt akóón Ma-ha-la-êên, Ma-ha-la-êên akóón Kê-naan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kê-naan akóón Ê-noot, Ê-noot akóón Sêêt, Sêêt akóón A-đaam, A-đaam akóón Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Chuôq Jê-su, bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm, val chô tââq karuung Jô-đen, lơq bâân Chuôq Yaang Liêm đââng leq kruung vơng, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />đóng đơơp abhưi dharơơl galơơk kalóóng puôn jêt tangêi. Bhluuch nôôq tangêi ađek, Ađó kah rau chacha dhơ dharau hayơq Ađó ha-ul xong xók nôôq tangêi ađô luch. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Hayơq abhưi móón palơq Ađó: “La Amei nek Akóón Yaang Pleng, nek hayơq praaq palơq dhơl ađô đóng ađó xar vaaih beng vaq.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Chuôq Jê-su ââi palơq ađó: “Ve paraaq xaraq kơi ađô: ‘Palââng mamông eh rau ganơơm mơ beng giêl.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Hayơq abhưi ơi đââng Chuôq leq đu yaal, ađó chaleq đóng Chuôq tabhơt nôôq katiêk karuung dhiq hóng katiêk xók maxưưiq giêl. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Abhưi móón palơq Chuôq: “Aku e đóng leq amei dyóp rau mataai ađô lơq cha-iil tabah ưng piđó, taai ađó ơi bâân pajaau leq aku, lơq aku ve chóóm đóng ađó leq dhơ dhangaai la aku kiêng. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Kơi ađek, la amei chakoh kakoh toom mat aku, hayơq tabhơt e nek ưng amei.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Đóng ââi bóóp, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Ve paraaq xaraq: ‘Amei phaai bhuôih haanh Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng ưng amei, lơq mơ têêng yaauq Ađó giêl.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Hayơq, abhưi đââng Chuôq tơk leq Jê-ru-sa-leem, patơơt Ađó dhiq pabhung ưng đong bhanuôih, lơq ađó móón palơq Chuôq: “La Amei nek Akóón Yaang Pleng, nek patôq ađêi kala chok leq tââq dham ađô. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Ơi ve paraaq xaraq, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Ađó e kayua đóng nôôq dhơn pleng Ađó pơh leq akóón, đóng jư lêi akóón,’<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />lơq kơi ađô: ‘Piđó e tapââng akóón dhiq têi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:11">đóng akóón yươq n'đóih dyung ađêi pâng dhơl.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Ââi lóóiq, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó, kơi ađô: “Ve paraaq praaq: ‘Amei kah chóóm klêêu Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng ưng amei.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Xong xók têêng luch dyóp kơi dharơơl galơơk, abhưi xooq tââq Ađó, đương bhêêl lââng.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Chuôq Jê-su val chô leq Ga-li-lê kalóóng mataai raman ưng Yaang Liêm, lơq tanđôôr leq Ađó đââr tơk plok xưưq xaang ađek. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Ađó truuih pachóóm kalóóng nôôq đong gươl ưng dhanuôr, bâân dyóp ngaai bhi haanh.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Ađó vôôiq tơk leq kanóón Na-xa-reet, dhiq Ađó ơi taha gamak, lơq ting kơi tarnêêng kaxu ưng ađêi, Ađó mót leq đong gươl kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat hayơq yuur dyương đok karơ dhariêng. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Panuôl bha-aar ưng Ê-saai manưih đââng taruuih bâân đóng leq Ađó, lơq xók lương panuôl bha-aar, Ađó chêk lêi dhiq đu ơi ve bâân xaraq kơi ađô:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Yaang Liêm ưng chuôq jaq dhiq aku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">taai Ađó ơi xut dhơu leq Aku đóng truuih pachóóm taruuih liêm leq manưih đu ngeeo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Ađó ơi kayua Aku truuih móón rau rathaai đóng leq manưih takról,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">lơq payươh tabrương đóng manưih kabaang kapôk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">đóng pagluh manưih bâân tajanah tơk leq rau rathaai,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />lơq đóng truuih kamó ơơn liêm ưng Chuôq.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Xong xók puôl bha-aar lóóiq pachô leq manưih têêng yaauq, Ađó joon tơơt. Mat dyóp ngaai kalóóng đong gươl maar chamet lêi leq Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Hayơq, Ađó tââp praaq palơq piđó, kơi ađô: “Mađôk, paraaq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng tơk leq katór adhi anó ađek ơi bâân tajaap.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Dyóp ngaai maar truuih đuui liêm leq Ađó lơq piđó hêq lêi toom nôôq paraaq bing ơơn phươk liêm gluh tââq bóóp Ađó, lơq piđó tamóh xóng piđó: “Ađôk kah lua nek akóón padruuih ưng Jô-seep hơ?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Lalua adhi anó e móón palơq aku paraaq karvech ađô: ‘Manưih payươh ơơi, nek tư payươh ađêi kala. N'nal n'đơq tarnêêng đu nôôq yi ơi xâng vaaih dhiq Ka-bê-na-um, nek amei kung phaai têêng dhiq ađô, dhiq bhươl kanóón ađêi hơ.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Hayơq Ađó praaq: “Alua, aku móón palơq adhi anó, kơi kah vaaih manưih đââng taruuih đu bâân bhi chap dhiq bhươl kanóón ưng ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Aku praaq palơq adhi anó dhiq rau dhalam, kơi bơk pađiil kamaai biêh tơơt dhiq I-sơ-ra-êên kalóóng đơơi ưng Ê-li, xók pleng bâân takađơp kalóóng pe kamó chapat kaxe, xók achêk, ganah ha-ul gamak val vaaih kalóóng plok xưưq, <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />hơq Ê-li bâân kayua tơk palơq kah ngaai kalóóng nôôq piđó, chapiên mơ tơk leq Sa-reep-ta, dhiq kanóón Si-đôôn, tơk palơq mưi pađiil kamaai kayiik. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Kung ve bơk manưih ka-ai tơơt bhơơi dhiq I-sơ-ra-êên xók klaang đơơi Ê-li-sê manưih đââng taruuih, lơq kah ngaai kalóóng piđó bâân sek, chapiên mơ Na-a-maan, manưih Si-ri.” <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Xók xâng nôôq paraaq achêk, dyóp ngaai kalóóng đong gươl bing bhlaai pagrâ. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Xong xók yuur dyương, piđó dhalươq pagluh Ađó leq nguôi kanóón, lơq galôôi Ađó tơk leq parah traan ưng bhung bôôl đu kanóón ưng piđó tơơt dhiq ađek, đóng dhalươq Ađó chooh leq. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Bơơi Ađó róch xooq xong xók bhlah dhiq m'pơng piđó.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Ađó dhuônh leq Ka-bê-na-um, mưi kanóón mađó leq xưưq Ga-li-lê, lơq Ađó truuih pachóóm đóng leq manưih dhanuôr xók tangêi Sa-baat. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Piđó hêq xâng toom paraaq pachóóm ưng Ađó, taai paraaq ưng Ađó pakah ting palơq mataai. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Kalóóng đong gươl, ve mưi nak bâân yaang ưng abhưi rarik rari mót bóq, lơq ađó achêk lalơu karơ dhariêng: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ơ! Jê-su Na-xa-reet, nôôq yi palơq Amei hau ve pâng kre? Amei tơk đóng leng kaxiêt nôôq yi hơ? Aku n'nal Amei nek ngaai — nek Yaang Tabah ưng Yaang Pleng!” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Chuôq Jê-su trêh teng ađó, kơi ađô: “Parngau aq, lơq gluh tââq ađó ađô!” Hayơq nek xong xók padhađơm ađó ađek leq katiêk nham m'pơng manưih dhanuôr, abhưi gluh tââq ađó ađek, yươq rau têêng ađó ađô tabhrê. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Rau kakhin kapơn tơk dhiq dyóp ngaai, lơq piđó tapraaq xóng ađêi, kơi ađô: “Hau Taruuih ađô, patơk mơ palơq mataai raman lơq praan karơ, ađó ađek kayua đóng abhưi môôp, lơq piđó phaai gluh xooq?” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Tanđôôr leq Ađó đââr plok dyóp leq xưưq xaang tóór ađek.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Tatun ađek, xók ơi yuur dyương xooq tââq đong gươl, Ađó mót kalóóng đong ưng Si-môôn. Dhơ kơi ađek, amêêq kađiêl ưng Si-môôn xók ka-ai lơq kahiir puih bhlơng, lơq piđó nhan Ađó payươh amooq. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Kóp pacheeng chak dhiq amooq, Ađó trêh ka-ai kahiir, lơq kahiir xooq tââq amooq, hayơq amooq n'drươh yuur dyương têêng yaauq piđó.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Xók mat tangêi xriêp, tabhơt dyóp ngaai dhơ dharau bâân ka-ai dhuôr palơq dyóp rau nôôq ka-ai dreh, palââng đââng piđó tơk leq Ađó, hayơq Ađó payươh piđó xók lơơi têi dhiq ting nak kalóóng nôôq piđó. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Nôôq abhưi kung gluh tââq bơk ngaai, xók lalơu karơ hơq móón kơi ađô: “Amei nek Akóón Yaang Pleng!” Lơq palơq trêh teng, Ađó kah đóng pheep piđó praaq, taai piđó ơi n'nal Ađó nek Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Bhrâ brương mót tangêi tame, xong xók xooq tââq dham ađek, Ađó vôôiq tơk leq mưi dham ranguôq rabaang, dyơq tanóói dhanuôr bhiêk chik chêk Ađó, lơq piđó ơi vôôiq đóng tơk xók lum Ađó hayơq tabhlơng jư Ađó lóóiq, kah đóng vôôiq lơh tââq piđó. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Bơơi Ađó praaq palơq piđó, kơi ađô: “Aku kung phaai truuih pachóóm taruuih liêm leq katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng đóng bơk kanóón lââng, taai aku bâân kayua ơi rau ađô.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Hayơq Ađó bhiêk truuih pachóóm kalóóng nôôq đong gươl xưưq Ju-đê.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók tanóói dhanuôr kaxiêq xirvir Ađó đóng tameng xâng paraaq Yaang Pleng, lơq Ađó xók dyương hót tóór atông Gê-nê-xa-rêêt, <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Ađó lêi bơơr beq bhuông xók tachauq dhiq jrơm hót tóór atông, dyơq nôôq manưih bâân kadhóóng, xók achêk ơi dhaluônh tââq bhuông, piđó xók pươh laaiq. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Ađó dyók mưi kalóóng bơơr m'beq bhuông, hơq bhuông ađek nek ưng Si-môôn, Ađó kayua Si-môôn chông leq changaai tââq tóór m'bưưiq. Xong xók tơơt parngau, Ađó truuih pachóóm đóng tanóói dhanuôr tââq dhiq bhuông. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Xók Ađó pachóóm xong, Ađó praaq palơq Si-môôn: “Nek đââng bhuông leq đơơk dhơuq hayơq pachaang laaiq ưng amei chok leq đóng kóóp bing kadhóóng.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Xók ââi bóóp, Si-môôn praaq: “Thêi ơơi, dhơ ơi matêêng bhluuch tóóng hayum, nôôq yi ơi kah rau bâân panong panâ, bơơi ganơơm ting paraaq thêi, aku e pachaang laaiq.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Xong xók têêng tarnêêng ađek, piđó bâân kóóp bơk kadhóóng bhlơng, dyơq laaiq ưng piđó nek kiêng taheek. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Piđó kavah đóng nôôq parjơơk đu tabâân kadhóóng tơơt dhiq bhuông lââng tơk proong ađêi, nôôq manưih ađek tơk lơq ting garuiq padyók kadhóóng bing bơơr m'beq bhuông tơk mơ bhuông kanóq klêch. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók lêi kơi achêk, Si-môôn Phi-e-rơ kóp achak chok leq dhiq takól Chuôq Jê-su, móón: “Kakoh Chuôq, nhan xooq tââq aku, ơi aku nek manưih matu lơt.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Ơi rau kakhin kapơn dhuum ađó lơq tabhơt nôôq manưih tơơt palơq ađó ơi taai malaaiq kadhóóng đu piđó ơi bâân kóóp, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Kung makơi kơi ađek palơq Ja-kơ lơq Jang, nek nôôq akóón padruuih ưng Xê-bê-đê, piđó nek nôôq parjơơk ting tabâân kadhóóng ưng Si-môôn. Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq Si-môôn: “Óóq rau kakhin! Tââq ađôk leq tabhêêl amei e nek têi lalaaiq manưih.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Xong xók đââng bhuông leq tóór, lơq m'peq lơơi dyóp rau, piđó vôôiq ting Ađó.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Tarnêêng val vaaih bhêêl Ađó xók tơơt dhiq mưi kanóón tôôh, lơq lêi tôôh, mưi nak achak bing ka-ai tơơt bhơơi. Xók lêi Chuôq Jê-su, ađó kóp mat leq katiêk nhan gavơh Chuôq, kơi ađô: “Kakoh Chuôq, la Amei kiêng, Amei ve chóóm têêng đóng aku bâân sek.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Chuôq jarơ têi kadhâng leq ađó, praaq: “Aku kiêng, nek sek aq.” N'drươh, ka-ai tơơt bhơơi yươh bil tââq ađó ađek. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Hayơq Chuôq praaq pató ađó óóq móón palơq ngaai, palâh lóóiq: “Phaai vôôiq pakah ađêi kala leq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih lơq tapôông bhanuôih leq tarnêêng bâân sek ưng amei ting kơi Môôi-se truuih pachóóm, đóng truuih đuui leq piđó.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Dhơ kơi ađek, tanđôôr leq Ađó nek dyơq đââr lơh dyơq, kơi achêk nek tanóói dhanuôr manưih bơk taruiq tơk xâng Ađó truuih pachóóm lơq bâân yươh tââq nôôq ka-ai dreh ưng ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Bơơi Ađó buôn klôôn leq đu ranguôq rabaang lơq nhan gavơh.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Tarnêêng val vaaih xók mưi tangêi tôôh, xók bhêêl Ađó dyơq truuih pachóóm, nek ve nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si lơq manưih pachóóm gani tơơt dhiq ađek, nek nôôq manưih ơi bhral tââq dyóp nôôq bhươl kanóón dhiq kalóóng xưưq Ga-li-lê lơq Ju-đê, kung kơi tââq kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem, lơq mataai raman ưng Chuôq tơơt dhiq Ađó payươh ka-ai dreh. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Lêi tôôh, masôôq manưih glâk mưi manưih padruuih bêch dhiq chong, ađek nek manưih bâân rabóót dyung têi, piđó xók tabâân đââng ađó achêk leq hót kalóóng đóng patơơt toom mat Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Xók kah n'nal kơi ve chóóm đââng ađó achêk mót taai ganơr manưih, nek dyók leq pabhung đong, ting tââq jarpơơq ngooiq, piđó ơi xua ađó ađek bêch dhiq chong chok leq m'pơng dyóp ngaai, toom mat Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Xók lêi lóóm huuiq ưng piđó, Ađó móón: “Akóón ơơi, matu lơt amei ơi bâân lơơi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Nôôq takóh pachóóm gani lơq manưih Pha-ri-si tââp vaaih tarkaai, kơi ađô: “Ađó ađô nek ngaai hayơq praaq paraaq chôlô kơi ađek? Ngaai ve mataai lơơi matu chapiên mơ mưi ađó Yaang Pleng?” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su n'nal karnóq ưng piđó, hayơq đóng ââi lóóiq, Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Hau nôôq pe chóóm kanóq kalóóng lóóm ađêi kơi achêk? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />N'đó paraaq nek khe praaq lơh: ‘Matu lơt amei ơi bâân lơơi’ môôiq praaq: ‘Phaai yuur dyương lơq bhadyaang vôôiq?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Bơơi đóng nôôq pe n'nal nek Akóón Manưih dhiq hóng katiêk ve mataai chóóm lơơi matu,” — Ađó praaq palơq manưih rabóót dyung têi — “Aku kayua amei, nek yuur dyương, dhoon chong amei lơq chô leq đong ưng amei.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />N'drươh ađek, ađó ađek yuur dyương toom mat piđó, xong xók dhoon chong đu ađó biêh bêch dhiq ađek, nek ađó vôôiq chô leq đong ađêi, têêng cha-iil tabah đóng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Rau chrih lêi dhuum dyóp ngaai, lơq piđó bhi haanh Yaang Pleng, lóóm bing kakhin kapơn, praaq kơi ađô: “Tangêi mađôk nôôq he ơi lêi nôôq tarnêêng đu chrih.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Tatun nôôq tarnêêng achêk, Ađó xooq tââq ađek lơq lêi li mrang mưi nak pagoop jêên achak Lê-vi xók tơơt dhiq đong pagoop jêên, hayơq Ađó móón palơq akonh ađek: “Hêq ting aku!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Kơi achêk nek xong xók yuur dyương, m'peq lơơi dyóp rau, akonh ađek vôôiq ting Ađó.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Lê-vi dhoon mưi vaar cha gamak đóng leq Ađó dhiq đong ađêi, lơq ve mưi kabhuh bơk manưih pagoop jêên lơq nôôq manưih lââng xók tơơt dhiq baang chacha palơq piđó. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Dyơq nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si lơq takóh pachóóm gani ưng piđó m'bhoonh palơq nôôq môôn-đô ưng Chuôq, kơi ađô: “Ơi taai ng'kơi hơq nôôq pe vil cha ơm madhiq palơq kabhuh đu pagoop jêên lơq nôôq manưih matu lơt?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Đóng ââi bóóp, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Manưih khe karơ kah ve đươi leq manưih payươh, bơơi manưih ka-ai nek đươi. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Aku kah tơk đóng dhaloong manưih bhơt liêm, bơơi nek manưih ve matu tơk leq rau klôôq lóóm.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bơơi hayơq, piđó ađek móón palơq Ađó: “Nôôq môôn-đô ưng Jang buôn điêng cha lơq tapôông nôôq paraaq nhan gavơh, môôn-đô ưng manưih Pha-ri-si kung kơi achêk. Bơơi manưih ưng nôôq pe bhiêk cha palơq ơm.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Ađó ââi palơq piđó ađek: “Nôôq pe tââq ve chóóm kayua tamóói tơơt cha đaam bhiêk điêng cha xók bhêêl chaxaau dyơq tơơt palơq piđó, pâng kah? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Bơơi lalua e tơk tangêi xók hơq chaxaau bâân đââng vôôiq lơh tââq piđó. Xók ađek, leq nôôq tangêi achêk, piđó e điêng cha.” <verse eid="LUK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Hayơq Ađó kung truuih đóng piđó mưi babi kơi ađô: “Kah ngaai bươl leq aau ti paleh bhaai n'teek tââq aau tame. Bơơi la têêng kơi achêk, nek e têêng tanteek aau tame, lơq paleh bhaai đu pei tââq aau tame e kung kah liêm palơq aau ti. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Kung kah ngaai kađôôq buôh tame kalóóng aluui ng'kar ti. Bơơi la têêng kơi ađek, nek buôh tame e têêng bhriq aluui ng'kar, buôh e hóói leq nguôi, aluui e kung bâân hư. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Palâh lóóiq, phaai kađôôq buôh tame kalóóng aluui ng'kar tame. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Xong xók ơm buôh ti, kah ngaai kiêng buôh tame, ơi manưih achêk móón kơi ađô: ‘Buôh ti nek iêm lơh.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih leq mưi tangêi Sa-baat, Chuôq Jê-su xók vôôiq kóh nôôq hare aviq, lơq môôn-đô Ađó takat kanuung aviq, kataar dhiq têi, hayơq cha. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Bơơi ve nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si móón: “Hau nôôq pe chóóm têêng rau kah chóóm đóng pheep kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Xók ââi bóóp piđó, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Nôôq pe kah glêh đok leq tarnêêng đu Đa-viit ơi têêng xók bhua lơq nôôq manưih tơơt palơq ađêi ha-ul cha hơ? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ng'kơi bhua ơi mót leq kalóóng đong Yaang Pleng, pei beng dhiq baang bhanuôih, bhua cha lơq nh'xóóng đóng nôôq manưih đu ting vôôiq palơq ađêi, đu beng achêk kah chóóm pheep cha, chapiên mơ palơq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih giêl.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq piđó ađek: “Akóón Manưih nek Chuôq ưng tangêi Sa-baat.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih xók mưi tangêi Sa-baat đu lââng, Chuôq Jê-su mót leq kalóóng đong gươl truuih pachóóm, lơq dhiq ađek ve mưi chanak padruuih, tapaang têi atươm ưng ađó ơi dyóói. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Bơơi nôôq takóh pachóóm gani lơq manưih Pha-ri-si đương chamet đóng lêi Ađó, lêi Ađó ve payươh kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat kah, đóng piđó ve bâân chêk kaauq patu Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Bơơi Ađó n'nal rau karnóq ưng piđó, hayơq Ađó praaq palơq manưih đu dyóói têi: “Nek yuur dyương lơq gluh dyương dhiq m'pơng nôôq yi.” Manưih achêk yuur dyương lơq gluh dyương dhiq ađek. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Aku tamóh nôôq pe, la pâng ting kơi gani kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat nek chóóm têêng liêm môôiq têêng môôp, paq parmông môôiq leng manưih?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Xong xók hangiêk lêi dyóp ngaai xirvir, Ađó praaq palơq ađó achêk: “Nek jarơ têi ưng amei.” Ađó achêk ting têêng lơq têi ađó bâân yươh. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Bơơi piđó bing lóóm kabhróónh lơq tapraaq xóng ađêi lêi piđó ve chóóm têêng hau rau palơq Chuôq Jê-su.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Tarnêêng vaaih kalóóng nôôq tangêi achêk, ađek nek Ađó đơk leq bôôl đóng nhan gavơh, lơq Ađó ơi meh n'drươh brương kalóóng rau praaq chiên palơq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Xók tangêi tame ơi tơk, Ađó dhaloong nôôq môôn-đô ađêi, lơq chââih majêt bơơr chanak tââq kalóóng piđó, hơq Ađó kung đóók majêt bơơr chanak manưih achêk nek sưưq-đô, ađek nek: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Si-môôn, manưih đu Chuôq kung đóók achak nek Phi-e-rơ, adhi padruuih ađó nek En-rê, Ja-kơ, Jang, Phi-liip, Ba-thê-lê-mi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Ma-thi-ơ, Thô-ma, Jang akóón A-phê, Si-môôn nek manưih bâân đóók nek Xê-lôôt, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Ju-đa akóón Ja-kơ, lơq Ju-đa Ich-ka-ri-ôôt nek manưih xar đu têêng tamôôp. <verse eid="LUK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Xong xók vôôiq dhuônh palơq piđó ađek, Ađó dyương dhiq mưi dham katiêk klung bhang palơq mưi ganơr manưih nôôq môôn-đô Ađó, lơq tanóói dhanuôr palơq parbơk manưih bơk tơk tââq plok xưưq Ju-đê lơq Jê-ru-sa-leem, kung kơi xưưq tóór taxiiq Ti-rơ lơq Si-đôôn, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />nôôq manưih achêk ơi tơk đóng tameng xâng Ađó lơq đóng bâân payươh tââq nôôq ka-ai dreh ưng ađêi. Nôôq manưih bâân abhưi môôp panhok kung bâân payươh. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Tabhơt tanóói manưih bhiêk tabâân kơi xuui leq Ađó taai mataai raman gluh tââq Ađó lơq payươh dyóp ngaai.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Hayơq Chuôq Jê-su, mat Ađó riing lêi nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó, lơq praaq: “Phươk đóng adhi anó nek manưih ngeeo, ơi katiêk Yaang Pleng nek ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Phươk đóng adhi anó xók ađôk ha-ul, ơi adhi anó e bâân kabhôôq dyóp. Phươk đóng adhi anó xók ađôk nhiim kalau, ơi adhi anó e bhuui kachang. <verse eid="LUK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Adhi anó bâân phươk xók palââng geet adhi anó, xók piđó m'peq lơơi adhi anó, praaq paxê lơq tabil achak adhi anó pakơi manưih đu aak ơi taai Akóón Manưih. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Kalóóng tangêi ađek, nek bhuui marhaal lơq tanâât yayar ơi, lêi nô, kaliim haanh ưng adhi anó dhiq pleng nek gamak bhlơng, taai abhươp avuôq ưng piđó ơi têêng palơq nôôq manưih đââng taruuih ting kơi ađek. <verse eid="LUK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Dhơ kơi ađek, ayô đóng adhi anó, nek manưih kavaan, taai adhi anó ơi đơơp rau tabhơơl ưng ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ayô đóng adhi anó nek manưih xók ađôk kabhôôq kajrê, taai adhi anó e ha-ul. Ayô đóng adhi anó xók ađôk kachang kakrươh, ơi adhi anó e ka-ai ranguôq lơq nhiim kalau. <verse eid="LUK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ayô đóng adhi anó xók bâân dyóp ngaai maar praaq liêm leq ađêi, ơi abhươp avuôq ưng piđó kung têêng praaq ting kơi ađek palơq nôôq manưih đââng taruuih chachââr.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Bơơi Aku móón palơq adhi anó, nôôq ngaai xók tameng xâng, nek nh'nhơr brau ađêi lơq têêng praaq paliêm palơq manưih geet ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Phaai nhan phươk đóng manưih tóh taaiq adhi anó lơq gavơh nhan đóng ngaai đu chanaaq janah adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Palơq ngaai m'bhah adhi anó dhiq tabók hót ađô, nek đóng luôn tabók hót tôôh, dyơq manưih pei n'drooih aau chaguôk ưng adhi anó, nek adhi anó kung óóq jư kadhâng aau kalóóng tââq manưih ađek. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Dhơ dhangaai nhan gavơh adhi anó, phaai đóng, lơq óóq pachô lóóiq tââq manưih đu pei ve rau ưng adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Adhi anó kiêng palââng têêng đóng ađêi ng'kơi, phaai têêng leq piđó kơi achêk. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />La adhi anó nh'nhơr ngaai dhơơm nh'nhơr ađêi, hayơq ađek nek n'tââq ve ơơn palơq adhi anó? Taai chênh manưih ve matu kung nh'nhơr manưih nh'nhơr ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />La adhi anó têêng praaq liêm palơq manưih đu têêng praaq liêm palơq ađêi, hayơq ađek nek n'tââq ve ơơn palơq adhi anó? Manưih ve matu kung têêng dhalam kơi ađek. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />La adhi anó đóng palââng vaq hơq adhi anó rââm đơơp lóóiq tââq piđó, hayơq ađek nek n'tââq ve ơơn palơq adhi anó? Manưih đu ve matu kung đóng manưih đu ve matu vaq, đóng đơơp lóóiq dhalam kơi ađek. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Bơơi phaai nh'nhơr brau ađêi lơq têêng praaq paliêm palơq piđó, phaai đóng vaq xók kah rââm đơơp lóóiq, hayơq kaliim haanh ưng adhi anó e nek gamak bhlơng, adhi anó e nek akóón ưng Yaang Bhơt Yaal, ơi Ađó dyơq lóóm nh'nhơr nek palơq manưih tabil mlơơi lơq môôp aak. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Phaai ve lóóm kayô ka-er, pakơi Ama ưng adhi anó ve lóóm kayô ka-er. <verse eid="LUK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Óóq xêi lơt, nek adhi anó e lalua yươq rau bâân xêi lơt. Óóq kaauq lơt nek adhi anó e lalua yươq bâân takaauq lơt. Phaai lơơi lơt, nek adhi anó e bâân lơơi lơt. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Phaai pei đóng, nek rau e bâân đóng leq adhi anó: mưi phơn bang paliêm — bâân niêl ralet, bâân pakơr đóng dhaluônh, têêng đóng bing bhlaai — piđó e n'toh leq kađung aau adhi anó. Ơi adhi anó bang n'đó n'đơq, nek mơ achêk e bâân bang lóóiq leq adhi anó.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Ađó kung truuih leq piđó mưi babi: “Manưih kabaang kah ve chóóm đââng kalơng manưih kabaang, pâng kah? Kah lua bơơr nhiđó maar e n'tôq leq bóng alua? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Môôn-đô nek kah lơh thêi, bơơi dyóp nak xók bâân pachóóm dyóp liêm e xar thê kơi thêi ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Hau adhi anó lêi xanaak kalóóng mat mưi adhi anó ađêi, hơq adhi anó kah lêi mandreh n'lóóng dhiq kalóóng mat ưng ađêi? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Hau kơi adhi anó ve chóóm praaq palơq adhi anó ađêi: ‘Anó ơơi, đóng aku vươih pagluh xanaak tââq kalóóng mat amei’ xók chênh ađêi kala adhi anó kah lêi mandreh n'lóóng dhiq kalóóng mat ađêi kala? Manưih paliêm dhiq bóóp tôôh! Laloom tââm, phaai pei pagluh mandreh n'lóóng tââq mat ađêi, hayơq adhi anó chóóm lêi drêh dróói hơq pei xanaak dhiq kalóóng mat adhi anó ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Ơi kah ve tââm n'lóóng liêm bóóng pale môôp, kơi lââng, kung kah ve tââm n'lóóng môôp bóóng pale liêm. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Bơơi dyóp n'lóóng bâân n'nal tââq pale ưng n'lóóng ađek. Palââng kah leh pale tarung dhiq tââm axông, hayơq palââng kung kah leh pale nho tââq tââm jaraau. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Manưih liêm tââq rau đu liêm takarong ưng lóóm vaaih rau liêm, dyơq manưih aak tââq kalóóng rau aak vaaih rau aak. Ơi tââq rau bing bhlaai kalóóng lóóm hơq bóóp ađêi praaq.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Hau adhi anó đóók aku: ‘Chuôq, Chuôq,’ hơq kah đơơp têêng kơi paraaq aku pachóóm? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Aku e đóng adhi anó n'nal manưih đu tơk palơq aku, xâng paraaq aku lơq ting têêng nôôq praaq ađek nek ngaai thê. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Manưih ađek thê kơi manưih têêng đong, hayơq manưih ađô ơi uôch katiêk padhơuq lơq têêng bhanơn dhiq hóng dharaaq. Hayơq, xók đơơk tuh lim tơk, parloong đơơk kajuôh leq đong achêk, bơơi ađó yươq đuôh têêng kalơm đong, taai đong ađek ơi bâân têêng liêm mưng. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Bơơi manưih xâng hơq kah đơơp ting têêng nek thê kơi mưi nak têêng đong dhiq katiêk hơq kah vaaih bhanơn pariiq, xók đơơk tuh kajuôh mót leq đong ađek, ađó n'drươh hachươp kalơm, lơq rau hư bil đong xaang ađek nek gamak bhlơng.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Xong xók Ađó paluch dyóp paraaq ưng ađêi toom rau tameng xâng ưng manưih dhanuôr, Ađó mót leq kalóóng kanóón Ka-bê-na-um.<verse eid="LUK 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Xók achêk, mưi dhơn ratơơq achêk ưng takóh kadhâng koq linh, hơq ađek nek manưih nh'nhơr bhlơng palơq ađó, xók bâân ka-ai klơp, kanóq chêt. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Xong xók xâng leq Chuôq Jê-su, ađó kayua nôôq takóh bhươl Jo Thaaiq tơk palơq Chuôq, nhan gavơh Chuôq tơk đóng Chuôq paq payươh dhơn ratơơq ưng ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Xók nôôq manưih achêk tơk palơq Chuôq Jê-su, piđó mââl lóóm nhan gavơh Ađó, móón kơi ađô: “Abhươp achêk nek đaang đóng thêi e têêng tarnêêng ađô leq ađó, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />taai ađó nh'nhơr dhanuôr nôôq he, ađó kung ơi têêng đong gươl leq nôôq he.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Hayơq, Chuôq Jê-su yuur vôôiq palơq piđó. Bơơi xók Ađó ơi dyơq đan dham đong kah mơ changaai, hayơq takóh kadhâng koq linh kayua nôôq manưih parjơơk vôôiq móón palơq Ađó: “Kakoh Chuôq, nhan óóq panhok lóóm, taai aku kah ađaang đóng Amei mót leq đong aku. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Chênh taai ađek, aku patơk mơ kung kah lêi ađêi kala ađaang đóng tơk lum Amei. Dhơ kơi ađek, nhan Amei praaq mapaleh, hayơq dhơn ratơơq aku nek bâân yươh ka-ai. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Ơi aku nek kung manưih bâân patơơt raraal karơ kataai, hơq ve linh raraal kataai ưng aku, lơq aku kayua ađó ađô: ‘Vôôiq aq,’ nek ađó vôôiq; hayơq palơq ađó đu lââng: ‘Tơk nô leq,’ nek ađó tơk; lơq palơq dhơn ratơơq ưng aku: ‘Phaai têêng tarnêêng ađô,’ nek ađó têêng.” <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Xók Chuôq Jê-su xâng kơi achêk, Ađó lóng chrih xâng leq akonh ađek, hơq palâh leq tanóói manưih bơk xók vôôiq ting ađêi, Ađó praaq: “Aku praaq palơq adhi anó, patơk mơ dhiq I-sơ-ra-êên, aku kung kah glêh lêi lóóm huuiq kơi ađek.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Xók nôôq manưih bâân kayua chô lóóiq leq đong, piđó lêi manưih dhơn ratơơq xók ơi khe karơ.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih xók tangêi tatun, Ađó mót leq mưi kanóón bâân đóók nek Na-iin, nôôq môôn-đô Ađó lơq manưih dhanuôr bơk bhlơng xók ting vôôiq palơq Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Dhalam xók Chuôq Jê-su đan tơk leq palóng kanóón nek lêi tôôh, palââng glâk pagluh mưi nak ơi chêt, nek akóón padruuih mưi ưng amêêq ađêi (amooq nek pađiil kamaai), mưi tanóói nh'jang bơk manưih dhanuôr tââq kalóóng kanóón ting vôôiq palơq amooq. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Xók lêi amooq, Chuôq vaaih lóóm kayô ka-er leq amooq, hayơq Ađó móón palơq amooq: “Óóq nhiim.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Vôôiq pađan, Ađó kadhâng leq taraang, nek nôôq manưih xók glâk dyương parngau. Hayơq Ađó móón: “Akóón padruuih, aku móón amei, nek yuur tơơt.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Manưih chêt yuur tơơt lơq tââp papraaq, hayơq Chuôq pajaau ađó leq amêêq ưng ađó. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Hơq nek, rau kakhin kapơn dhuum tabhơt, piđó bhi haanh Yaang Pleng, móón kơi ađô: “Mưi manưih đââng taruuih gamak bhlơng ơi bâân yuur tabhral dhiq m'pơng nôôq he” lơq kơi ađô: “Yaang Pleng ơi mót tham dhanuôr Ađó.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Taruuih ađô leq Ađó đââr plok luch xưưq Ju-đê lơq dyóp xưưq xaang đan tóór.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Nôôq môôn-đô ưng Jang truuih lóóiq đóng ađó leq dyóp rau ađek. Lơq xong xók kayua dhaloong bơơr môôn-đô tôôh ưng ađêi, hayơq Jang <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />kayua nhiđó tơk leq Chuôq, tamóh: “Thêi nek Yaang phaai bhral, môôiq nôôq yi dyơq kơng đương rââm Yaang lââng?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Xók tơk leq Chuôq, nôôq manưih achêk móón: “Jang Bap-tiit kayua bơơr yưa tơk leq thêi, kơi ađô: ‘Thêi nek Yaang phaai bhral, môôiq nôôq yi dyơq kơng đương rââm Yaang lââng?’” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Leq chênh jơ achêk, Ađó payươh bơk ngaai yươh ka-ai dreh, ka-ai karuôq lơq abhưi bóq, Ađó kung têêng đóng bơk manưih kabaang bâân lêi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Đóng ââi, Ađó praaq palơq nhiđó: “Xong xók val chô, nek truuih lóóiq leq Jang rau dhơơm bơơr nhưa ơi lêi lơq xâng: manưih kabaang bâân brương mat, manưih khuch ke jađaang vôôiq, manưih tơơt bhơơi bâân sek, manưih tung xâng n'nal, manưih chêt bâân têêng đóng mamông lóóiq, manưih ngeeo bâân xâng taruuih liêm, <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />lơq phươk đóng ngaai đu yươq bâân n'đóih lơt ơi taai Aku.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Tatun ađek, xong xók nôôq manưih đââng paraaq ưng Jang chô lơh, Ađó tââp praaq palơq manưih dhanuôr leq Jang: “Adhi anó vôôiq mót leq kalóóng kruung vơng đóng lêi hau? Mưi tanââm karbho bâân adhiiq paveq alua? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Palâh lóóiq, adhi anó vôôiq gluh đóng lêi hau? Mưi manưih xơp kun aau palơq bhaai ramaanh alua? Lêi tôôh, nôôq manưih kalóóng kun aau liêm kre lơq mamông sương si nek tơơt kalóóng đong bhua. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Hayơq bơơi, adhi anó vôôiq gluh đóng lêi hau? Mưi manưih đââng taruuih eh? Alua, aku móón palơq adhi anó, nek lơh mưi manưih đââng taruuih dyơq. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Achêk nek leq ađó hơq paraaq ađô ơi bâân xaraq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Nô, Aku kayua dhơn đââng paraaq Aku vôôiq loom toom mat Akóón,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">ađó e dhoon kalơng ưng Akóón toom mat Akóón.’<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Aku praaq đóng adhi anó n'nal, kalóóng nôôq manưih đu tââq pađiil n'niên, kah ngaai nek gamak lơh Jang, bơơi manưih katưưiq tââm dhiq kalóóng katiêk Yaang Pleng nek gamak lơh ađó achêk.” <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />(Xók ơi tameng xâng, nek dyóp ngaai, patơk tabhơt nôôq manưih chik pagoop jêên, maar móón Yaang Pleng nek bhơt liêm, xók đơơp bap-teem ting pheep bap-teem ưng Jang. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Bơơi nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si lơq nôôq takóh pachóóm gani ơi kah đơơp kanóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng đóng leq ađêi, xók kah đơơp ađó têêng bap-teem.) <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />“Kơi ađek nek, aku e marchơng nôôq manưih leq klaang đơơi ađô palơq hau rau? Piđó thê ngaai? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Piđó thê kơi kabhuh paniên tơơt dhiq dham babaan, dhaloong dhabơ xóng piđó, piđó praaq: ‘Nôôq yi plong aluôt đóng nôôq pe hơq nôôq pe kah đơơp tanâât. Nôôq yi babóóch chaxuul kalau kalêêng hơq nôôq pe kah đơơp nhiim kalau.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Taai Jang Bap-tiit ơi bhral, kah cha beng, kung kah ơm buôh, nek nôôq pe móón: ‘Ađó ađek bâân abhưi bóq.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Akóón Manưih ơi bhral, cha lơq ơm, nek nôôq pe móón: ‘Lêi tôôh, mưi manưih n'thaam cha lơq n'thaam ơm, parjơơk ưng kabhuh manưih pagoop jêên lơq kabhuh manưih ve matu!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Bơơi rau tarbech galang ơi bâân tapaq liêm taai tabhơt akóón anaaq ưng ađêi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Xók achêk, mưi kalóóng sôôq nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si kayua Ađó đóng cha vaar palơq ađêi. Xók ơi mót leq kalóóng đong manưih Pha-ri-si achêk, Ađó tơơt dhiq baang chacha. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Lêi tôôh, ve mưi manưih pađiil kalóóng kanóón, hơq pađiil ađek nek manưih ve matu. Xók bâân n'nal kơi Ađó xók tơơt dhiq baang chacha kalóóng đong manưih Pha-ri-si, pađiil đââng mưi beq klóng palơq ngok kađôôq dhơu thum, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />lơq tơk dyương hót hóng, đan dhiq dyung Chuôq, hơq nhiim. Ađó tââp têêng padyêp dyung Chuôq palơq đơơk mat, hayơq ađó dyuut đơơk mat palơq xok dhiq akoq ađêi, chum dyung Chuôq lơq xut dhơu thum đóng. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Xók manưih Pha-ri-si, nek manưih ơi kayua Chuôq, lêi kơi ađek, ađó ađek tư móón kalóóng lóóm, kơi ađô: “La ađó ađô nek manưih đââng taruuih, nek ađó ađek alua phaai n'nal manưih pađiil đu kadhâng tơk ađêi nek ngaai lơq ng'kơi dhơq manưih ađô, kơi akan ađek nek manưih matu lơt.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Đóng ââi bóóp, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Si-môôn, aku ve rau ađô đóng móón palơq amei.” Ađó ađek móón: “Thêi ơơi, nhan bhiêk móón!” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Ve bơơr chanak manơơq ưng mưi nak buôn đóng vaq jêên achêk. Mưi chanak manơơq xââng hariêng đơ-ni-ê, hayơq manưih tôôh manơơq xââng jêt. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Xók piđó maar kah ve đóng chróót, kala đóng vaq ơi lơơi nơơq miq nhiđó. Hayơq kơi ađek, ngaai kalóóng sôôq bơơr chanak e nh'nhơr ađó achêk lơh?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Xók Si-môôn pei ââi, ađó móón: “Aku kanóq kơi ađô manưih đu kala manơơq ơi lơơi bơk lơh.” Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Amei móón pâng bhlơng.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Hayơq palâh leq manưih pađiil, Chuôq praaq palơq Si-môôn: “Amei lêi manưih pađiil ađô kah? Aku mót leq đong ưng amei. Amei kah đóng aku đơơk raau dyung, dyơq ađó pei padyêp dyung aku palơq đơơk mat, hayơq dyuut nôôq ađek palơq xok ưng ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Amei ơi kah đóng aku chanum chanâ, dyơq ađó tââq bhêêl aku vôôiq mót, ơi kah dhêi chum dyung aku. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Amei kah xut dhơu leq akoq aku, dyơq ađó ơi xut dyung aku palơq dhơu thum. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Taai kơi ađek, aku móón palơq amei, matu ưng ađó ađô, dhơ bơk, ơi bâân lơơi lơt, ơi ađó ađô nh'nhơr bơk. Dyơq ngaai bâân lơơi lơt m'bưưiq nek nh'nhơr m'bưưiq.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Hayơq Chuôq praaq akan ađek: “Matu lơt ưng amei ơi bâân lơơi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Nôôq manưih đu tơơt dhiq ađek tââp vaaih tapraaq dhiq m'pơng piđó: “Ađó ađô nek ngaai hơq kung lơơi matu?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Hayơq Chuôq praaq palơq manưih pađiil: “Lóóm huuiq ưng amei ơi paq amei. Nek vôôiq kalóóng yươq rauha.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók ganah drươh xong ađek, Ađó dyơq bhiêk yuur vôôiq leq kanóón ađô, bhươl tôôh, truuih pachóóm kung kơi truuih taruuih liêm leq katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng, lơq majêt bơơr sưưq-đô ting vôôiq palơq Ađó, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />lơq nôôq pađiil tôôh nek nôôq manưih ơi bâân payươh tââq yaang môôp lơq ka-ai dreh: Ma-ri, ađó bâân đóók nek Ma-đơ-leen, đu tââq ađó ve tapól panong abhưi môôp ơi gluh xooq; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Jaan-nơ, kađiêl Chu-xa, kadhâng karvaan ưng Hê-rôôt; Xu-xa-nơ; lơq bơk pađiil lââng, piđó têêng yaauq nôôq manưih ưng Ađó palơq nôôq drươp karvaan piđó ve.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Xók tanóói dhanuôr manưih bơk krong madhiq tââq dyóp kanóón pơh tơk palơq Chuôq Jê-su, Ađó truuih pachóóm palơq babi: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Mưi nak manưih vươk m'ma vôôiq gluh đóng vươk m'ma ưng ađêi, lơq bhêêl xók ađó ađek vươk, maphơn kaliêng m'ma ruuh tóór kalơng, bâân tađâq raal dyung lơq achim pleng chóh luch nôôq m'ma ađek. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Nôôq kaliêng lââng ruuh dhiq dhơl, hayơq xók yuur chat, maphơn ađek avet rang, taai kah vaaih katiêk dyêp. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Maphơn lââng dyơq ruuh leq m'pơng tââm axông, hayơq xók yuur chat, nek xông têêng đóng ađó óóm. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Lơq maphơn nôôq kaliêng lââng ruuh dhalam dhiq katiêk liêm, hayơq xók chat gamak, ađó bóóng pale bơk lơh mưi hariêng chu.” Xong xók praaq nôôq paraaq achêk, Ađó praaq pakarơ: “Ngaai ve katór đóng xâng, nek xâng.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Tatun ađek, nôôq môôn-đô ưng Ađó tamóh Ađó: “Babi achêk nek hau kơi?” <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Ađó ââi: “Adhi anó ơi bâân đóng ơơn n'nal leq nôôq rau takadrêi leq katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng, bơơi palơq manưih lââng nek pei babi, đóng ‘xók lêi, piđó kah lêi, lơq xók xâng, piđó kah n'nal.’ <verse eid="LUK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Babi achêk nek kơi ađô: Kaliêng m'ma nek paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Nôôq dham tóór kalơng nek nôôq manưih ơi xâng, bơơi tatun ađek abhưi tơk lơq pei drooih paraaq tââq lóóm piđó hayơq đóng piđó kah huuiq đóng bâân paq. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Nôôq dham dhiq dhơl nek nôôq manưih xók piđó ơi xâng, nek palơq bhuui marhaal, piđó pei đơơp paraaq. Bơơi piđó kah vaaih riêh, nek nôôq manưih chapiên huuiq mưi ganah giêl, lơq bhêêl xók hadhaap janah, nek piđó prah lơơi. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Dyơq leq maphơn kaliêng ơi ruuh bhlưa nôôq tââm axông, hayơq dham ađô nek nôôq manưih ơi xâng, hayơq xók bhiêk vôôiq kalơng đơơi ađêi, piđó bâân têêng đóng óóm taai nôôq karaang, rau karvaan lơq sương si đơơi ađôk, lơq piđó kah chóóm taha lóóm. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Bơơi leq nôôq phơn kaliêng m'ma dhiq katiêk liêm, ađôk nek nôôq manưih palơq lóóm taniih lơq kanóq liêm, xong xók xâng paraaq nek piđó jư tamưng lơq bâân bóóng pale kalóóng đu mưng lóóm.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Xong xók bat dhơu, kah ngaai jróp ađó lóóiq palơq thung môôiq lơơi krum dharââng. Klóóih leq ađek, palââng lơơi ađó dhiq dyung dhơu đóng nôôq manưih bhadyaang mót ve chóóm bâân lêi brương. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Ơi kah ve marau marâ bâân kadrêi palââp hơq e kah bâân tapakah, kung kah ve rau lalââp hơq lalua kah bâân pakah lơq pakah pagluh leq brương. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Hayơq kơi ađek, nek chagơn leq kơi adhi anó xâng, ơi ngaai ve e bâân đóng kơơq, dyơq ngaai kah ve, patơk mơ rau ađó achêk ngóq ađêi ve kung e bâân tapei luôn tââq ađó.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Xók ađek amêêq lơq nôôq adhi Ađó tơk palơq Ađó, bơơi piđó kah chóóm pađan tơk Ađó ơi taai bơk manưih. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Hayơq, tarnêêng achêk bâân móón leq Ađó: “Amêêq thêi lơq nôôq adhi ưng thêi xók ađôk dyương hót nguôi, kiêng lum thêi.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Bơơi xók ââi bóóp, Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Ađôk nek amêêq aku lơq adhi anó aku, nek ngaai dhơơm xâng lơq ting têêng paraaq Yaang Pleng.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók mưi tangêi tôôh, Ađó palơq nôôq môôn-đô ưng ađêi bhadyaang dyók leq mưi beq bhuông, lơq Ađó móón palơq piđó ađek: “Nôôq he kơng phaai vôôiq chaang atông hót tôôh.” Hayơq piđó đââng bhuông vôôiq. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Xók piđó chông bhuông nek Ađó bêch. Tatun ađek, mưi garnhuh adhiiq gamak pruung tơk leq taxiiq atông, piđó bâân đơơk mót bing bhuông lơq ngơn bhlơng. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Piđó tơk đan payuur Ađó, kơi ađô: “Thêi ơơi! Thêi ơơi! Nôôq he ravang chêt!” Bơơi xók Ađó yuur meh, Ađó trêh dhiiq lơq đơơk gar-uul, nek piđó parngau lóóiq lơq dyóp rau xar bha-ip. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ađó móón palơq piđó ađek: “Lóóm huuiq adhi anó n'dhiq?” Xók rau kakhin kapơn, piđó hêq lêi tapraaq xóng ađêi: “Xariêq thêi nek ngaai hơq thêi kayua đóng adhiiq lơq đơơk, lơq piđó phaai xâng bóóp thêi?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Hayơq piđó chông bhuông tơk xưưq Jê-ra-sê, nek dhiq chang gan palơq xưưq Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Xók Ađó dyók leq kakóóng, mưi manưih tôôh tââq kanóón achêk vôôiq gluh kêch Ađó, manưih ađek bâân abhưi bóq. Ơi mưi ganah đươnh, ađó ađek kah xơp n'đóh kun aau, kung kah mamông kalóóng đong, bơơi tơơt dhiq ping xaal. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Xók lêi Chuôq Jê-su, ađó ađek yuur lalơu, chakoh dhiq toom Chuôq lơq praaq dhariêng karơ: “Ơ, Jê-su, Akóón Yaang Pleng Bhơt Yaal, aku lơq Amei ve rau pâng kre kah? Aku gavơh Amei, nhan óóq janah aku.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Taai Chuôq ơi praaq parâng leq abhưi môôp gluh tââq manưih padruuih achêk. Ơi bơk chu abhưi bóq dhiq ađó, dyơq ađó biêh bâân taxiêng lóóiq palơq xaniêng lơq kanum, dhơ bâân đương jư, nek taai abhưi, dyóp xók rươt tarlêi xiêng, ađó bâân đââng leq kruung vơng. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su tamóh ađó: “Achak amei nek hau?” Ađó ââi: “Kabhuh Linh,” taai bơk abhưi ơi bóq leq ađó ađek. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Hayơq piđó bhiêk gavơh nhan Chuôq Jê-su đóng Ađó óóq praaq parâng đóng piđó phaai dhaluônh leq maraaih. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Dhiq ađek ve mưi kabhuh a-ook bơk bhlơng xók cha dhiq taring bôôl, piđó nhan Chuôq đóng Ađó đóng pheep piđó bóq leq kabhuh a-ook. Lơq Chuôq đóng pheep piđó. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Hayơq nek, xók ơi gluh tââq manưih padruuih, kabhuh abhưi bóq leq kabhuh a-ook, hayơq luch kabhuh a-ook mut haluông ting taring bôôl chrơm leq atông lơq bâân chêt haleng. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Xong xók nôôq manưih jư a-ook lêi tarnêêng ơi tame vaaih, nek piđó mut klôôn lơq truuih lóóiq tarnêêng achêk kalóóng kanóón lơq kalóóng bhươl m'bưưiq manưih. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Kơi ađek, manưih dhanuôr vôôiq tơk đóng lêi chiên ơi vaaih, piđó tơk dhiq Chuôq Jê-su lơq lêi manưih padruuih, đu kabhuh abhưi ơi gluh xooq, xók tơơt dhiq dyung Chuôq Jê-su, ve xơp kun aau, lơq lóóm kanóq brương, nek piđó bâân kakhin kapơn. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Nôôq manưih ơi lêi truuih lóóiq leq piđó ng'kơi hơq manưih bâân abhưi bóq ơi bâân paq payươh. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Tabhơt ganơr manưih kalóóng xưưq Jê-ra-sê nhan Ađó xooq tââq piđó, taai piđó bâân rau kakhin kapơn gamak xavaang. Hayơq kơi ađek, Ađó dyók leq bhuông lơq val chô. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Manưih padruuih, đu kabhuh abhưi ơi gluh xooq, nhan gavơh Chuôq đóng tơơt palơq Chuôq, bơơi Chuôq đóng ađó chô, praaq kơi ađô: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Phaai val chô leq đong ưng amei lơq phaai truuih lóóiq dyóp rau tarnêêng Yaang Pleng ơi têêng leq amei.” Hayơq ađó yuur vôôiq truuih plok luch kanóón dyóp rau tarnêêng Chuôq Jê-su ơi têêng leq ađêi.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Xók Chuôq Jê-su val chô, mưi tanóói manưih bơk pơh kêch Ađó, ơi dyóp ngaai maar đương rââm Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Lơq lêi tôôh, mưi nak manưih vôôiq tơk, achak ưng ađó nek Jaai-ru, ađó nek manưih têêng jư lêi đong gươl. Kakoh achak dhiq dyung Chuôq Jê-su, ađó gavơh nhan Chuôq vôôiq leq đong ađó, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />taai akóón pađiil mưi giêl palơq ađó, mơ majêt bơơr tuôi, paniên pađiil xók kiêng phet. Xók Chuôq dyơq vôôiq dhiq kalơng, ganơr manưih bơk kaxiêq kajêêq xirvir Ađó.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ve mưi pađiil palơq ka-ai hóói ahaam ơi majêt bơơr kamó, dhơ ơi gleh luch jêên baak leq manưih payươh, hơq kah ve dhơ dhangaai chóóm payươh ka-ai đóng ađó. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Palơq tơk pađan tââq hót hóng, akan ađek xuui leq tahaal aau ưng Ađó, lơq n'drươh, ka-ai ahaam hóói ưng akan ađek bâân pat. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Chuôq Jê-su tamóh: “Ngaai manưih ơi xuui leq aku?” Bơơi dyóp ngaai maar dyiin, Phi-e-rơ yuur móón: “Thêi ơơi, ganơr manưih dhanuôr bơk xók xavaang praang lơq kaxiêq thêi.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Ve mưi nak ơi xuui leq aku, ơi aku n'nal mataai raman tââq aku ơi yuur gluh.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Xók achêk, xók manưih pađiil đơơp lêi kơi ađó ơi kah đuôh chóóm palââp dyơq, nek akan ađek hayer hatơq tơk lơq xong xók kakoh achak chok leq toom Chuôq, ađó truuih toom mat tabhơt manưih dhanuôr taai ng'kơi hơq ađó ơi xuui leq Chuôq lơq ađó ơi bâân yươh n'drươh nek ng'kơi. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Chuôq praaq palơq akan ađek: “Akóón pađiil, lóóm huuiq ưng akóón ơi payươh akóón. Nek vôôiq kơi yươh rauha.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Xók Ađó dyơq praaq, ve manưih tââq đong ưng manưih jư lêi đong gươl tơk móón kơi ađô: “Akóón pađiil amei ơi chêt. Óóq têêng panhok thêi dyơq.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Bơơi xók Chuôq Jê-su xâng paraaq ađek, Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Óóq kakhin; phaai ve lóóm huuiq giêl nek akóón n'niên e bâân paq.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Xók ơi vôôiq tơk leq đong, Ađó kah đóng ngaai mót palơq Ađó, chapiên Phi-e-rơ, Jang, Ja-kơ, palơq amêêq lơq ama ưng akóón paniên. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Dyóp ngaai maar nhiim kalau lơq tơm tadhưa taai akóón paniên, bơơi Ađó móón: “Óóq nhiim, taai akóón paniên yươq ơi chêt, hơq nek mơ bêch giêl.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Bơơi piđó kachang bhalưưk Ađó, taai n'nal nek akóón paniên ơi chêt. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Bơơi xong xók kadhâng têi akóón paniên, Ađó dhaloong karơ, kơi ađô: “Akóón ơơi, nek yuur aq.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ravaai ưng akóón paniên val lóóiq lơq ađó n'drươh yuur tơơt, hayơq Chuôq kayua đóng akóón paniên cha. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Akonh akan akóón paniên hêq lêi bhlơng, bơơi Chuôq Jê-su paraaq pató piđó kah chóóm truuih palơq manưih lââng leq tarnêêng đu ơi avaaih.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Xong xók dhaloong majêt bơơr sưưq-đô panhoom lóóiq, Ađó đóng leq piđó praan karơ lơq mataai raman lơh tabhơt nôôq abhưi lơq đóng payươh ka-ai, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />hayơq Ađó kayua piđó gluh vôôiq đóng truuih móón leq katiêk Yaang Pleng lơq đóng payươh manưih ka-ai. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Chuôq pató palơq piđó: “Óóq pei đââng marau marâ xók vôôiq kalơng — kah tarlââng, kah chadhung, kah beng, kah jêên — kung óóq pei đââng bơơr beq aau. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Adhi anó mót leq n'đó đong, phaai tơơt lóóiq dhiq ađek lơq nek tââq ađek yuur vôôiq. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />N'đó dhiq palââng kah pơh yaauq adhi anó, nek xók gluh tââq kanóón ađek, phaai tapiêh puui dhiq dyung adhi anó kơi paraaq pakah móón jơl lóóiq piđó.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Kơi ađek nek xók yuur vôôiq kalơng, nôôq môôn-đô vôôiq leq nôôq bhươl kanóón, truuih pachóóm taruuih liêm lơq payươh ka-ai dyóp leq.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Xók Hê-rôôt bhua katưưiq xâng leq dyóp rau tarnêêng xók vaaih, ađó lóng nhok karnóq, taai paraaq nôôq manưih móón kơi ađô Jang ơi tââq akan chêt mamông lóóiq, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />bơơi ve ngaai nek móón Ê-li ơi tabhral, bơơi sôôq lââng móón nek mưi nak kalóóng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih xók hanua ơi mamông lóóiq. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Bơơi Hê-rôôt móón: “Aku ơi têch akoq Jang, bơơi manưih ađô nek ngaai hơq aku xâng nôôq chiên kơi achêk leq ađó?” Hayơq ađó ađek tabâân lum Chuôq.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Xók nôôq sưưq-đô ơi val chô, piđó truuih lóóiq leq Ađó n'nal n'đơq tarnêêng piđó ơi têêng. Lơq xong xók đââng piđó ting vôôiq, Ađó tư róch chô leq mưi kanóón bâân đóók nek Bêêt-saai-đa. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Bơơi xók tanóói manưih bơk đâh n'nal kơi achêk, nek piđó vôôiq ting Ađó. Chuôq pơh yaauq piđó, kluôh pakah đóng piđó leq katiêk Yaang Pleng, lơq Ađó paq payươh nôôq manưih kơng bâân yươh. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Tangêi tââp habu blót, xók achêk, xók majêt bơơr sưưq-đô vôôiq tơk, piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Nhan Thêi kayua tanóói dhanuôr đóng piđó mót leq nôôq bhươl lơq xưưq xaang tóór ađôk, piđó ve chóóm tabâân dhiq tơơt dhêi lơq tarmông, taai dhiq ađôk, nôôq he xók tơơt dhiq m'pơng mưi dham kruung vơng.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Adhi anó phaai đóng piđó cha.” Bơơi piđó ââi: “Kah rau ve dhiq nôôq yi đu bơk lơh xââng beq beng lơq bơơr panong kadhóóng — môôiq nek nôôq yi vôôiq kơl tarmông đóng mơ ađek manưih dhanuôr ađô.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Ơi ve mơ xââng ngaan manưih padruuih.) Ađó praaq palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi: “Nek kayua piđó tơơt đóng cha ting kơi bhruq mơ xââng jêt chanak.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Piđó ting têêng kơi ađek, kayua luch manưih dhanuôr tơơt đóng cha. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Xong xók pei xââng beq beng lơq bơơr panong kadhóóng, chaling mat leq pleng, Ađó ma-ơ leq tarmông ađek, hayơq veh beng, pađơơp leq nôôq môôn-đô đóng chik nh'xóóng leq ganơr manưih dhanuôr. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Bhơt dyóp ngaai maar cha kabhôôq kajrê, lơq rau dhơơm dyơq xưa bâân chââih krong đóng piđó nek majêt bơơr jong beng lêêk.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók Chuôq Jê-su dyơq nhan gavơh panlei, nôôq môôn-đô biêh vôôiq mandrươh palơq Ađó, nek Ađó tamóh piđó kơi ađô: “Manưih dhanuôr móón aku nek ngaai?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Xók ââi bóóp, piđó móón: “Nek Jang Bap-tiit, dyơq đu lââng móón thêi nek Ê-li, bơơi đu lââng dyơq móón nek mưi kalóóng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih hanua mamông lóóiq.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Hayơq Ađó tamóh piđó kơơq: “Dyơq adhi anó móón aku nek ngaai?” Xók ađek, xók Phi-e-rơ ââi, ađó móón: “Thêi nek Yaang Paq Manưih ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="LUK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Bơơi đóng praaq pagat piđó, Ađó praaq pató kah chóóm chik truuih rau ađô leq ngaai, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />xók praaq kơi ađô: “Akóón Manưih phaai đơơp bơk rau jarnah, bâân nôôq takóh bhươl, nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih, lơq nôôq takóh pachóóm gani kah đươi, hayơq e bâân taleng, lơq tơk tangêi đu pe e mamông lóóiq.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq tabhơt piđó: “La ngaai kiêng vôôiq ting aku nek phaai lơơi ađêi kala, dyóp tangêi đuôl m'baang chatông ađêi lơq ting aku. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Ơi la ngaai kiêng paq parmông ađêi nek manưih achêk e bil parmông, hayơq la ngaai taai aku đơơp bil parmông ưng ađêi, nek manưih achêk e bâân paq ađó. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ơi mưi nak hau nek malơơi, xók ve luch hóng katiêk, bơơi lóóiq tư pahư môôiq tabil chênh ađêi kala? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Ơi la ngaai kachiit mat leq aku lơq paraaq ưng aku, nek Akóón Manưih e kachiit mat leq ađó ađek xók Ađó bhral kalóóng cha-iil tabah ưng ađêi, palơq ưng Ama lơq ưng nôôq dhơn pleng liêm tabah. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Bơơi alua, aku móón palơq adhi anó, ve bơơr pe nak kalóóng nôôq manưih xók dyương dhiq ađô, nek nôôq manưih lalua e yươq rau xâng akan chêt đóng tơk xók piđó lêi katiêk Yaang Pleng.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih mơ takóól tangêi xong tââq nôôq paraaq achêk, xók đââng Phi-e-rơ palơq Jang lơq Ja-kơ, Ađó vôôiq đơk leq bôôl đóng nhan gavơh. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Rau vaaih xók Ađó dyơq nhan gavơh, ađek nek moh mat ưng mat Ađó tadhơ n'tua kơi, lơq kun aau ưng Ađó nek vaaih brương bhóók chalóng. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Lơq tôôh, bơơr nak xók praaq chiên palơq Ađó, ađek nek Môôi-se lơq Ê-li, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />hơq piđó bâân pakah kalóóng cha-iil tabah, xók praaq leq rau đơơp chêt ưng Ađó, nek rau Ađó ravang têêng đóng tajaap paraaq dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Phi-e-rơ lơq nôôq manưih mađó palơq ađó biêh xók kuôq kiêng bêch, bơơi xók bhrang taach mat lóóiq, piđó lêi cha-iil tabah ưng Ađó lơq bơơr nak xók dyương palơq Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih xók bơơr chanak achêk yuur xooq tââq Ađó, Phi-e-rơ móón palơq Chuôq Jê-su: “Thêi ơơi, alua nek liêm đóng nôôq he tơơt dhiq ađô, nôôq yi ve chóóm têêng pe beq pơơq: mưi beq đóng amei, mưi đóng Môôi-se, lơq mưi đóng Ê-li.” (Ađó kah n'nal rarau xók praaq.) <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Bơơi xók ađó praaq kơi achêk, mưi garboq dhaluk bhral lơq dhuum piđó; piđó kakhin lêi xók piđó mót hót kalóóng garboq dhaluk. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Hayơq tââq kalóóng garboq dhaluk tar-auq dhariêng praaq, kơi ađô: “Ađô nek Akóón Aku, nek Manưih ơi bâân chââih. Phaai xâng Ađó.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Xók dhariêng ađek pat nek chapiên dyơq lóóiq mưi Chuôq Jê-su giêl. Piđó maar parngau bha-ip, lơq kah ngaai truuih leq dhơ dharau đu ađêi ơi lêi kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih leq tangêi tatun, xók piđó tââq bôôl dhaluônh, mưi tanóói dhanuôr bơk tơk lum Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Hayơq tôôh, ve mưi nak manưih tââq kalóóng ganơr manưih praaq karơ kơi ađô: “Thêi ơơi, nhan Amei ka-er đóng tơk akóón padruuih aku, ơi ađó nek akóón padruuih mưi ưng aku. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Lêi ni, mưi yaang kadhâng akóón paniên lơq akóón paniên buôn đóók treeh lalơu, hayơq ađó pakalơm akóón paniên tatrươih lơq tapô havi tââq bóóp. Ađó pamơ kah xooq tââq akóón paniên, bhiêk janah akóón paniên bhlơm bhlua. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Aku ơi nhan nôôq môôn-đô ưng amei kơi têêng piđó viêng paxooq ađó, bơơi piđó kah ve chóóm tating têêng.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Xók ââi, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Ayô, dhong nooi đu kah đơơp huuiq lơq chêt bil, aku e tơơt palơq nôôq pe lơq đơơp jruôn nôôq pe patơk mơ dyơq? Nek đââng akóón padruuih amei leq ađô.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />N'drươh xók akóón paniên tơk, abhưi dhađơm karơ ađó leq katiêk lơq têêng ađó vaaih tatrươih. Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su trêh yaang môôp lơq payươh akóón paniên, hayơq Ađó pajaau akóón paniên lóóiq leq akonh ađó. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Tabhơt maar bâân hêq lêi toom mataai raman gamak ưng Yaang Pleng. Bơơi xók dyóp ngaai dyơq hêq lêi leq dyóp rau tarnêêng Ađó têêng, nek Ađó praaq palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Adhi anó phaai lơơi nôôq paraaq ađô leq katór ađêi: Ơi Akóón Manưih ravang bâân tapajaau leq têi palââng.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Dhơ kơi ađek, piđó kah n'nal rau paraaq achêk lơq tarnêêng ađôk biêh pâng tapađơp palơq piđó, hayơq piđó kah chóóm n'nal ađó, piđó vil kah khin đóng tamóh Ađó leq paraaq achêk.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Tatun ađek, m'pơng piđó yuur vaaih tarkaai đóng lêi ngaai đu kalóóng nôôq piđó nek gamak tââm. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Bơơi ơi Chuôq Jê-su n'nal rau karnóq kalóóng lóóm piđó, nek xong xók đââng mưi nak paniên, Ađó patơơt akóón paniên achêk hót tóór ađêi, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />lơq móón palơq piđó: “La ngaai vơn achak aku pơh yaauq akóón paniên ađô, nek ađó ađek yaauq aku, lơq la ngaai yaauq aku, nek ađó ađek yaauq Yaang ơi kayua aku. Ơi ngaai đu nek katưưiq tââm kalóóng tabhơt adhi anó, hayơq ađó ađek nek gamak tââm.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Xók Jang yuur pei ââi, ađó móón: “Thêi ơơi, nôôq yi lêi ve ngaai vơn achak amei đuôi abhưi lơq nôôq yi ơi kajơq ađó ađek lóóiq, taai ađó ađek kah ting vôôiq palơq nôôq he.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Óóq chik kajơq, ơi ngaai đu yươq rau nek tajơl palơq adhi anó nek dyương hót adhi anó.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Tarnêêng ơi vaaih nek xók tangêi rau bâân padyók leq pleng ưng Ađó kiêng tơk đan, nek Ađó tabhlơng dhakơi đóng vôôiq tơk leq kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Ađó kayua nôôq manưih đââng paraaq vôôiq loom toom mat Ađó, lơq xók vôôiq, piđó mót leq kalóóng mưi bhươl ưng manưih Sa-ma-ri đóng ravang leq Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Palââng kah pơh yaauq Ađó taai karnóq ưng Ađó nek xók vôôiq leq Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Nôôq môôn-đô nek Ja-kơ lơq Jang, xók lêi kơi achêk, piđó móón: “Kakoh Chuôq, Amei ve kiêng nôôq yi kayua đóng óih tââq pleng dhuônh óch róh piđó kah?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Bơơi xong xók palâh lóóiq, Ađó trêh teng piđó, <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />hayơq piđó vôôiq leq kanóón lââng.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Xók piđó dyơq vôôiq dhiq kalơng, mưi nak tôôh móón palơq Ađó: “Aku e ting amei dhơ dhaleq amei vôôiq.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó ađek: “Axing ve bóng lơq achim pleng ve xaruh, bơơi Akóón Manưih kah ve dhiq bha-óóih akoq.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Ađó praaq palơq mưi chanak đu lââng: “Hêq ting aku.” Bơơi ađó achêk ââi: “Kakoh Chuôq, nhan đóng pheep aku chô tơp ama aku loom.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Bơơi Chuôq praaq palơq ađó ađek: “Nek lơơi nôôq manưih chêt tơp nôôq manưih chêt ưng piđó. Dyơq xók amei yuur vôôiq, nek truuih đuui katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Hayơq, mưi chanak đu lââng dyơq móón: “Kakoh Chuôq, aku e ting Amei, bơơi laloom tââm nek đóng pheep aku chô móón nôôq manưih kalóóng đong aku.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Bơơi kơi ađek, Chuôq Jê-su ââi: “Kah ngaai, xók ơi kadhâng têi ađêi leq kanei hơq dyơq lêi leq hót hóng, nek kah ađaang đóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Tatun nôôq tarnêêng achêk, Chuôq kung chaleq tapól jêt bơơr chanak đu lââng dyơq, lơq kayua piđó ting tabơơr vôôiq loom toom mat Ađó tơk dyóp leq kanóón lơq bhươl kanóón đu chênh Ađó ravang vôôiq. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Dhơ nil chaxóót alua pâng aviq, bơơi manưih đu xóót nek m'bưưiq bhlơng. Kơi ađek nek nhan gavơh Chuôq ưng nil chaxóót đóng Ađó kayua manưih xóót mót leq nil chaxóót ưng Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Nek yuur vôôiq. Lêi tôôh, aku kayua adhi anó vôôiq kơi trưưu akóón tơơt dhiq m'pơng kabhuh axing. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Óóq đââng chadhung jêên, chadhung vôôiq kalơng, jêi dheep, lơq óóq chik tamóh ngaai dhiq kalơng vôôiq. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />La n'đó đong adhi anó mót, laloom kơ phaai móón: ‘Yươq rauha leq đong ađô.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />La akóón ưng đu yươq rauha tơơt dhiq ađek, nek đu yươq rauha ưng adhi anó e tơk dhiq manưih achêk; dyơq la kah, ađó e val chô palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Nek bhiêk tơơt lóóiq kalóóng dhanong đong ađek, cha lơq ơm rau dhơơm đơơp tââq piđó, ơi manưih têêng makông ađaang bâân kông janaaq ađêi. Óóq xooq tââq đong ađô leq đong tôôh. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />La kanóón đu adhi anó vôôiq mót lơq piđó pơh yaauq adhi anó, nek cha rau dhơơm bâân dhoon leq adhi anó, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />nek payươh manưih ka-ai dhiq ađek, lơq praaq palơq piđó, ‘Katiêk Yaang Pleng ơi tơk đan palơq adhi anó.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Dyơq la kanóón đu adhi anó vôôiq mót hơq piđó kah đơơp pơh yaauq adhi anó, nek xong xók gluh leq nguôi kalơng ưng kanóón achêk, nek praaq: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Tơk mơ katiêk puui dhiq kanóón ưng nôôq pe bóq leq dyung nôôq yi, nek nôôq yi tapiêh pasek đóng kaauq patu nôôq pe! Bơơi phaai n'nal rau ađô, ađek nek katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng ơi đan.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Aku praaq palơq adhi anó kơi ađô palơq kanóón Sô-đôôm leq tangêi ađek, ađó e ađaang lơơi lơt lơh kanóón achêk. <verse eid="LUK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Ayô đóng amei, kanóón Kô-ra-xiin! Ayô đóng amei, kanóón Bêêt-saai-đa! Ơi la nôôq tarnêêng mataai raman, hơq piđó ơi têêng dhiq m'pơng nôôq pe, ơi bâân đóng vaaih tơk dhiq Ti-rơ lơq Si-đôôn, nek piđó lalua ơi klôôq lóóm lơt, xók tơơt dhiq bló puui palơq xơp aau mahaak tââq đươnh vaq. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Hayơq kơi ađek, e ađaang lơơi lơt đóng Ti-rơ lơq Si-đôôn kalóóng đu xêi xanêi lơh nôôq pe. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Dyơq amei, Ka-bê-na-um, ve kơq amei e bâân padyók tơk leq pleng? Amei e bâân bhlêh dhaluônh tơk leq maraaih. <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Manưih đơơp xâng adhi anó nek đơơp xâng aku, lơq manưih kah xâng adhi anó nek kah xâng aku, bơơi manưih kah xâng aku nek kah xâng Yaang ơi kayua aku.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Hayơq tapól jêt bơơr môôn-đô val chô palơq rau bhuui marhaal, móón: “Kakoh Chuôq, kalóóng achak Amei, patơk mơ nôôq abhưi kung bâân thua toom nôôq yi.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Bơơi Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Aku biêh ơi lêi Sa-taan tââq pleng n'tôq kơi kamlaaq. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Nek lêi, aku ơi đóng leq adhi anó kataai xanêi đóng đâq kadhaat dhiq kaxênh lơq agót, lơq dhiq dyóp rau kataai karơ ưng aróp brau, hayơq lalua yươq ve dhơ dharau ve chóóm têêng tabhrê adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Dhơ kơi achêk, óóq bhuui marhaal leq tarnêêng achêk, chênh nek tarnêêng nôôq yaang bâân thua toom adhi anó, hơq nek bhuui marhaal taai achak ưng adhi anó ơi bâân xaraq dhiq katiêk pleng.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Dhiq ganah bhêêl ađek, Ađó bhuui marhaal bhlơng kalóóng Chuôq Yaang Liêm, lơq praaq: “Kakoh Ama, nek Chuôq ưng pleng lơq katiêk, akóón bhi haanh Ama taai Ama ơi kadrêi palââp nôôq rau ađô tââq nôôq manưih tarbech galang lơq nôôq manưih bhriêl n'nal, hơq Ama vil pakah nôôq ađek đóng akóón paniên. Kakoh Ama, alua, ơi kơi ađek nek rau liêm kre toom mat Ama.” <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Dyóp rau tarnêêng ơi bâân pajaau leq akóón tââq Ama ưng akóón, kah ngaai n'nal Akóón nek ngaai chapiên Ama, lơq kah ngaai n'nal Ama nek ngaai chapiên Akóón lơq manưih đu hơq Akóón kiêng pakah đóng.” <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Hayơq xong xók palâh leq nôôq môôn-đô, Ađó praaq panlei palơq piđó: “Phươk đóng mat lêi rau đu adhi anó lêi. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ơi aku praaq đóng adhi anó n'nal kơi ađô bơk manưih đââng taruuih lơq bhua chuôq ơi rââm lêi rau đu adhi anó lêi, bơơi kah bâân lêi, lơq xâng rau adhi anó xâng, hơq kah bâân xâng.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Lơq tôôh, ve mưi nak pachóóm gani achêk yuur dyương tamóh đóng klêêu lêi Ađó, xók praaq: “Thêi ơơi, aku e bâân đơơp parmông taluôn luôn xók têêng hau rau?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Bơơi Chuôq praaq palơq ađó ađek: “Hau rau bâân xaraq kalóóng gani? Amei đok lêi ng'kơi?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Xók ââi bóóp, ađó ađek móón: “Akóón phaai nh'nhơr Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng ưng akóón palơq tabhơt lóóm ađêi, palơq tabhơt ravaai ađêi, palơq tabhơt praan ađêi, palơq tabhơt karnóq ađêi, lơq phaai nh'nhơr manưih đan tóór ưng ađêi pakơi chênh ađêi.” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Hayơq nek Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Amei ââi dhalam bhlơng. Phaai têêng kơi ađek nek amei e mamông.” <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Bơơi ơi kiêng tư paliêm ađêi bhơt liêm, ađó ađek ââi palơq Chuôq Jê-su: “Hayơq ngaai nek manưih đan tóór ưng aku?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Hayơq đóng ââi, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Mưi nak achêk xók vôôiq tââq kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem dhuônh leq kanóón Jê-ri-kô, hayơq ađó pâng tarlum têi kabhuh tatông papei, nek piđó pei n'drooih sek ađô ađó lơq xong xók m'bhiiq vei palâh palaang, kabhuh ađek yuur xooq, mak kơi ađó m'pơng mamông m'pơng chêt. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Tôôq tarlum, mưi takóh kadhâng bhanuôih achêk xók vôôiq dhuônh kalơng ađek, lơq xók chalaang lêi akonh ađek, ađó róch leq hót tôôh. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Kung kơi ađek, mưi manưih Lê-vi, xók vôôiq tơk leq ađô lơq lêi manưih bâân bhrê, ađó achêk kung róch hót tôôh. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Bơơi ve mưi chanak manưih Sa-ma-ri achêk, xók vôôiq kalơng, ơi tơk dhiq manưih bâân bhrê, lơq xók lêi, nek ađó vaaih lóóm kayô ka-er. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Xók ơi vôôiq pađan, ađó pươr đóng dham bhrê ưng manưih bhrê, xut dhơu lơq alak. Xong xók tơq manưih bhrê leq hóng axeh ưng ađêi, ađó đââng manưih achêk tơk leq mưi đong dhanêi lơq gamang đóng manưih ađô. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Leq tangêi tatun, xók pei bơơr đơ-ni-ê, ađó đóng leq kala mađong lơq pató: ‘Phaai gamang akonh ađek, lơq la amei phaai payươh gleh lơh dhơ dhakơi, nek xók aku val lóóiq, aku e chróót đóng leq amei.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Amei kanóq ngaai kalóóng pe nak ađek ơi xar manưih đan tóór palơq manưih bhrê bâân talum leq têi kabhuh tatông papei?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ađó ađek ââi: “Manưih ơi pakah lóóm kayô ka-er đóng leq manưih bhrê.” Kơi ađek nek Chuôq Jê-su yua ađó: “Amei nek vôôiq lơq têêng kơi ađek.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Xók piđó vôôiq dhiq kalơng, Chuôq Jê-su mót leq kalóóng mưi bhươl tôôh, lơq mưi pađiil achêk achak Ma-thê pơh yaauq Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Ađó ve adhi pađiil achak Ma-ri, tơơt dhiq dyung Chuôq Jê-su, tameng xâng paraaq Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Bơơi Ma-thê xók bhiêk gamang palơq bơk bhlơng tarnêêng ravang, hayơq ađó tơk móón: “Kakoh Chuôq, Amei kah lêi kơi adhi pađiil aku lơơi mưi aku têêng yaauq dhơq? Kơi ađek, nhan yua adhi aku, đóng ađó ve chóóm jóói aku.” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók ââi bóóp, Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Ma-thê ơơi, Ma-thê, amei karaang lơq nhok karnóq leq bơk rau tarnêêng, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />bơơi chapiên mưi rau tarnêêng nek kơng giêl. Taai Ma-ri ơi chââih phơn liêm, nek phơn e yươq rau bâân tapei paxooq tââq ađó ađek.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Chiên ơi vaaih xók Ađó dyơq nhan gavơh dhiq mưi dham achêk, xók Ađó nhan gavơh xong, mưi nak kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô móón palơq Ađó: “Kakoh Chuôq, nhan pachóóm nôôq yi nhan gavơh, kơi Jang kung ơi pachóóm nôôq môôn-đô ađó.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Xók adhi anó nhan gavơh, nek móón:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Kakoh Ama, nhan achak Ama bâân bhi liêm.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Nhan katiêk Ama bâân tơk.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Nhan đóng nôôq akóón tarmông dheng cha dyóp tangêi ưng nôôq akóón.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Nhan lơơi lơt nôôq akóón leq matu lơt ưng nôôq akóón,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">ơi nôôq akóón kung lơơi lơt đóng dyóp ngaai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">têêng lơt nôôq akóón.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Lơq óóq đóng nôôq akóón mót leq dharơơl galơơk.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Lơq Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Ngaai kalóóng adhi anó ve parjơơk, lơq m'pơng hayum vôôiq leq ađó ađek, hayơq móón palơq ađó achêk: ‘Parjơơk ơơi, đóng aku vaq pe beq beng, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />taai mưi nak parjơơk ưng aku tââq changaai tơk palơq aku, hơq aku kah ve rau đóng dhoon leq ađó achêk’? <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Xók manưih tôôh ââi lóóiq tââq hót kalóóng đong, ađó ađek ve kơơq móón: ‘Óóq têêng panhok aku. Palóng ơi takliêng aq, lơq nôôq akóón aku xók ađôk bêch dhiq dharââng palơq aku. Aku kah chóóm yuur pei đóng amei dyơq.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Aku móón palơq adhi anó, patơk mơ dhơ manưih achêk kah yuur pei beng đóng ađó tôôh taai nek parjơơk ưng ađêi, bơơi taai bhiêk nhan panhel ưng ađó tôôh, hayơq kung phaai yuur, manưih ađô e pei đóng ađó tôôh dyóp mơ beng ađó tôôh đươi. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Aku kung móón palơq adhi anó, phaai nhan, nek rau ađek e bâân đóng leq adhi anó; phaai chêk, nek adhi anó e lum; phaai takóq palóng, nek palóng e lóng đóng adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Ơi la ngaai nhan e bâân; ngaai chêk nek lum; lơq palóng e bâân lóng đóng ngaai đu takóq. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />N'đó manưih akonh kalóóng adhi anó, xók akóón ađêi nhan kadhóóng, hayơq manưih achêk đóng ađó akóón kaxênh klóóih nek kadhóóng? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Môôiq akóón nhan karau tưưch, hơq manưih achêk đóng ađó agót? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Hayơq kơi ađek, la adhi anó, biêh nek môôp, ơi n'nal nôôq kaliim liêm đóng leq akóón anaaq ađêi, hayơq Ama nek Yaang tââq pleng e đóng Chuôq Yaang Liêm leq manưih nhan Ađó bơk lơh n'nal n'đơq?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Ađó tame đuôi mưi panong abhưi kamoom. Hayơq kơi ađek, tarnêêng ơi vaaih xók abhưi ơi gluh xooq, manưih kamoom chóóm praaq, lơq ganơr dhanuôr lóng hêq lêi. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Bơơi bơơr pe nak kalóóng nôôq achêk móón: “Ađó ađek đuôi abhưi, ganơơm Bê-êên-xê-buun, nek chuôq abhưi.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Dyơq nôôq đu lââng, ơi đóng klêêu lêi Ađó, piđó nhan tââq Ađó mưi karnal chrih tââq pleng. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Bơơi taai ơi n'nal karnóq ưng piđó ađek, Ađó praaq palơq piđó ađek: “N'đó katiêk xók bâân tư tablah tư tarjơl lóóiq ađêi hayơq bâân têêng đóng hư tarơh, lơq dhanong đong tarjơl dhanong đong hayơq tarơh hachươp. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />La Sa-taan kung bâân tablah tư tajơl lóóiq chênh ađó, nek ng'kơi têêng katiêk ưng ađó ve chóóm mưng? Ơi nôôq pe móón aku đuôi abhưi ganơơm Bê-êên-xê-buun. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />La kơi aku đuôi abhưi ganơơm Bê-êên-xê-buun, nek ganơơm ngaai hơq akóón chachau nôôq pe đuôi abhưi? Ơi taai ađek, piđó e nek nôôq manưih xêi xanêi nôôq pe. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Dhơ kơi ađek, la aku đuôi abhưi ganơơm kabró têi ưng Yaang Pleng, nek katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng ơi tơk palơq nôôq pe. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Xók mưi chanak karơ mapraan bâân kadhâng bhươt kóóih dyóp jư lêi đong ađêi, nek karvaan ưng ađó achêk bâân yươq rauha, <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />bơơi xók mưi nak karơ lơh ađó ađek ruul đenh, nek manưih achêk đươk lơh ađó ađek, pei luch bhươt kóóih ưng ađó, nek rau đu ađó ganơơm leq, hayơq manưih achêk tablah kavaan n'drooih bâân tââq ađó ađek. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Ngaai đu xók kah tơơt palơq aku nek jơl lóóiq aku, lơq ngaai đu xók kah karong maleq palơq aku nek tachêh tavươk. <verse eid="LUK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Xók abhưi nhơơp ơi gluh tââq mưi nak, ađó vôôiq leq nôôq dhiq góh ka-iil chêk tabâân dhiq dhêi. Lơq xók kah tating chêk, ađó móón: ‘Aku e val chô leq đong aku, nek dham đu aku ơi gluh xooq.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Xong xók chô tơk, ađó lêi đong ơi bâân tapiih dhoon sek se lơq ralap rapaq kre liêm. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Xók achêk, ađó vôôiq lơq pajươk tapól abhưi đu lââng grâ lơh ađó ting mót mamông kalóóng đong ađô. Lơq kơi ađek xók tatun ưng manưih achêk val xar môôp lơh xók tanââp.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Chiên ơi vaaih xók Ađó dyơq praaq nôôq paraaq ađô, mưi manưih pađiil tôôh tââq bhlưa ganơr manưih yuur praaq, amooq móón palơq Ađó: “Phươk đóng luônh ơi đađââng amei lơq toh đu amei ơi mam.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Bơơi Ađó ââi: “Lalua nek, phươk leq ngaai xâng paraaq Yaang Pleng lơq pei jư.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Xók tanóói manưih dhanuôr n'dhương bơk lơh dyơq, Ađó tââp praaq: “Dhong nooi ađô nek dhong nooi đu môôp aak. Ađó chik chêk mưi karnal, hơq e kah ve karnal đu bâân đóng leq ađó chapiên mơ karnal ưng Jô-na. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Taai Jô-na ơi xar karnal ng'kơi đóng dhanuôr kanóón Ni-ni-ve, nek Akóón Manưih kung e nek karnal kơi achêk đóng dhong nooi ađô. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Kalóóng tangêi praaq xêi Bhua Pađiil Hót Charhóóng Hóng e yuur dyương palơq manưih ưng dhong nooi ađô, lơq kaauq lơt piđó, taai ađó ơi vôôiq tââq dhiq parluch ưng katiêk đóng xâng paraaq tarbech galang ưng bhua Sa-lô-môôn, lơq lêi nô, mưi Yaang bhi chap lơh Sa-lô-môôn dhiq ađô. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Kalóóng tangêi praaq xêi, dhanuôr kanóón Ni-ni-ve nek yuur dyương palơq dhong nooi ađô lơq e kaauq lơt ađó, taai piđó ơi klôôq lóóm toom paraaq pachóóm ưng Jô-na, lơq lêi nô, mưi Yaang dyơq bhi chap lơh Jô-na dhiq ađô.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Xong xók bat dhơu, kah ngaai patơơt ađó dhiq dham lââp, kung kah dhiq raraal thung kađôôq, bơơi lơơi dhiq dyung dhơu đóng dyóp ngaai bhadyaang mót ve chóóm lêi brương. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Par-aang dhơu ưng chak araang nek kaliêng mat ưng adhi anó. Xók mat adhi anó nek liêm, tabhơt chak adhi anó kung bâân bing bhlaai brương. Bơơi xók ađó môôp, chak araang adhi anó kung bing kanam. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ơi kơi ađek, nek chagơn, ve kơq brương kalóóng adhi anó nek kanam. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Kơi ađek la bhơt chak adhi anó bing bhlaai brương, yươq ve phơn đu kanam, nek ađó e bhơt brương chalóng, kơi xók dhơu klaaq brương adhi anó.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Hayơq, xók Ađó praaq xong, mưi manưih Pha-ri-si kayua Ađó kơi đóng Ađó ve chóóm cha vaar madhiq palơq ađêi. Xók ơi vôôiq tơk, Ađó tơơt leq baang chacha. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Xók lêi kơi ađek, manưih Pha-ri-si lóng hêq lêi taai Chuôq kah raau têi laloom xók ravang chacha. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Bơơi Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Xók ađôk, manưih Pha-ri-si nôôq pe raau hót nguôi li lơq choom, dyơq hót kalóóng nôôq pe nek bing rau đu n'thaam lơq môôp aak. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Nôôq manưih ngôôk tôôh! Kah alua Yaang ơi têêng hót nguôi kung têêng hót kalóóng hơ? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Dhơ kơi ađek, nek đóng nh'xóóng rau dhơơm dhiq hót kalóóng kơi tarnêêng liêm, lơq lêi ađô, dyóp rau nek sek tabah leq nôôq pe.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Dhơ kơi ađek, ayô đóng manưih Pha-ri-si nôôq pe, taai nôôq pe tapôông phơn majêt bak ha, dhaak thum lơq dyóp rau bhơơi kalóóng bhươn, hơq nôôq pe m'peq lơơi rau bhơt liêm lơq lóóm nh'nhơr Yaang Pleng. Bơơi kơng phaai têêng nôôq tarnêêng ađô, lơq kah chóóm m'peq lơơi nôôq tarnêêng tôôh. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Ayô đóng manưih Pha-ri-si nôôq pe, ơi nôôq pe kiêng tơơt dhiq tanơơt liêm tââm kalóóng đong gươl, lơq nôôq paraaq chap yayar m'pơng chơơq. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ayô đóng nôôq pe, ơi nôôq pe thê kơi ping ti dhiq booiq, lơq palââng kah n'nal xók tađâq dhiq piing.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Tatun ađek, đóng ââi lóóiq, mưi kalóóng nôôq takóh pachóóm gani móón palơq Chuôq Jê-su: “Thêi ơơi, thêi kung praaq môôp nôôq yi xók praaq kơi ađek.” <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Bơơi Ađó móón: “Ayô đóng kabhuh pachóóm gani nôôq pe dyơq! Ơi nôôq pe tagơơn leq palââng nôôq ganeng kah đuôh geng, dyơq chênh ađêi nôôq pe kah xuui mưi beq kabró ađêi leq ganeng ađek. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ayô đóng nôôq pe, taai nôôq pe têêng ping đóng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih, dyơq abhươp avuôq nôôq pe ơi leng chêt piđó. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Kơi ađek, nôôq pe truuih đuui lơq ting đươi tarnêêng ưng avuôq abhươp ađêi, taai piđó ơi leng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih, dyơq nôôq pe têêng ping. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kung taai ađek, rau tabech galang ưng Yaang Pleng praaq: ‘Aku e kayua nôôq manưih đââng taruuih lơq nôôq sưưq-đô tơk leq nôôq piđó, bơơi nôôq piđó e leng lơq janah bơk ngaai kalóóng sôôq piđó’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />đóng ahaam ưng tabhơt nôôq manưih đââng taruuih ơi n'toh tââq xók tââp vaaih pleng katiêk phaai bâân patu dhiq klaang đơơi ađô, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />tââq ahaam ưng A-bêên đóng patơk ahaam ưng Xa-cha-ri, nek manưih ơi taleng dhiq m'pơng baang bhanuôih lơq đong bhanuôih. Alua, aku móón palơq nôôq pe, ahaam achêk e bâân patu lóóiq tââq klaang đơơi ađô. <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Ayô đóng kabhuh pachóóm gani nôôq pe, ơi nôôq pe pei paxooq khanuôq ưng tarbech; chênh nôôq pe kah mót, hơq nôôq pe kajơq manưih lââng mót.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Xong xók Ađó gluh tââq ađek, nôôq takóh pachóóm gani lơq manưih Pha-ri-si nek tââp tajơl Ađó tabhlơng lơq tarkaai palơq Ađó leq bơk rau, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />tabâân xók đóng kaleh paxruuk Ađó leq bóóp praaq gluh tââq bóóp Ađó.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Xók bhêêl achêk, xók ganơr manưih bơk kaaq bhaan manưih karong madhiq lóóiq patơk mơ đâq grơl xóng ađêi, nek laloom tââm, Ađó tââp praaq palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi: “Nek chagơn jư ađêi kala tââq piêng ưng manưih Pha-ri-si, biêh nek paliêm hót nguôi. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Bơơi kah ve rau bâân kadrêi palââp hơq e kah bâân tapakah, môôiq palââp hơq e kah bâân palââng n'nal. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kơi ađek hayơq, la rau dhơơm đu adhi anó móón kalóóng kanam e bâân xâng dhiq brương, lơq rau dhơơm adhi anó kabââp dhiq katór kalóóng buông kiêr e bâân praaq pakah dhiq pabhung đong. <verse eid="LUK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Dhơ kơi ađek, aku praaq palơq adhi anó nek nôôq manưih parjơơk ưng aku, óóq kakhin nek manưih leng chêt chak araang, hayơq tatun ađek kah rau chóóm têêng lơh dyơq. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Bơơi aku e pakah đóng adhi anó n'nal phaai kakhin ngaai. Nek kakhin Yaang, xong xók ơi leng chêt chak araang, ve mataai m'peq palââng leq bóng óih. Alua, aku móón palơq adhi anó, nek kakhin Yaang achêk. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Eh alua xââng panong achim a-iih bâân baan palơq janaaq bơơr đông jêên hơ? Hơq yươq n'đó panong dhiq kalóóng nôôq ađek nek bâân lơơi havil dhiq toom mat Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Kơi ađek hơq xok dhiq akoq adhi anó patơk mơ ơi bâân yaap luch. Óóq kakhin: adhi anó ađaang janaaq lơh marchơng palơq bơk achim a-iih. <verse eid="LUK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Aku praaq palơq adhi anó la ngaai đơơp n'tóól aku toom mat palââng, nek Akóón Manưih e kung đơơp n'tóól ađó ađek toom nôôq dhơn pleng ưng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />dyơq ngaai dyiin aku toom mat palââng nek e bâân dyiin lóóiq toom nôôq dhơn pleng ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Lơq dhơ dhangaai praaq paraaq tajơl lóóiq palơq Akóón Manưih e bâân lơơi, bơơi palơq manưih praaq chôlô tơk Chuôq Yaang Liêm e kah bâân lơơi lơt. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Bơơi xók palââng kóóp đââng adhi anó leq nôôq đong gươl, kabhuh kadhâng akoq lơq nôôq đu têêng takóh, óóq karaang ađêi phaai paq ađêi kala ng'kơi môôiq hau rau, môôiq hau rau ađêi phaai papraaq, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />ơi kalóóng chênh jơ achêk, Chuôq Yaang Liêm e pachóóm adhi anó nôôq rau phaai praaq.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Tatun ađek, mưi nak kalóóng ganơr manưih móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, nhan kayua anó aku blah kavaan leq aku.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Bơơi Chuôq ââi palơq ađó ađek: “Amei ađek, ngaai kayua aku têêng takóh xêi xanêi môôiq manưih m'pơng blah kavaan đóng bơơr anhưa?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Phaai chagơn lơq jư ađêi kala tââq dyóp rau đu n'thaam, taai parmông ưng mưi nak eh rau dhiq xưa raai tââq kavaan ađêi.” <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Tatun ađek, Ađó truuih leq piđó mưi babi kơi ađô: “Dham hare ưng mưi nak kavaan tôôh liêm aviq, <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />lơq ađó tư kanóq dhiq lóóm kơi ađô: ‘Aku e hau têêng ađôk, ơi aku kah dyơq ve dham đóng kađôôq aviq dhong ưng ađêi?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Ađó móón: ‘Aku e têêng nô kơi: “Aku e rơh nôôq jơơng aku, kadhơng nôôq jơơng gamak lơh, lơq kađôôq leq ađek paluch haró aviq palơq nôôq ađô liêm ưng aku.” <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Hayơq aku e móón palơq ravaai aku: “Ravaai ơơi, amei ơi ve bơk kavaan kabhôôq lơơi koom đóng bơk kamó. Nek rathaai, cha, ơm lơq bhuui bhe.”’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Bơơi Yaang Pleng praaq palơq ađó ađek: ‘Manưih đu ngôôk tôôh, chênh hayum ađô ravaai amei e bâân tapei lóóiq, hayơq nôôq rau dhơơm amei ơi pasam e chô ngaai leq?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Manưih koom karong karvaan kabhôôq leq ađêi hơq kah ve kavaan kalóóng Yaang Pleng kung kơi ađek.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi: “Ơi taai ađek, aku móón palơq adhi anó, óóq karaang leq parmông ađêi, e hau cha — kung óóq karaang leq chak araang ađêi, e hau xơp n'đóh. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ơi parmông nek kiiq lơh tarmông, lơq chak araang kiiq lơh kun aau. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Nek lêi achim a-aak, ađek nek piđó kah chóói kung kah xóót, kung kah ve jơơng môôiq đong kađôôq đóng leq piđó, hơq Yaang Pleng ban piđó. Adhi anó kiiq lơh nôôq achim n'nal n'đơq! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Kơi lââng, ngaai kalóóng adhi anó, taai karaang, ve chóóm payaal kơơq đóng tangêi kaxe đơơi ađêi magamleh mat kah? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Kơi ađek, la adhi anó dyơq kah chóóm têêng chapiên mưi tarnêêng katưưiq katit achêk, nek hau adhi anó vil karaang leq nôôq tarnêêng lââng? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Phaai lêi leq pô dhalôôm — lêi piđó chat gamak ng'kơi. Piđó kah têêng nhưh, kung kah bhliiq hangươn. Bơơi aku praaq adhi anó n'nal, patơk kơi bhua Sa-lô-môôn, palơq tabhơt cha-iil tabah ưng bhua achêk, kung kah bâân xơp kun aau liêm kơi pô đu liêm kalóóng nôôq piđó. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Manưih đu m'bưưiq lóóm huuiq, la Yaang Pleng dyơq paxơp kơi ađek đóng leq pô bhơơi dhiq klung nek m'ma ađôk dyơq rayiiu m'peq leq óih, nek adhi anó dyơq liêm lơh n'nal n'đơq. <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Adhi anó óóq chik chêk hau ađêi cha lơq hau ơm, kung óóq karaang. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ơi dyóp dhanuôr dhiq hóng katiêk buôn chik chêk nôôq rau ađek, bơơi Ama ưng adhi anó ơi n'nal kơi adhi anó kơng nôôq rau ađek. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Dhơ kơi ađek, phaai chik chêk katiêk ưng Ađó, nek nôôq rau achêk e bâân đóng kơơq leq adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Kabhuh katưưiq ơơi, óóq kakhin, taai Ama ưng adhi anó bhuui lóóm đóng katiêk pleng leq adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Phaai baan kavaan ưng ađêi lơq nh'xóóng đóng manưih ngeeo. Phaai pasam đóng ađêi chadhung yươq bâân tanteek — nek kavaan yươq chóóm hư bil dhiq pleng, nek dhiq manưih tatông yươq chóóm pađan, gru kóót kung yươq chóóm pahư. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ơi drươp karvaan adhi anó n'dhiq tơơt nek lóóm adhi anó kung e tơơt dhiq ađek.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Tarveng ưng adhi anó phaai xeet lóóiq, lơq dhơu adhi anó phaai bâân jư đóng aang, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />lơq adhi anó phaai kơi nôôq manưih đu đương lêi kala ưng ađêi xók ađó val chô tââq bhiêk đaam, đóng xong xók tơk lơq takóq palóng, piđó n'drươh ve chóóm lóng đóng kala. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Phươk đóng nôôq dhơn ratơơq ađek nek nôôq manưih xong xók chô tơk, kala e lêi nôôq dhơn ratơơq dyơq blââk đương. Lalua, aku móón palơq adhi anó kơi ađô kala e xeet tarveng ađêi, lơq kayua piđó ađek tơơt leq baang chacha, hayơq kala pơh yaauq piđó xók vôôiq yaauq ting chanak. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Patơk mơ xók kala chô leq m'pơng hayum, môôiq patơk mơ leq đan brương, lơq kala ve chóóm lêi kơi ađek, nek phươk đóng nôôq dhơn ratơơq ađek. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Bơơi phaai n'nal kơi ađô, ađek nek la kala đong ơi n'nal n'đó jơ manưih tatông bhral, nek ađó lalua kah đóng đong ađêi bâân manưih tatông mót. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Adhi anó kung phaai ravang lơơi, taai jơ đu adhi anó kah ve n'nal, nek Akóón Manưih e bhral.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Hơq Phi-e-rơ tamóh: “Kakoh Chuôq, Amei truuih babi ađô đóng nôôq yi, môôiq kung đóng dyóp ngaai?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Lơq Chuôq ââi: “Hayơq nek, ngaai nek manưih jư lêi bhơt lóóm, tabech galang, nek manưih đu kala e pajaau đóng lêi dhiq piing nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng ađêi, đóng nh'xóóng phơn tarmông leq piđó xók pâng jơ? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Phươk đóng dhơn ratơơq ađek, nek manưih hayơq kala ađêi, xók vôôiq lêi, e lêi xók têêng pâng kơi ađek. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Alua, aku móón palơq adhi anó kơi ađô kala e pajaau dhơn ratơơq achêk kadhâng tabhơt drươp karvaan ưng ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Bơơi la dhơn ratơơq ađek praaq kalóóng lóóm ađêi, kơi ađô: ‘Kala aku dyơq đươnh ve chô,’ hơq tââp m'pah m'bhiiq nôôq dhơn padruuih lơq dhơn pađiil, n'drươh cha n'drươh ơm, vaaih ból plơ, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />nek kala ưng dhơn ratơơq achêk e chô tơk kalóóng tangêi hayơq ađó kah n'nal, alua, xók jơ đu ađó kah n'nal, lơq kala e m'bhiiq ađó gavar xar tapaleh, hayơq patơơt dham ađó đóng madhiq palơq nôôq manưih đu môôp huông. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Dhơn ratơơq ađek, nek n'nal karnóq kala ađêi hơq kah ravang môôiq têêng ting karnóq kala, e glêh tabhiiq bơk. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Bơơi dhơn ratơơq kah n'nal hayơq têêng tarnêêng ađaang taphaak e bâân tambhiiq m'bưưiq. Kơi lââng, ngaai, nek đu ơi bâân tađóng bơk, hayơq bơk rau e bâân nhan lóóiq tââq manưih ađek, lơq palơq ngaai ơi bâân pajaau đóng bơk, rau dhơơm e bâân nhan tââq manưih ađek lóóiq dhương bơk lơh.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Aku ơi bhral đóng m'peq óih leq katiêk, lơq aku hau rau rââm la ađó ơi bâân yuur róh aq. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Bơơi aku dyơq phaai đơơp mưi pheep bap-teem, lơq aku ka-ai karuôq n'nal n'đơq đóng tơk xók ađó bâân xong! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Adhi anó ngóq kơi ađô aku bhral đóng đââng yươq rauha leq hóng katiêk hơ? Eh rau, aku praaq palơq adhi anó, pâng lơh nek rau tablah. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ơi tââq ađôk, mưi parlóng đong e ve xââng chanak nek tablah xóng piđó — pe tarjơl lóóiq bơơr lơq bơơr tarjơl lóóiq pe. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Piđó nek tablah xóng piđó, akonh tarjơl lóóiq akóón padruuih, lơq akóón padruuih tarjơl lóóiq akonh, akan tarjơl lóóiq akóón pađiil lơq akóón pađiil tarjơl lóóiq akan, yaya tarjơl lóóiq akóón mamaai ađó lơq akóón mamaai tarjơl palơq yaya.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Hayơq Ađó kung praaq palơq tanóói manưih dhanuôr: “Xók adhi anó lêi mưi garboq dhaluk vaaih hót mat blót, adhi anó n'drươh móón kơi ađô: ‘Pleng bó ravang tơk,’ lơq tarnêêng vaaih pâng kơi ađek. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Dyơq xók adhiiq charhóóng hóng pruung, adhi anó móón kơi ađô: ‘E ve parang parđiêq,’ nek tarnêêng vaaih kơi ađek. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Kabhuh đu paliêm hót nguôi giêl! Adhi anó n'nal chik lók nôôq karnal ưng pleng lơq ưng katiêk, bơơi ng'hau adhi anó kah chóóm n'nal đóng chik lók ganah bhêêl xók ađôk? <verse eid="LUK 12:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Hau adhi anó patơk mơ kah tư ađêi kanóq xâng hau rau nek pâng? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Ơi n'drươh xók adhi anó ting vôôiq palơq manưih kaauq ađêi tơk leq takóh xêi xanêi, phaai têêng tabhlơng praan đóng praaq paliêm dyóp rau palơq manưih ađek xók dhiq kalơng, đóng m'bưưiq m'bâ palââng yươq galôôi adhi anó tơk takóh xêi xanêi, hayơq takóh xêi xanêi pajaau adhi anó đóng kabhuh linh, lơq kabhuh linh król adhi anó leq đong kanam. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Aku móón palơq adhi anó, lalua adhi anó e kah bâân gluh tââq đong kanam patơk xók adhi anó chróót luch đông jêên tatun.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Maphơn manưih ve mat leq xók ađek truuih lóóiq đóng Ađó leq nôôq manưih Ga-li-lê đu Phi-laat ơi pei ahaam nôôq manưih achêk kaluk palơq bhanuôih ưng piđó. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Xók ââi lóóiq, Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Nôôq pe ngóq kơi nôôq manưih Ga-li-lê achêk nek matu lơt lơh dyóp ngaai manưih Ga-li-lê đu lââng taai piđó phaai đơơp kơi ađek hơ? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Aku móón palơq nôôq pe, eh rau kơi ađek. Dhơ kơi ađek, la nôôq pe kah klôôq lóóm, nek paluch kung e bâân chêt bil kơi ađek. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Môôiq kơi majêt takóól manưih tôôh, hơq đong yaal dhiq Si-lô-ê ơi kalơm hachươp katơq lơq leng chêt piđó: Nôôq pe ngóq kơi piđó nek nôôq manưih matu lơt bhlơng lơh dyóp nak mamông dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem alua? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Aku móón palơq nôôq pe, eh rau kơi ađek. Bơơi la nôôq pe kah klôôq lóóm, nek tabhơt kung e chêt bil kơi ađek.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Hayơq Ađó truuih babi ađô: “Manưih achêk ve choh tââm tarung dhiq kalóóng bhươn nho ađêi, lơq ađó vôôiq chêk pale dhiq tââm n'lóóng ađek bơơi kah ve lêi. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ađó móón palơq manưih têêng bhươn: ‘Amei lêi nô, pe kamó tââq xók đu aku vôôiq chêk pale dhiq tââm tarung ađô hơq kah ve lêi. Nek kươl ađó vaq. Ơi hau rau taai hơq ađó patơk mơ padhêh katiêk kah malơơi?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Bơơi xók ââi lóóiq, ađó ađek praaq palơq kala: ‘Abhươp ơơi, nhan nek lơơi ađó lóóiq mưi kamó ađô kơơq dyơq, tơk mơ hơq aku ơi uôch katiêk xirvir ađó lơq bui mathuk. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />M'bưưiq m'bâ nek, leq tatun ađó ve chóóm bóóng pale … dyơq la lalua kah ve rau, e amei kươl ađó!’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Ađó xók truuih pachóóm kalóóng mưi đong gươl leq tangêi Sa-baat, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />lơq tôôh, mưi manưih pađiil bâân abhưi ka-ai bóq bhluuch majêt takóól kamó, ađó bâân vang hóng lơq kah chóóm dyương tapat đuôh. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Xók Chuôq Jê-su lêi akan ađek, Ađó kayua dhaloong hayơq móón palơq akan ađek: “Anó ơơi, anó ơi bâân pagluh tââq rau talum ka-ai dreh ưng amei.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Ađó lơơi têi dhiq akan ađek, n'drươh akan ađek yuur dyương tapat, lơq bhi haanh Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Bơơi xók manưih jư lêi đong gươl yuur praaq, ơi pagrâ taai Chuôq Jê-su ơi payươh kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat, hayơq ađó móón palơq ganơr manưih kơi ađô: “Ve chapat tangêi đu kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađô nek phaai matêêng. Ơi kơi ađek, phaai tơk payươh leq nôôq tangêi achêk, bơơi eh rau leq tangêi Sa-baat.” <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Bơơi Chuôq ââi lóóiq akonh ađek, lơq Ađó móón: “Kabhuh paliêm hót nguôi giêl! Kah alua leq tangêi Sa-baat dyóp chanak nôôq pe maar lêh tarlêi chanoq karók môôiq axeh ưng ađêi gluh tââq karól đóng keh ađó vôôiq ơm đơơk alua? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Dyơq manưih pađiil ađô, nek akóón pađiil ưng Ap-ra-haam, nek manưih đu Sa-taan ơi klooiq kadhâng, lêi tôôh, kalóóng bhluuch majêt takóól kamó, ađó ađôk kah kơng bâân paloh tââq et ađô leq tangêi Sa-baat alua?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Xók Ađó praaq nôôq paraaq achêk, dyóp ngaai đu jơl Ađó maar kachiit mat, dyơq luch tanóói dhanuôr bơk nek bhuui marhaal leq tabhơt nôôq tarnêêng chrih liêm bâân tatêêng taai Ađó.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Hayơq kơi ađek, Ađó móón: “Katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng nek thê kơi palơq hau rau, lơq aku e marchơng ađó palơq hau rau? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Katiêk achêk nek makơi mưi kaliêng habhêi đu mưi nak pei chóói kalóóng bhươn ađêi, hayơq ađó yuur gamak vaaih xar mưi tanââm n'lóóng, lơq achim pleng têêng đong dhiq đóóng ưng ađó.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Ađó vil praaq: “Aku e marchơng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng palơq hau rau? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Katiêk achêk nek thê kơi piêng đu mưi chanak pađiil pei karluk leq pe xanuk mun patơk xók mun yuur chơh.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Hayơq Ađó vôôiq leq nôôq charvaal lơq bhươl kanóón, n'dhương truuih pachóóm n'dhương bhiêk vôôiq kalơng tơk leq Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Xók achêk, mưi manưih tôôh tamóh Ađó: “Kakoh Chuôq, eh alua chapiên m'bưưiq manưih bâân paq?” Ađó ââi lóóiq piđó: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Phaai tabhlơng đóng vôôiq mót leq palóng kardyiên, taai aku móón palơq adhi anó n'nal, bơk nak e chêk tabâân đóng mót hơq kah bâân. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Xong xók kala đong ơi yuur dyương lơq kliêng palóng lóóiq, adhi anó hơq dyương hót nguôi lơq takóq palóng, dhaloong kơi ađô: ‘Kakoh Chuôq, nhan lóng đóng nôôq yi.’ Nek xók ââi lóóiq adhi anó, manưih kala e móón: ‘Aku kah n'nal nôôq pe, môôiq nôôq pe n'tââq bhral.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Xók achêk, adhi anó e pơơh bóóp đóng móón kơi ađô: ‘Nôôq yi ơi ơm cha toom mat amei, lơq amei ơi pachóóm dhiq nôôq kalơng kanóón ưng nôôq yi.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Bơơi kala đong e yuur praaq, móón palơq adhi anó: ‘Aku kah n'nal nôôq pe n'tââq bhral. Phaai xooq changaai tââq aku, tabhơt kabhuh têêng makông kah liêm tôôh!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Dhiq ađek, e ve nhiim griit lơq kakreet kaniêng xók adhi anó lêi Ap-ra-haam, I-saak, lơq Ja-kôôp, palơq tabhơt nôôq manưih đââng taruuih tơơt kalóóng katiêk Yaang Pleng, hơq kah ve adhi anó, ơi bâân m'peq leq nguôi. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Palââng e bhral tââq mat blo lơq mat bhlót, tââq hót lóóm lơq hót hóng, lơq piđó e tơơt cha bhiêk kalóóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Tôôh, ve nôôq manưih tơơt tatun hơq piđó e val xar laloom, lơq ve bơk manưih tơơt laloom hơq piđó e val xar tatun.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Leq chênh jơ ađek, nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si achêk tơk pađan, praaq palơq Ađó: “Nhan thêi yuur xooq lơq phaai xooq changaai tââq ađôk taai Hê-rôôt kiêng leng thêi.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Nek vôôiq, móón akóón kapuh chêk: ‘Lêi ađô, aku đuôi abhưi lơq têêng nôôq tarnêêng payươh tangêi ađô lơq rayiiu, hayơq mót tangêi đu pe aku têêng xong dyóp liêm.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Dhơ kơi ađek, palơq aku, rau đu liêm nek phaai bhiêk vôôiq kalơng tangêi ađô, rayiiu lơq tangêi tôôh, ơi palơq mưi manưih đââng taruuih, kah ve chóóm chêt dhiq nguôi kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Jê-ru-sa-leem, Jê-ru-sa-leem ơơi, amei leng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih lơq glơm dhơl nôôq manưih bâân kayua vôôiq leq amei. Ơi n'nal mơ chu aku kiêng panhoom akóón anaaq ưng amei lóóiq kơi đu atưưch akan oop akóón ađêi dhiq nanang, hơq nôôq pe kah kiêng. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Tôôh, đong ưng nôôq pe bâân tablah tââq nôôq pe. Aku móón palơq nôôq pe, nôôq pe lalua kah lêi aku patơk xók ganah achêk e tơk, nek xók nôôq pe móón: ‘Đaang bhi haanh Yaang tơk kalóóng achak Chuôq.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók Ađó vôôiq mót leq đong mưi manưih bhakôq ưng kabhuh Pha-ri-si kalóóng mưi tangêi Sa-baat đóng cha vaar, lơq piđó xók tameng chamet lêi Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Lơq tôôh, mưi nak achêk bâân ka-ai eh achak araang tơơt toom mat Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Xók pơơh bóóp, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq nôôq takóh pachóóm gani lơq manưih Pha-ri-si, kơi ađô: “Ve chóóm pheep payươh ka-ai kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat môôiq kah?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Bơơi piđó parngau parngiêt. Hayơq xók tơq manưih ka-ai, Ađó payươh manưih achêk, lơq đóng yuur chô. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Ngaai kalóóng nôôq pe ve akóón padruuih, môôiq mưi akóón karók, bâân n'tôq leq jiêng kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat hơq kah n'drươh ruiq ađó dyók?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Piđó kah chóóm kaai lóóiq toom nôôq praaq ađô.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Hayơq Ađó truuih leq nôôq tamóói bâân kayua mưi babi, ơi bâân lêi ng'kơi piđó ơi chââih nôôq dham tơơt bhi chap, hayơq móón palơq piđó kơi ađô: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Xók nôôq pe bâân ve ngaai kayua tơk bhiêk akóón manưih, óóq tơơt leq baang chacha dhiq dham yaal tââm, e kơi ve nh'jau ve mưi nak bhi chap lơh nôôq pe ơi bâân ađó ađek kayua, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Xók manưih ơi kayua adhi anó lơq tamóói tôôh vôôiq tơk, praaq palơq nôôq pe: ‘Nhan lơơi dham ađôk leq tamóói ađô,’ hayơq nôôq pe lalua nek phaai pei tơơt leq tatun palơq rau kachiit mat. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Palâh lóóiq, xók nôôq pe bâân kayua, nek vôôiq, tơơt leq baang chacha dhiq dham tatun, đóng xók manưih ơi kayua nôôq pe bhral, piđó e móón palơq nôôq pe: ‘Parjơơk ơơi, nhan đơk leq dham yaal lơh.’ Xók achêk, e ve bhi chap ravang đóng leq nôôq pe toom mat dyóp nak tơơt madhiq baang palơq ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ơi ngaai yuur payaal ađêi kala e bâân tabhlêh pa-êêp, lơq ngaai pa-êêp ađêi kala e bâân hayuur payaal.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Xong ađek, Ađó kung móón palơq manưih ơi kayua Ađó: “Xók amei yaauq cha dhơng môôiq cha blót, óóq kayua parjơơk amei, môôiq adhi anó amei, môôiq xóng anó amei, kung óóq kayua nôôq manưih dharing tapóóng kavaan, e kơi, piđó kung ve chóóm kayua lóóiq amei, lơq tarnêêng chróót yaauq vaaih tơk leq amei. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Palâh lóóiq, xók amei têêng bhiêk đaam, nek kayua nôôq manưih ngeeo ha-ul, arươp dyóói, khuch ke, kabaang kapôk, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />nek amei e bâân phươk, taai piđó kah đuôh chóóm chróót lóóiq leq amei. Taai phơn tachróót pachô e bâân ravang leq amei kalóóng rau mamông lóóiq ưng manưih bhơt liêm.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Xók mưi kalóóng nôôq manưih tơơt cha xâng nôôq paraaq ađô, ađó ađek móón palơq Chuôq: “Phươk bhlơng nek manưih e bâân cha beng kalóóng katiêk Yaang Pleng!” <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Bơơi Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Ve manưih achêk dhoon bhiêk gamak lơq kayua bơk tamóói. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Tơk jơ mót bhiêk, ađó kayua dhơn ratơơq ađêi vôôiq đóng móón tamóói ơi bâân kayua: ‘Nhan vôôiq nek taai bhiêk xók ađôk ơi ravang lơơi.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Bơơi tabhơt piđó ting chanah móón vơng. Manưih đu laloom móón palơq ađó: ‘Aku ơi kơl mưi dham hare, lơq aku ve kơng vôôiq lêi ađó. Nhan amei đóng aku kah bâân vôôiq.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Manưih đu lââng móón: ‘Aku ve kơl xââng kap karók, lơq ravang vôôiq pakei lêi piđó. Nhan amei đóng aku kah bâân vôôiq.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Manưih đu lââng dyơq móón: ‘Aku ơi pei kađiêl, lơq taai kơi ađek aku kah bâân vôôiq.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Dhơn ratơơq chô, truuih lóóiq nôôq tarnêêng achêk leq kala ađêi. Xók achêk, xong xók yuur pagrâ, manưih kala đong móón palơq dhơn ratơơq ađó: ‘Phaai pađâh vôôiq leq nôôq kalơng bhlơng bơk manưih lơq paleh katưưiq dhiq kalóóng charvaal hơq đââng chô nô leq nôôq manưih đu ngeeo ha-ul, dhuôr arươp, abhơơm kabaang lơq khuch ke.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Dhơn ratơơq móón: ‘Abhươp ơơi, nôôq yi ơi têêng rau amei pató, bơơi kung dyơq dham kagóh.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Kala móón palơq dhơn ratơơq: ‘Phaai vôôiq leq nguôi ting nôôq kalơng gamak lơq nôôq kalơng bhươl, hơq kayua palââng mót, kơi đóng bing đong ưng aku. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ơi aku praaq đóng amei kơi kah ngaai kalóóng nôôq tamóói bâân yua achêk e bâân ting tơơt bhiêk ưng aku.’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Xók achêk, nôôq ganơr manưih dhanuôr bơk bhlơng vôôiq ting Ađó, lơq xók palâh achak lóóiq, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“La ngaai tơk leq aku hơq kah geet akonh akan, kađiêl akóón anaaq, adhi anó, miing móóq ađêi, lơq luch parmông ưng ađêi dyơq, nek ađó ađek kah đuôh têêng môôn-đô ưng aku. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />La ngaai kah đuôl m'baang chatông ađêi hơq ting tapun aku, hayơq manưih achêk kah chóóm nek môôn-đô ưng aku. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Ơi ngaai đu kalóóng adhi anó kiêng têêng mưi beq đong yaal, hơq laloom kơ kah tơơt kanóq xâng jêên baak mơ — ađêi ve dyóp đóng têêng paxong môôiq kah? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Đóng e kơi, xong xók ađó achêk ơi têêng pariiq hơq kah đuôh chóóm paxong, tabhơt nôôq manưih đu lêi lalua nek kachang praaq paxê ađó ađek, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />praaq kơi ađô: ‘Ađó ađô tââp têêng hơq kah đuôh têêng paxong.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Môôiq n'đó bhua, xók ravang vôôiq tarleng palơq bhua lââng dhiq dham tarleng, hơq kah ve tơơt, laloom kơ kanóq lêi kơi la ađêi ve majêt ngaan linh, hayơq ve đuôh tajơl lóóiq palơq kabhuh linh xók bhral tarjơl palơq ađêi palơq bơơr jêt ngaan linh kah? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />La kah đuôh tajơl, nek xók bhêêl bhua tôôh dyơq dhiq changaai, bhua ađô kayua manưih đââng paraaq vôôiq nhan paliêm. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Hayơq makơi kơi ađek, ngaai kalóóng adhi anó hơq kah m'peq lơơi dyóp rau ađêi ve hayơq kah chóóm nek môôn-đô ưng aku. <verse eid="LUK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Abhóh nek malơơi, bơơi la abhóh kung bil đu kariêq, nek ađó e chóóm tamuôiq đóng kriêq palơq hau rau? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ađó kah ve rau malơơi leq katiêk kung kah đóng têêng katiêk mathuk. Palââng bhiêk m'peq ađó leq nguôi. Ngaai ve katór đóng xâng, nek xâng.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Xók achêk, tabhơt nôôq manưih pagoop jêên lơq manưih matu lơt maar pơh leq Ađó đóng xâng Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Lơq hayơq, luch manưih Pha-ri-si lơq nôôq takóh pachóóm gani maar m'bhoonh, móón kơi ađô: “Ađó ađô yaauq nôôq manưih matu lơt, lơq cha madhiq palơq piđó.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Kơi ađek nek Ađó truuih babi ađô đóng piđó, kơi ađô: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ngaai đu kalóóng nôôq pe ve mưi hariêng akóón trưưu, lơq xók bâân xraang bil mưi panong kalóóng sôôq ađek, nek kah lơơi lóóiq takiêh jêt takiêh panong tôôh dhiq kruung vơng lơq vôôiq chik chêk panong trưưu xraang đóng tơk xók bâân lêi ađó? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Xók ơi bâân lêi, ađó achêk bhuui marhaal đuôl trưưu dhiq chalaang ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Chô tơk đong, ađó achêk dhaloong parjơơk lơq dharing tapóóng ađêi krong lóóiq, móón palơq piđó: ‘Nek ting tabhuui palơq aku, taai aku ơi bâân lêi akóón trưưu đu bil ưng aku.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Aku móón palơq nôôq pe kung mưi kơi achêk, e ve bhuui marhaal dhiq pleng leq mưi manưih matu klôôq lóóm, lơh nek leq takiêh jêt takiêh manưih bhơt liêm hơq kah ve kơng klôôq lóóm.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Môôiq n'đó manưih pađiil ve majêt đông jêên, la ađó têêng bil mưi đông, nek kah bat dhơu, piih đong lơq tabhlơng chik chêk patơk xók bâân lêi? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Xók ơi bâân lêi, ađó đóng kayua nôôq parjơơk lơq dharing tapóóng krong lóóiq, móón kơi ađô: ‘Nek ting tabhuui palơq aku, taai aku ơi bâân lêi jêên baak đu aku têêng bil.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Kung kơi ađek, aku praaq palơq nôôq pe, ve rau bhuui marhaal dhiq toom mat nôôq dhơn pleng ưng Yaang Pleng leq mưi manưih matu klôôq lóóm.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Tatun ađek, Ađó truuih: “Mưi nak achêk ve bơơr panong akóón padruuih, <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />đu tadhi móón palơq akonh: ‘Ama ơơi, nhan đóng aku phơn karvaan chô leq aku.’ Lơq ađó blah karvaan ađêi leq nhiđó. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Tatun ađek, kah ve đươnh tangêi, xók ơi karong tabhơt dyóp rau, manưih akóón talóch yuur vôôiq leq xưưq changaai, dhiq ađek ađó ađek kơl cha jêên baak ađêi xók mamông kơi rahư. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Xók ađó ơi kơl sek dyóp rau, nek mưi garluh ha-ul cha gamak bhlơng yuur vaaih plok xưưq ađek, lơq ađó tââp bâân tabhuch ha-ul. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Hayơq ađó vôôiq têêng makông đóng mưi nak dhanuôr xưưq ađek, lơq kala kayua ađó gluh leq klung ưng ađó achêk đóng ban dhââk. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ađó marlóóch kiêng cha tââq n'đoh tơơq, nek rau kabhuh dhââk xók cha, hơq kah ngaai đóng ađó. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Bơơi xók kanóq leq ađêi, ađó móón: ‘N'nal mơ manưih têêng makông ưng ama aku ve tarmông xưa raai, bơơi aku ravang chêt króól dhiq ađô! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Xong xók yuur dyương, aku e vôôiq chô leq ama ưng aku, lơq aku e móón palơq ama kơi ađô: “Ama ơơi, akóón ơi matu lơt palơq pleng lơq toom mat ama. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Akóón kah ađaang chóóm đóók nek akóón ưng ama dyơq. Nhan lêi akóón kơi mưi nak têêng makông ưng ama.”’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Lơq xók ơi yuur dyương, ađó val chô leq ama ađêi. Bơơi xók ađó dyơq dhiq changaai, ama ưng ađó ơi chalaang lêi ađó lơq vaaih lóóm kayô ka-er, hayơq mut pađan, akonh pei kuôr tuôr ađó lơq chum ađó. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Xók achêk, manưih akóón móón palơq ama: ‘Ama ơơi, akóón ơi matu lơt palơq pleng lơq toom mat ama. Akóón kah ađaang chóóm đóók nek akóón ưng ama dyơq.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Bơơi akonh móón palơq nôôq dhơn ratơơq ađêi: ‘Nek pađâh đââng aau chaguôk liêm tââm paxơp đóng ađó, tapóón panóón leq têi ađó, lơq paxruk jêi leq dyung. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Nek kóóp karók akóón ramaq, leng paxêêt ađó, lơq nôôq he têêng bhiêk bhuui marhaal. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Taai akóón padruuih ađô ưng aku biêh ơi chêt hơq ơi mamông lóóiq, biêh ơi bil hơq ơi bâân chik lêi.’ Hayơq piđó têêng bhiêk bhuui yayar. <verse eid="LUK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Bơơi akóón padruuih taha ưng ađó dyơq tơơt dhiq klung, lơq xók chô, ađó chô đan tơk đong, xâng dhariêng tambhreh babóóch chaxuul, tantung yayaq. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Dhaloong mưi dhơn ratơơq tơk, ađó tamóh chiên ađô nek hau. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Manưih dhơn ratơơq móón palơq ađó kơi ađô: ‘Adhi padruuih amei ơi val chô lơq ama amei kayua leng paxêêt karók akóón ramaq ơi taai abhươp ơi kêch ađó achêk chô leq đong yươq rauha.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Dhơ kơi ađek, akóón taha pagrâ, ađó kah kiêng mót leq kalóóng, lơq akonh ađó gluh bhơơl pahêêl ađó. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Bơơi xók ââi lóóiq, ađó móón palơq ama ađêi: ‘Ama lêi, akóón têêng dhơn đóng ama bhluuch n'nal n'đơq kamó, lơq akóón yươq glêh kađiq praaq xêi ưng ama, hơq ama kah glêh đóng akóón mưi akóón beeq akóón đóng akóón ve chóóm cha đah palơq parjơơk akóón, <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Bơơi xók tadhươm akóón tôôh ưng ama val chô, nek panong ơi têêng pahư jêên karvaan ưng ama palơq kabhuh pađiil ban achak, nek ama ơi đóng leng paxêêt karók akóón ramaq leq ađó.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Kơi ađek hayơq akonh móón palơq ađó ađô: ‘Akóón ơơi, akóón taluôn tơơt palơq ama, lơq tabhơt rau dhơơm ưng ama nek ưng akóón. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Bơơi lalua kre pâng đóng têêng bhiêk lơq bhuui marhaal, ơi adhi padruuih ưng akóón ađô biêh ơi chêt hơq vil mamông, glêh xraang bil hơq ơi bâân lêi.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Ađó kung móón palơq nôôq môôn-đô: “Ve mưi nak kavaan tôôh nek manưih ve mưi nak jư lêi lơq ađó ađek bâân takaauq leq kala taai pahư jêên baak ưng kala. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Xók ơi dhaloong ađó ađek tơk, kala tamóh ađó ađek: ‘Chiên aku xâng leq amei nek ng'kơi dhơq? Phaai đóng paraaq pakah leq tarnêêng jư lêi ưng amei, ơi amei kah ve chóóm têêng jư lêi dyơq.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Kơi ađek hayơq manưih jư lêi tư tapraaq palơq ađêi kala: ‘Aku phaai têêng hau rau ađôk, taai kala aku xók ađôk tabil luch tarnêêng jư lêi tââq aku? Pók katiêk nek aku kah ve praan, chêk nhanhan nek kachiit mat bhlơng. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Aku n'nal rau aku phaai têêng đóng xók bâân tađuôi tââq tarnêêng jư lêi ađôk, palââng e yaauq aku mót leq đong ưng piđó.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Hayơq xong xók kayua dhaloong ting chanak mưi kalóóng nôôq manưih manơơq ưng kala ađêi, ađó ađek praaq palơq manưih đu laloom: ‘Amei manơơq kala aku n'đơq?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Manưih achêk ââi: ‘Mưi hariêng thung dhơu ô-liiu.’ Kơi ađek nek ađó ađek móón palơq manưih achêk: ‘Pei kadhâng bha-aar manơơq ưng amei, tơơt chok leq, pađâh xaraq xââng jêt!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Xong ađek, ađó ađek móón mưi nak lââng: ‘Dyơq amei manơơq mơ?’ Ađó ađô ââi: ‘Mưi hariêng baao aviq mi.’ Ađó ađek móón manưih achêk: ‘Kadhâng bha-aar manơơq ưng amei, lơq xaraq takóól jêt.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Manưih kala haanh manưih đu jư lêi kah liêm achêk, ơi taai ađó ađek ơi têêng tabech bhriêl bhlơng. Taai akóón anaaq ưng đơơi ađôk tabech bhriêl lơh machơng palơq akóón anaaq ưng brương kalóóng klaang đơơi ưng piđó. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Dyơq thêi móón palơq adhi anó, phaai têêng parjơơk đóng ađêi palơq jêên karvaan kah liêm, đóng xók karvaan achêk bhơt aq, piđó ve chóóm yaauq adhi anó mót leq đong nh'chró. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Ngaai đu bhơt lóóm kalóóng tarnêêng katưưiq bhlơng nek kung bhơt lóóm kalóóng tarnêêng gamak lơq ngaai kah liêm kalóóng tarnêêng katưưiq bhlơng nek kung kah liêm kalóóng tarnêêng gamak. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Taai kơi ađek, la adhi anó kah xar vaaih ađaang huuiq kalóóng karvaan kah liêm, ngaai e pajaau đóng adhi anó karvaan lalua? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Lơq la adhi anó kah xar vaaih ađaang huuiq kalóóng nôôq rau ưng manưih lââng, ngaai e pajaau đóng adhi anó nôôq rau chô leq chênh adhi anó? <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Kah n'đó dhơn ratơơq ve chóóm têêng yaauq bơơr kala, ơi dhơn ratơơq achêk e geet manưih ađô hơq nh'nhơr manưih tôôh, môôiq ađó e bhơt lóóm palơq manưih ađô hơq kađiq manưih tôôh. Adhi anó kah chóóm têêng yaauq Yaang Pleng lơq jêên baak karvaan kabhôôq chóóm.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Bhêêl ađek, nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si, nek nôôq manưih nh'nhơr jêên baak, xâng luch nôôq paraaq achêk, lơq piđó kachang jóóch Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Nôôq pe nek manưih tư đóók ađêi bhơt liêm toom mat palââng, bơơi Yaang Pleng n'nal lóóm nôôq pe. Taai rau bhi chap m'pơng akóón manưih hayơq nek rau xrơơm toom mat Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Gani lơq nôôq paraaq đââng taruuih nek patơk đơơi ưng Jang. Tââq ađek leq tôôh, katiêk Yaang Pleng bâân truuih đuui, lơq dyóp manưih tabhlơng bhadyaang vôôiq mót leq ađek. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Bơơi alua nek dhê lơh đóng pleng lơq katiêk val xar bil, dyơq lơh nek mưi kaliêng chư kalóóng gani val xar kah machak maraang.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Tabhơt ngaai đu talơơi kađiêl ađêi lơq nhan kađiêl lââng nek matu têêng tapiing, ngaai nhan manưih pađiil ơi bâân tarlơơi palơq kayiik nek kung matu têêng tapiing.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Ve mưi nak karvaan tôôh xơp n'đóh kun aau bhrôông pabhrơuq lơq kun aau palơq bhaai ramaanh liêm, dyóp tangêi, ơm cha bhuui kachang sương si. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Dyơq mưi nak ngeeo achêk achak La-xa-rơ, achak araang bing bhih m'peh, bâân đââng patơơt dhiq palóng kariing đong manưih karvaan, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />lơq rââm ve bâân cha tââq nôôq rau dhơơm ruuh tââq baang manưih karvaan. Dhơ kơi ađek, chapiên ve kabhuh anuq tơk liêh m'peh ưng ađó. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Hayơq tarnêêng vaaih ađek nek manưih ngeeo chêt, lơq ađó bâân dhơn pleng đââng tơk lóóm Ap-ra-haam. Tatun ađek, manưih karvaan kung chêt lơq ađó ađek bâân đââng vôôiq tơp. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Dhiq maraaih, xók tơơt dhiq kalóóng ka-ai karuôq, xók chaling mat ađêi, ađó ađek lêi Ap-ra-haam tââq changaai, palơq La-xa-rơ kalóóng lóóm ưng ađó. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Yuur karơ dhariêng lalơu, ađó ađek móón: ‘Abhươp avuôq Ap-ra-haam ơơi, nhan kayô ka-er akóón lơq nhan nek kayua La-xa-rơ đóng ađó ađek tuq chabô kabró têi ađêi leq đơơk lơq têêng đóng rangóói n'taak akóón, ơi akóón kuôq jarnah kalóóng óih ađô.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Bơơi Ap-ra-haam ââi: ‘Akóón ơơi, nek hei lóóiq kơi xók dyơq mamông ưng akóón, akóón ơi bâân đơơp phơn đu liêm ưng ađêi, lơq makơi kơi ađek, La-xa-rơ nek đơơp phơn jarnah. Bơơi xók ađôk ađó ađek bâân tabhơơl dhiq ađô, dyơq akóón phaai đơơp xâng ka-ai karuôq. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Lơq palơq tabhơt nôôq rau achêk, dhiq m'pơng nôôq yi lơq akóón ơi bâân tablah mưi harlaang dhơuq gamak bhlơng, đóng hơq ngaai đu kiêng vôôiq tââq ađôk tơk leq akóón nek kah chóóm, kung kah chóóm tââq ađek vôôiq tơk leq dham nôôq yi chóóm.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Kơi ađek nek manưih karvaan móón: ‘Abhươp avuôq ơơi, nek kơi achêk akóón nhan gavơh amei kơi amei ve chóóm kayua ađó ađek vôôiq leq đong ama ưng akóón — <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />ơi akóón ve xââng adhi anó — đóng ađó ađek trêh piđó, đóng kơi piđó kung óóq bâân ting dhaluônh leq dham jarnah ađô.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Bơơi Ap-ra-haam ââi: ‘Piđó ve Môôi-se lơq nôôq manưih đââng taruuih; piđó phaai ting xâng nôôq manưih achêk!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Dhơ kơi achêk, manưih karvaan ââi: ‘Eh rau kơi achêk, abhươp avuôq Ap-ra-haam ơơi, palâh lóóiq, la ve ngaai ađek tââq akan chêt tơk palơq piđó, nek piđó e klôôq lóóm.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Bơơi Ap-ra-haam móón palơq ađó ađek: ‘La piđó kah xâng Môôi-se lơq nôôq manưih đââng taruuih, nek dhơ ve ngaai ađek tââq kan chêt mamông lóóiq, piđó kung e kah huuiq.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Hayơq Ađó móón palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi: “Rau kah chóóm kah vaaih nek nôôq rau têêng đóng n'đóih lơt, bơơi ayô xangaat đóng ngaai đu hơq tââq ađó, nôôq rau têêng lơt vaaih! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Alua liêm đóng ađó achêk la kơi mưi tapal dhơl bâân tachauq praang tuôr ađó, lơq ađó bâân m'peq leq taxiiq liêm lơh nek đóng ađó têêng đóng n'đóih lơt leq mưi kalóóng nôôq akóón paniên ađô. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Phaai chamet jư ađêi kala! La mưi nak adhi anó ađêi matu lơt, phaai trêh teng ađó achêk; lơq la ađó achêk klôôq lóóm, nek lơơi lơt đóng ađó. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Dhơ ađó achêk matu lơt palơq adhi anó tơk tapól chu mưi tangêi, lơq tapól chu val lóóiq móón palơq adhi anó: ‘Aku klôôq lóóm,’ nek adhi anó dyơq e lơơi lơt đóng ađó!”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Nôôq sưưq-đô móón palơq Chuôq: “Nhan đóng kơơq lóóm huuiq leq nôôq yi.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Hayơq, Chuôq ââi: “La adhi anó ve lóóm huuiq makơi mưi kaliêng habhêi, nek kơi xók adhi anó praaq palơq tââm marlóóng ađôk kơi ađô: ‘Amei phaai bâân tarôôq lơq bâân tachoh dhiq taxiiq,’ hayơq ađó lalua nek phaai xâng bóóp adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Bơơi ngaai kalóóng adhi anó ve dhơn ratơơq vôôiq kei ruông môôiq jư trưưu tââq klung chô hơq vil yua ađó: ‘Vôôiq tơơt leq baang chacha n'drươh’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Klóóih dhiq ađek, eh dhơq manưih kala e móón palơq ađó: ‘Phaai dhoon vaar chana đóng aku cha, lơq xeet tarveng amei têêng yaauq aku xók bhêêl aku ơm cha, hayơq xong nôôq tarnêêng ađek, amei ve bâân ơm cha’ kah lua? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Manưih kala achêk kah pakah lóóm n'nal ơơn marau marâ palơq dhơn ratơơq taai ađó ơi têêng nôôq tarnêêng bâân pató kayua, pâng kah? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Adhi anó kung kơi ađek, xók adhi anó xong dyóp rau tarnêêng ơi bâân kayua đóng ađêi, nek móón kơi ađô: ‘Nôôq yi nek nôôq dhơn ratơơq kah ađaang. Nôôq yi ơi têêng xong rau ađêi phaai têêng.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók bhêêl dhiq kalơng vôôiq tơk leq Jê-ru-sa-leem, nek Ađó vôôiq pagan leq xưưq tarjaap bhlưa Sa-ma-ri lơq Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Xók Ađó mót leq mưi kanóón achêk, majêt chanak ka-ai tơơt bhơơi đương kêch Ađó, hơq piđó dyương tââq changaai <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />lơq piđó yuur dhaloong móón: “Thêi Jê-su ơơi, nhan kayô ka-er nôôq yi.” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Xók lêi piđó, Ađó móón piđó: “Nek vôôiq pakah ađêi leq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih.” Lơq tarnêêng vaaih xók bhêêl piđó vôôiq, nek piđó bâân sek. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Hayơq mưi nak kalóóng piđó, xók lêi kơi ađô ađêi ơi bâân yươh, ađó palâh val lóóiq, pakarơ dhariêng bhi haanh Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Ađó chip mat leq katiêk dhiq dyung Chuôq, ma-ơơn Chuôq. Ađó achêk nek mưi manưih Sa-ma-ri. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Kơi ađek nek, xók ââi lóóiq, Chuôq Jê-su tamóh: “Eh dhơq luch majêt chanak maar bâân sek alua? Dyơq takiêh chanak đu lââng n'leq vaq? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Hau kah rau lêi ngaai val lóóiq đóng cha-iil tabah leq Yaang Pleng chapiên mưi manưih dhanuôr katiêk lââng ađô?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Hayơq Chuôq praaq palơq ađó ađek: “Nek yuur dyương, lơq vôôiq, Lóóm huuiq ưng amei ơi payươh amei.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Xók bâân nôôq manưih Pha-ri-si tamóh n'đó bhêêl Katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng e bhral, Ađó ââi piđó, lơq praaq: “Katiêk Yaang Pleng kah ve chóóm bhral palơq rau chamet lêi. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Palââng kung e kah móón: ‘Lêi nô, dhiq ađô!’ môôiq ‘Tôôh chêq!’ Ơi, Phaai lêi nek, katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng tơơt dhiq kalóóng nôôq pe.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq nôôq môôn-đô: “E ve nôôq tangêi xók đu adhi anó rââm bâân lêi mưi kalóóng nôôq tangêi ưng Akóón Manưih, hơq adhi anó e kah bâân lêi. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Lơq palââng e móón palơq adhi anó: ‘Tôôh, dhiq tôôh!’ môôiq: ‘Nô, dhiq ađô!’ Óóq gluh vôôiq, kung óóq ting mut tapun piđó, <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />ơi kơi kamlaaq chaach tââq raal talaang pleng hót ađô blaach tơk raal talaang pleng hót tôôh, nek Akóón Manưih e kung kơi ađek. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Bơơi rau đu laloom tââm đóng Ađó nek đơơp bơk rau jarnah lơq kah huuiq tââq klaang đơơi ađô. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Kơi tarnêêng ơi vaaih ng'kơi kalóóng đơơi Nô-ê, nek ađó kung e kơi ađek kalóóng đơơi Akóón Manưih. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Palââng bhiêk cha, ơm, nhan, đóng, — patơk tangêi Nô-ê mót leq kalóóng bhuông, hayơq đơơk tuh lim tơk lơq leng luch dyóp rau. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Makơi ađek, kơi tarnêêng ơi vaaih kalóóng đơơi ưng Loot — palââng bhiêk cha, ơm, kơl, baan, choh chóói, têêng đong xaang, <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />bơơi xók tangêi Loot gluh tââq Sô-đôôm, nek bó óih lơq róh roong katiêk tââq pleng dhuônh óch, hayơq róh dyóp rau. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Tarnêêng e vaaih tơk ting kơi achêk kalóóng tangêi Akóón Manưih tabhral. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Kalóóng tangêi ađek, ngaai tơơt dhiq pabhung đong hơq karvaan ađêi dhiq kalóóng đong, nek óóq dhaluônh pei paxooq nôôq ađek; lơq makơi ađek, ngaai tơơt dhiq klung nek óóq val chô palơq rau dhơơm đu dyơq. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Phaai hei lóóiq kađiêl ưng Loot. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />La ngaai tabâân jư parmông ađêi nek e bil ađó, bơơi la ngaai lơơi parmông nek e bâân paq ađó. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Aku móón palơq adhi anó, xók hayum achêk, e ve bơơr chanak bêch madhiq dharââng. Mưi chanak e bâân tađââng vôôiq, dyơq chanak tôôh e bâân lơơi lóóiq. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />E ve bơơr nak tatap kalóóng madhiq dham. Mưi chanak bâân tađââng vôôiq, dyơq chanak tôôh bâân tachêq lóóiq.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />[Bơơr chanak dhiq klung, mưi chanak e bâân tađââng vôôiq, lơq chanak tôôh e bâân tachêq lóóiq] <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Lơq xók ââi bóóp, piđó móón palơq Ađó: “Chuôq ơơi, n'đó dhiq achêk?” Hơq Ađó móón piđó: “Xaak chêt n'đó dhiq, kêên kêên e kung prơu lóóiq dhiq ađek.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Hayơq Ađó truuih đóng piđó mưi babi đóng lêi rau đu chóóm đươi palơq piđó nek phaai taluôn luôn nhan gavơh, lơq óóq bhayuih lóóm, <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />kơi ađô: “Dhiq kanóón tôôh ve mưi takóh kadhâng xanêi achêk kah kakhin Yaang Pleng, kung kah bhi chap palââng. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Dhiq kanóón achêk ve mưi amooq kamaai, lơq amooq bhiêk tơk leq ađó ađek, móón: ‘Nhan xêi bhơt liêm đóng aku toom manưih brau aku.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Xók mưi ganah ađó ađek kah ve liêm lóóm, bơơi tatun ađek, ađó ađek tư móón palơq ađêi: ‘Dhơ aku kah bhi kakhin Yaang Pleng môôiq bhi chap ve ngaai, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />bơơi taai amooq kamaai ađô bhiêk têêng panhok leq aku, nek aku e xêi bhơt liêm leq amooq achêk, đóng amooq achêk yươq têêng panhok aku xók bhiêk val vôôiq patơk bhêêl xong tarnêêng ađô.’” <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Hayơq Chuôq praaq: “Phaai xâng paraaq takóh xêi xanêi kah liêm ađek praaq. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Kơi ađek nek, ve kơq Yaang Pleng kah têêng bhơt liêm đóng nôôq manưih bâân chââih ưng Ađó, nek nôôq manưih tangêi hayum nhan gavơh Ađó, hơq Ađó pajih pangaang palơq piđó? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Thêi praaq palơq adhi anó kơi Ađó e têêng bhơt liêm leq piđó kơi pađâh. Dhơ kơi ađek, xók Akóón Manưih bhral, Ađó lalua e bâân lêi lóóm huuiq dhiq katiêk kah?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Hayơq Ađó kung truuih babi ađô đóng leq maphơn manưih, nek nôôq manưih tư huuiq leq ađêi kala kơi ađêi nek bhơt liêm lơq kađiq manưih đu lââng: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Bơơr nak đơk tơk leq đong bhanuôih nhan gavơh — mưi nak nek manưih Pha-ri-si, lơq manưih tôôh nek manưih pagoop jêên. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Manưih Pha-ri-si dyương gavơh nhan nôôq paraaq ađô leq ađêi kala: ‘Kakoh Yaang Pleng, akóón ma-ơơn Amei taai akóón eh rau thê kơi nôôq manưih dyơq lóóiq — manưih tatông papei, manưih kah liêm, manưih têêng tapiing — môôiq patơk mơ kơi manưih pagoop jêên ađô. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Akóón drơng cha dyóp tun bơơr chu. Akóón tapôông phơn majêt dyóp rau akóón bâân.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Bơơi manưih pagoop jêên, xók dyương tââq changaai, patơk mơ kah khin chaling mat leq pleng, palâh lóóiq ađó tơm tadhưa ađêi, móón: ‘Kakoh Yaang Pleng, nhan kayô ka-er akóón, mưi manưih ve matu.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Thêi praaq palơq adhi anó, manưih ađô chô leq đong ađêi bâân đóók bhơt liêm eh rau manưih tôôh, ơi ngaai đu tư padyók ađêi kala e bâân tabhlêh pa-êêp, bơơi ngaai tư pa-êêp ađêi kala e bâân hayuur padyók.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bhêêl achêk, palââng đââng tơk mơ nôôq akóón paniên katưưiq tơk leq Ađó đóng Ađó lơơi têi dhiq piđó, bơơi xók lêi kơi ađek, nôôq môôn-đô trêh nôôq manưih ađek. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su dhaloong piđó lóóiq, praaq: “Phaai đóng akóón paniên vôôiq palơq aku, lơq óóq kajơq piđó. Ơi katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng chô leq nôôq manưih kơi ađek. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Alua, Aku móón palơq adhi anó, la ngaai kah pei đơơp katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng kơi mưi akóón paniên, nek manưih achêk lalua e kah bâân mót leq kalóóng ađek.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mưi manưih kuôn achêk tamóh Ađó, kơi ađô: “Nhan tamóh thêi bhơt liêm, aku e bâân đơơp parmông taluôn luôn xók têêng haurau?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su móón palơq manưih achêk: “Hau amei đóók Aku nek manưih bhơt liêm? Kah ngaai ve manưih bhơt liêm, chapiên mơ Yaang Pleng giêl. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Amei ơi n'nal nôôq gani pachóóm — óóq têêng tapiing, óóq leng manưih, óóq tatông papei, óóq praaq galơơk chachââr, phaai bhi chap amêêq ama ađêi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Bơơi ađó ââi: “Aku ơi jư têêng dyóp luch nôôq gani pachóóm achêk tââq xók dyơq paniên ưng aku.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók xâng kơi ađek, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó achêk: “Dyơq ve mưi rau dyơq thiêuq dhiq amei. Nek baan luch nôôq rau amei ve lơq đóng nh'xóóng leq manưih ngeeo, nek amei e ve drươp karvaan dhiq pleng — lơq nek tơk nô leq, vôôiq ting aku.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Bơơi xók xââng nôôq paraaq ađek, ađó ađek val xar ranguôq bhlơng, taai ađó kavaan bhlơng. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Hayơq xong xók lêi ađó, Chuôq Jê-su móón: “Nôôq manưih ve bơk drươp karvaan mót leq kalóóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng lalua kadhaap n'nal mơ! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ơi lalua nek dhê lơh đóng adhah kamel mót leq bóng jarum, marchơng palơq mưi manưih kavaan mót leq kalóóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Kơi ađek nek, nôôq manưih xâng kơi ađek, tamóh: “Kơi achêk ngaai ve chóóm bâân paq?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Ađó ââi: “Nôôq tarnêêng kah chóóm têêng palơq akóón manưih nek ve chóóm têêng palơq Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Hayơq Phi-e-rơ móón: “Thêi lêi, nôôq yi ơi lơơi dyóp rau hơq ting amei.” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Kơi ađek, Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Alua, aku móón palơq adhi anó kơi kah manak manâ ve ngaai đu ơi lơơi đong, kađiêl, adhi anó, akonh akan, môôiq akóón anaaq, ơi taai katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />vil nek manưih kah ve bâân đơơp bơk lơh kalóóng đơơi ađô, lơq kalóóng đơơi ravang tơk, nek parmông taluôn luôn.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Tatun ađek, xók ơi đââng panlei majêt bơơr sưưq-đô gluh, Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Ni, nôôq he xók vôôiq đơk leq kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem lơq dyóp rau ơi xaraq leq Akóón Manưih taai nôôq manưih đââng taruuih e bâân paxong. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Ơi Ađó e bâân tapajaau leq têi nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, bâân ajóóch, bâân têêng tamôôp, lơq bâân kathui kachoh. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Xong xók m'bhiiq Ađó, piđó e leng Ađó vaq, lơq tơk tangêi đu pe Ađó e mamông lóóiq.” <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Nôôq môôn-đô kah n'nal rarau nôôq paraaq ađô, lơq paraaq ađek biêh bâân palââp tââq piđó, hayơq piđó kah n'nal rau nôôq paraaq ơi bâân móón.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók Ađó vôôiq đan tơk kanóón Jê-ri-kô, mưi nak kabaang achêk xók tơơt nhanhan dhiq tóór kalơng. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Xók xâng dhariêng ganơr manưih bơk vôôiq lalơh, ađó tamóh xâng harau chiên đu vaaih. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Piđó đóng ađó n'nal kơi ađô: “Jê-su manưih Na-xa-reet ravang vôôiq hót ađôk.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Lơq hayơq ađó lalơu karơ, kơi ađô: “Jê-su ơơi, akóón bhua Đa-viit, nhan kayô ka-er aku.” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Nôôq manưih vôôiq laloom teng ađó, đóng ađó phaai parngau. Bơơi ađó bhiêk dhaloong karơ lơh dyơq: “Ơơi, Akóón bhua Đa-viit, nhan kayô ka-er aku.” <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Bhêêl achêk, xók ơi dyương lóóiq, Chuôq Jê-su kayua đââng ađó tơk leq Chuôq. Hayơq xong xók ađó tơk pađan, Chuôq tamóh ađó: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Amei kiêng Aku têêng haurau leq amei?” Kơi ađek nek ađó ââi: “Kakoh Chuôq, ađek nek đóng aku chóóm bâân lêi.” <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó: “Phaai chóóm lêi val lóóiq! Lóóm huuiq ưng amei ơi payươh đóng amei.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />N'drươh ađek, ađó chóóm lêi lóóiq lơq ađó vôôiq ting Chuôq, tapôông đóng cha-iil tampah leq Yaang Pleng. Xók lêi kơi ađek, dyóp ngaai maar tapôông paraaq bhi haanh Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Xók ơi mót leq kalóóng, Ađó vôôiq lalơh kanóón Jê-ri-kô. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Lơq nek lêi mưi nak, bâân đóók achak nek Xa-chê, ađó nek takóh kala kabhuh pagoop jêên, lơq ađó ađek kavaan kabhôôq. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Ađó tabâân chalaang lêi Chuôq Jê-su nek ngaai, hơq ađó kah chóóm bâân lêi tââq kalóóng ganơr manưih bơk, taai ađó ve dyaang chak êêp katưưiq. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Hayơq xók ơi mut tơk hót laloom, ađó dyók leq mưi tââm tarung đóng ađó ve chóóm bâân lêi Chuôq taai Chuôq kiêng đan vôôiq lalơh hót kalơng ađek. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Xók Chuôq vôôiq tơk dham achêk, chaling lêi, Chuôq Jê-su móón palơq ađó: “Xa-chê, nek dhaluônh pađâh, ơi mađôk aku phaai tơơt lóóiq dhiq đong ưng amei.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Kơi ađek nek ađó tarhươk tarhââm dhaluônh lơq bhuui marhaal pơh yaauq Chuôq. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Xók lêi kơi ađek, dhanuôr maar m'bhoonh, móón kơi ađô: “Ađó ađek mót tơơt madhiq palơq mưi manưih ve matu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Bơơi xók Xa-chê yuur dyương, ađó móón palơq Chuôq: “Kakoh Chuôq, nhan lêi ađô, aku blah m'pơng drươp karvaan ưng aku leq manưih ngeeo, lơq la aku ơi galơơk chachââr ngaai ve rau, aku chróót lóóiq lơh tapuôn chu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Xók achêk, Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq ađó kơi ađô: “Mađôk rau paq jóói ơi tơk leq đong ađô, taai ađó ađô kung nek akóón chachau Ap-ra-haam. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Taai Akóón Manưih ơi bhral đóng chik chêk lơq paq manưih đu chêt bil.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Dyơq xók piđó đương tameng xâng nôôq paraaq achêk, Ađó yuur truuih mưi babi, taai Ađó xók đan tơk kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem, hơq piđó ngóq nek katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng ravang bhral tơk aq. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Ơi kơi ađek, Ađó truuih: “Mưi đong karvaan achêk vôôiq leq xưưq changaai đóng chênh ađêi pei đơơp mataai karơ hayơq val chô. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Xong xók dhaloong majêt dhơn ratơơq ưng ađêi tơk, ađó pajaau leq piđó majêt mi-na lơq móón palơq piđó: ‘Nek buôn baan xók bhêêl aku vôôiq changaai.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Bơơi dhanuôr ưng ađó geet ađó lơq kayua mưi kabhuh manưih xal mat ting tapun ađó móón kơi ađô: ‘Nôôq yi kah kiêng manưih ađô têêng kala dhiq nôôq yi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók ađó val chô xong xók bâân đơơp mataai karơ, ađó kayua dhaloong tơk lum ađêi nôôq manưih dhơn ratơơq đu ađó ơi pajaau baak, đóng ađó ve chóóm n'nal piđó ơi têêng malơơi haurau tââq tarnêêng buôn baan. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Hayơq kơi ađek, manưih đu laloom tơk, móón: ‘Abhươp ơơi, mi-na ưng amei ơi bâân têêng malơơi majêt mi-na.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Kala móón palơq ađó ađek: ‘Dhơn ratơơq dhalam tapat, chóóm bhlơng. Taai amei ơi mưi lóóm kalóóng tarnêêng katưưiq bhlơng, hayơq amei nek kadhâng kataai dhiq majêt kanóón.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Hayơq manưih đu bơơr vôôiq, móón: ‘Abhươp ơơi, mi-na ưng amei ơi têêng malơơi bâân xââng mi-na.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Hayơq kala kung móón palơq ađó ađô: ‘Amei nek kadhâng koq xââng kanóón.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Mưi nak lââng tơk, móón: ‘Abhươp ơơi, nhan nek lêi mi-na ưng amei đu aku biêh jư, bâân ha-ơu kalóóng bhaai, <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />ơi aku kakhin abhươp, taai abhươp nek manưih kơi praaq kơi têêng. Abhươp pei tââq dham ađêi kah lơơi, lơq xóót tââq dham ađêi kah chóói.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Kala móón ađó ađek: ‘Ting kơi bóóp praaq amei, aku e praaq xêi amei, dhơn ratơơq đu aak. Amei n'nal kơi aku nek manưih kơi praaq kơi têêng, pei kalóóng dham aku kah lơơi, lơq xóót kalóóng dham aku kah chóói. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Hayơq nek ơi hau amei kah pagơơi baak ưng aku leq đong ha-ơu baak, đóng la xók val chô, aku kung pei lóóiq baak achêk palơq jêên malơơi?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Hayơq ađó móón palơq nôôq manưih xók dyương dhiq ađek: ‘Nek pei mi-na tââq ađó ađô hơq đóng leq manưih đu ve majêt mi-na.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Piđó móón palơq ađó: ‘Abhươp ơơi, ađó ađek nek ve majêt mi-na ơi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />‘Aku praaq đóng nôôq pe n'nal, ngaai đu ve nek bâân đóng kơơq, bơơi tââq ngaai đu kah ve, e nek tapei luôn luch rau đu ađó ve. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Dyơq nôôq brau ưng aku tôôh, nek nôôq manưih kah kiêng aku kađââng koq dhiq piđó, nek đââng piđó vôôiq leq ađô lơq leng chêt piđó dhiq toom mat aku.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Xong xók móón nôôq paraaq achêk, Ađó bhiêk vôôiq leq hót lóóm, đơk leq Jê-ru-sa-leem.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók Ađó vôôiq đan tơk Bêêt-pha-jê lơq Bê-tha-ni, dhiq m'bhââng bôôl nek bâân đóók Ô-liiu, Ađó kayua bơơr môôn-đô, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />móón kơi ađô: “Phaai vôôiq mót leq kanóón toom mat, xók mót leq kalóóng ađek, adhi anó e lêi mưi panong axeh akóón bâân tachoq, hơq dhiq axeh ađek kah ơi ngaai glêh dhââng. Xong xók lêh tarlêi choq ađó, nek đââng chô leq ađô. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />La ve ngaai tamóh adhi anó: ‘Ơi hau anhưa lêh tarlêi choq ađó?’ nek adhi anó e móón kơi ađô: ‘Chuôq ve kơng đươi ađó.’” <verse eid="LUK 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Hayơq nek, xók bơơr nak ơi bâân kayua yuur vôôiq, nhiđó lêi rau tarnêêng ting kơi Ađó ơi móón palơq nhiđó. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Xók nhiđó lêh tarlêi choq axeh akóón, nôôq kala axeh móón palơq nhiđó: “Hau anhưa lêh tarlêi choq axeh akóón?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Nhiđó ââi kơi ađô: “Chuôq ve kơng đươi ađó.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Hayơq nhiđó keh ađó đââng chô leq Chuôq Jê-su lơq xong xók bhalêêp aau chaguôk ađêi dhiq axeh akóón, piđó tơq Chuôq Jê-su dyók dhââng dhiq axeh. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Xók Ađó vôôiq lalơh, palââng bhalêêp aau chaguôk ưng piđó dhiq kalơng. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Xók Ađó ơi tơk đan leq bharđơk bôôl ô-liiu vaq, luch tanóói môôn-đô bơk bhlơng tââp driêu bhuui, makơi mandrươh dhariêng bhi haanh Yaang Pleng leq dyóp rau nôôq tarnêêng mataai raman đu piđó ơi lêi, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />kơi ađô: “Phươk đóng nek bhua bhral kalóóng achak ưng Chuôq! Yươq rauha dhiq pleng, lơq cha-iil tabah dhiq yaal bhơt yaal!” <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Maphơn manưih Pha-ri-si tââq kalóóng tanóói dhanuôr bơk móón palơq Ađó: “Thêi ơơi, nhan trêh móón nôôq môôn-đô ưng amei.” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Ââi lóóiq piđó, Ađó móón: “Aku praaq leq nôôq pe, kơi la piđó parngau nek nôôq kaliêng dhơl ađô e yuur driêu karơ.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Xók Ađó ơi tơk đan, xók chalaang lêi kanóón, Ađó nhiim leq kanóón, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />praaq kơi ađô: “La kơq amei ơi bâân n'nal kalóóng tangêi ađôk, lalua chênh amei phaai n'nal, rau dhơơm đââng tơk yươq rauha! Dhơ kơi ađek, piđó nôk xók ơi bâân palââp tââq mat amei. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ơi e ve tangêi vaaih tơk leq amei, nôôq brau ưng amei e bhơq garóóng xirvir amei, piđó e xavaang amei, lơq ruul đenh amei tââq dyóp hót. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Piđó e đenh bhlêh amei palơq akóón anaaq amei dhiq m'pơng amei. Hayơq piđó e kah châng mưi kaliêng dhơl đu dyơq tagơơn dhiq mưi kaliêng dhơl lââng dhiq dham amei, ơi taai amei ơi kah n'nal bhêêl amei bâân mót tham.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Hayơq xók mót leq đong bhanuôih, Ađó tââp đuôi luch nôôq manưih buôn baan dhiq ađek, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />móón palơq piđó: “Ve paraaq xaraq: ‘Đong Aku nek đong nhan gavơh,’ bơơi nôôq pe ơi têêng ađó xar ‘bóng gơơp ưng kabhuh tatông papei.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Dyóp tangêi Ađó bhiêk truuih pachóóm kalóóng đong bhanuôih. Dyơq nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih, nôôq takóh pachóóm gani lơq nôôq takóh kadhâng koq manưih dhanuôr biêh xók tabâân kơi leng Ađó, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />lơq piđó dyơq kah ơi bâân tarting kơi hơq piđó ve chóóm têêng, ơi tabhơt manưih dhanuôr maar tameng xâng Ađó.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Tarnêêng vaaih leq mưi tangêi tôôh, xók Ađó dyơq pachóóm manưih dhanuôr kalóóng đong bhanuôih lơq truuih Taruuih Liêm, nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih lơq nôôq takóh pachóóm gani palơq nôôq takóh bhươl vôôiq mót. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Piđó móón palơq Chuôq Jê-su kơi ađô: “Nhan đóng nôôq yi n'nal n'đó tââq kataai xanêi đu hơq amei têêng nôôq tarnêêng ađô, môôiq ngaai nek manưih ơi pajaau leq amei kataai xanêi ađô.” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Bơơi đóng ââi, Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Aku kung e tamóh nôôq pe mưi xayar, nek móón đóng aku: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Pheep bap-teem ưng Jang nek tââq pleng môôiq tââq akóón manưih?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Kơi ađek nek piđó tapraaq xóng ađêi, móón kơi ađô: “La nôôq he móón: ‘Tââq pleng,’ ađó ađek e tamóh: ‘Kơi ađek hau nôôq pe kah huuiq ađó?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Dyơq la nôôq he móón: ‘Tââq akóón manưih,’ nek luch manưih dhanuôr e glơm dhơl nôôq he, ơi manưih dhanuôr maar huuiq Jang nek manưih đââng taruuih.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Lơq hayơq piđó ââi kơi piđó kah n'nal nek n'tââq. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Aku kung kah đóng nôôq pe n'nal n'đó tââq kataai xanêi aku têêng nôôq tarnêêng achêk.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Hayơq Ađó tââp truuih babi ađô đóng manưih dhanuôr: “Mưi nak tôôh choh mưi bhươn nho, lơq đóng nôôq manưih choh nho vaq ađó, hayơq vôôiq tơk leq xưưq lââng kalóóng mưi ganah đươnh. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Tơk nil xóót leh, ađó kayua mưi dhơn ratơơq tơk palơq kabhuh choh nho đóng piđó e pagoop leq ađó pei tââq pale bhakó ưng bhươn nho. Bơơi xong xók m'bhiiq vei, kabhuh choh nho ơi đuôi ađó ađek chô têi kagóh. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Ađó dyơq bhiêk kayua mưi dhơn ratơơq lââng tơk, bơơi ađó ađô kung kơi ađek, piđó ơi đuôi ađó chô têi kagóh xong xók m'bhiiq vei lơq praaq tamôôp. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Hayơq ađó lóóiq kayua dyơq dhơn ratơơq đu pe tơk, bơơi kabhuh ađek kung m'bhiiq ađó ađek bâân bhrê, m'peq leq nguôi. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Hayơq nek, kala bhươn nho móón: ‘Aku ng'kơi têêng ađôk? Aku e kayua akóón padruuih nh'nhơr ưng aku tơk. Nh'jau, piđó e bhi chap ađó.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Bơơi xók kabhuh choh nho lêi akóón ađek, piđó tapraaq xóng piđó, kơi ađô: ‘Ađô nek manưih đơơp drươp karvaan. Nôôq he phaai leng ađó, đóng drươp karvaan ađô ve chóóm e xar ưng nôôq he.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Lơq xong xók m'peq ađó ađek gluh leq nguôi bhươn nho, kabhuh ađek leng ađó. Kơi ađek nek, kala bhươn nho e ng'kơi têêng palơq kabhuh ađek? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Ađó achêk e tơk leng luch kabhuh choh nho ađô lơq pajaau bhươn nho leq manưih đu lââng.” Xók xâng kơi ađek, piđó móón: “Nhan đóng chiên ađek óóq chóóm vaaih.” <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Bơơi xók lêi piđó, Ađó móón: “Kơi ađek, paraaq ơi xaraq ađô hau kơi kiêng móón: ‘Dhơl đu manưih têêng đong m'peq lơơi, chênh ađó vil xar dhơl n'tól đong’?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Ngaai đu n'tôq dhiq dhơl achêk e bâân lêêk chak. Dyơq la ngaai đu dhơl chêk n'tôq pâng, nek ađó e galiq lêêk glêi manưih ađek.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Lơq hayơq, nôôq takóh pachóóm gani palơq nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih tabâân kơi têêng paglêh palơq Ađó dhalam chênh jơ ađek, hơq piđó kakhin manưih dhanuôr, taai piđó n'nal kơi Ađó truuih babi achêk chaleq leq piđó. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Xók chamet lêi Ađó pagiit, piđó kayua nôôq manưih choop lêi tư têêng pathê nek bhơt liêm, đóng piđó ve chóóm tabâân kaleh Ađó dhiq bóóp praaq, hayơq pajaau đââng Ađó leq kabhuh kadhâng koq lơq kabhuh kadhâng dhanuôr ưng kuôn kadhâng xưưq. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Nôôq kabhuh ađek tamóh Ađó kơi ađô: “Thêi ơơi, nôôq yi n'nal ađek nek thêi praaq lơq pachóóm kơi đu dhalam tapat, yươq bhi kakhin ngaai, hơq thêi pachóóm kalơng ưng Yaang Pleng kalóóng paraaq dhalam. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Pagoop jêên leq Sê-sa nek rau phaai têêng palơq nôôq he môôiq kah?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Bơơi ơi n'nal rau lóóm chachââr ưng piđó, Ađó móón palơq piđó: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Đóng aku lêi mưi đơ-ni-ê. Ađó ve a-ô lơq achak ưng ngaai?” Piđó ââi: “Ưng Xê-xa.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Hayơq nek Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Kơi ađek nek, phaai pachô lóóiq leq Sê-sa rau dhơơm ưng Xê-xa, lơq leq Yaang Pleng rau dhơơm ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Piđó kah chóóm kaleh bóóp praaq achêk toom mat manưih dhanuôr, lơq taai hêq xâng toom paraaq ââi bóóp ưng Ađó, piđó maar parngau.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Tatun ađek, xók m'bưưiq manưih mađó kabhuh Sa-đu-sê vôôiq pađan, ađek nek nôôq manưih móón kơi kah ve rau mamông lóóiq, piđó tamóh Ađó <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />kơi ađô: “Thêi ơơi, Môôi-se ve xaraq đóng nôôq he, la anó ưng mak ngaai nhan kađiêl, hơq xók chêt, ađó achêk kah ơi ve akóón, nek manưih adhi ưng ađó achêk phaai pei kađiêl kamaai ađô lơq ve chóóm đóng tavaaih akóón patet dhong nooi đóng anó ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Hayơq, đong achêk ve tapól adhi anó padruuih, lơq xong xók pei kađiêl, anó padruuih ơi chêt kah ve akóón; <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />lơq manưih đu bơơr, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />hayơq manưih đu pe pei a-ai; bơơi bhiêk kơi ađek hơq tapól nak maar kah ve akóón, lơq chêt. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Xariêq ađek, manưih pađiil kung chêt. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Hayơq nek, kalóóng tangêi mamông lóóiq, pađiil achêk e nek kađiêl ưng ngaai kalóóng sôôq piđó? Taai luch tapól adhi anó maar ơi pei pađiil têêng kađiêl.” <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Chuôq Jê-su praaq palơq piđó: “Akóón anaaq đơơi ađôk nek pei kađiêl, pei kayiik. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Dyơq nôôq ngaai bâân đóók nek ađaang đơơp parmông taluôn lơq parmông lóóiq tââq akan chêt nek kah pei kađiêl kung kah pei kayiik. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Taai piđó kung yươq chóóm chêt dyơq, taai piđó e kơi dhơn pleng; lơq piđó nek nôôq akóón ưng Yaang Pleng, xók nek akóón anaaq ưng đu mamông lóóiq. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Dyơq leq tarnêêng manưih chêt mamông lóóiq nek dhalam kơi Môôi-se ơi đóng lêi dhiq tââm axông, xók ađó đóók Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng ưng Ap-ra-haam, Yaang Pleng ưng I-saak, lơq Yaang Pleng ưng Ja-kôôp. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Ađó eh rau nek Yaang Pleng ưng manưih đu chêt, hơq nek ưng manưih mamông, ơi tabhơt maar mamông palơq Ađó.” <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Hayơq xók nôôq takóh pachóóm gani ââi lóóiq, piđó móón: “Thêi ơơi, thêi móón pâng bhlơng.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Piđó kah khin tamóh Ađó paleh palâ dyơq.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Tatun ađek, Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Hau kơi palââng móón Chuôq Paq Manưih nek akóón Đa-viit? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Ơi kalóóng bha-aar Haanh Pleng, chênh Đa-viit ve móón:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Chuôq praaq palơq Chuôq aku kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">“Nek tơơt hót atươm Aku,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />đóng tơk bhêêl Aku têêng nôôq brau ưng Akóón xar parđâq đóng dyung Akóón.”’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Kơi ađek, Đa-viit đóók Ađó nek ‘Chuôq’, hayơq hau Ađó nek akóón ưng bhua achêk kơq?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Xók bhêêl tabhơt manưih dhanuôr dyơq tameng xâng, Ađó praaq palơq nôôq môôn-đô ađêi: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Phaai hêch lêi palơq nôôq takóh pachóóm gani, nek nôôq manưih kiêng xơp aau yaal chik lalêi, kiêng nôôq paraaq chap yayar dhiq kalơng chơơq, lơq nôôq dhiq tanơơt đu kre liêm kalóóng đong gươl palơq dhiq đu yaal tââm kalóóng đaam bhiêk, <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />hơq piđó lâân đong ưng nôôq pađiil kamaai, hayơq vil gavơh nhan payaal pađươnh đóng pakah palââng xâng. Nôôq manưih achêk e bâân taxêi matu lơt haleng lơh.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Xók ngơơq lêi, Ađó lêi nôôq manưih kavaan tapôông bhanuôih ưng piđó leq hôk đong bhanuôih. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Hayơq Ađó lêi mưi amooq kamaai ngeeo achêk tapôông leq ađek bơơr đông jêên katưưiq. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Lơq Ađó móón: “Alua, thêi móón palơq adhi anó kơi amooq kamaai ngeeo ađô ơi tapôông chrooq bơk lơh dyóp ngaai, <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />ơi dyóp nak tôôh đââng tapôông chrooq nôôq bhanuôih tââq rau xưa raai ưng ađêi. Dyơq amooq ađô, tââq đu ngeeo ha-ul ưng ađêi, ơi tapôông luch drươp karvaan đu amooq ve.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Xók nôôq manưih praaq leq đong bhanuôih, kơi đong bâân parcham paliêm palơq nôôq kalaat dhơl liêm kre lơq nôôq ađô đaak chik pagoop, nek Ađó móón: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Nôôq rau đu adhi anó xók lêi, e tơk tangêi đu mót bhêêl achêk, kah ve kaliêng dhơl e bâân lơơi tagơơn dhiq kaliêng dhơl lââng hơq kah bâân pakalơm.” <verse eid="LUK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Xók achêk, piđó tamóh Ađó kơi ađô: “Hayơq nek, thêi ơơi, n'đó bhêêl e ve nôôq tarnêêng ađek, lơq karnal hau xók nôôq tarnêêng achêk ravang vaaih?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Hayơq Ađó ââi: “Phaai chagơn đóng adhi anó óóq bâân galơơk chachââr. Ơi bơk nak e tơk vơn achak thêi, praaq: ‘Chênh nek Aku,’ lơq ‘Ganah marngi ơi đan.’ Óóq vôôiq ting piđó. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Mat lââng, xók adhi anó xâng leq tarleng lơq tarvei tarlak, nek óóq kapơn, ơi nôôq tarnêêng achêk phaai vaaih laloom, dhơ kơi ađek, rau xariêq kah ơi nek dhalam bhêêl ađek.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Tatun ađek, Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Dhanuôr ađô e yuur tajơl lóóiq dhanuôr lââng, lơq katiêk ađô jơl palơq katiêk tôôh. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />E ve dyơq nôôq dha-ơr katiêk gamak lơq bơk ha-ul króól, palơq bơk parluh dhiq bơk leq. E ve dyơq nôôq rau kakhin kapơn lơq nôôq karnal gamak tââq pleng. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Bơơi laloom dyóp rau achêk, palââng e hayuur têi ưng piđó dhiq adhi anó lơq e kóóp janah adhi anó, xók kóóp pajaau leq nôôq đong gươl lơq đong kanam, kóóp đââng adhi anó tơk toom mat nôôq bhua lơq kuôn kadhâng xưưq ơi taai achak thêi. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Rau ađek e xar xók bhêêl đóng adhi anó đââng truuih praaq. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Hayơq kơi ađek, nek phaai kanóq dhiq lóóm adhi anó óóq ravang đóng tư paq ađêi, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />ơi thêi e đóng leq adhi anó bóóp praaq lơq rau tarbech galang đu tabhơt kabhuh brau tarjơl adhi anó kah chóóm jơl lóóiq môôiq ââi kataar bóóp dyơq. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Bơơi adhi anó patơk mơ e bâân kóóp pajaau taai amêêq ama, adhi anó, kabhuh xóng lơq parjơơk, hayơq palââng e leng chêt masôôq manưih kalóóng adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Adhi anó e bâân dyóp nak dyââng lêi taai achak thêi. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Hơq mưi n'dreh xok dhiq akoq adhi anó kung kah ve bil. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kalóóng rau đuôh jruôn parngau ưng ađêi, adhi anó e bâân ravaai ađêi.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Bơơi la nh'xók adhi anó lêi kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem bâân taxavaang taai nôôq kabhuh linh, nek xók achêk phaai n'nal kơi rau rơh pahư kanóón ađô ơi đan vaq. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Xók ađek, ngaai kalóóng xưưq Ju-đê, nek klôôn leq bôôl, ngaai tơơt kalóóng kanóón, phaai yuur xooq, lơq ngaai tơơt dhiq ruông, óóq mót leq kalóóng kanóón. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ơi ađôk nek nôôq tangêi chróót đóng dyóp paraaq ơi xaraq bâân tajaap. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Bơơi, ayô đóng leq pađiil xók ve đađââng lơq nôôq pađiil xók đóng akóón mam kalóóng nôôq tangêi achêk! Ơi e ve bhrê hư gamak kalóóng xưưq, lơq pagrâ gamak n'toh dhiq dhanuôr ađô. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Piđó e kalơm chêt raal pla bhươt lơq piđó bâân takóóp tơk leq dyóp katiêk, lơq kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem e bâân nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng tađâq đóng tơk xók hơq ganah bhêêl ưng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng bâân dyóp.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />E ve nôôq karnal dhiq mat tangêi, mat kaxe lơq nôôq chatur xamenh, lơq rau nhok karnóq ưng nôôq dhanuôr tơơt dhiq katiêk kalóóng rau karaang kakhin taai dhariêng kariêh lalơu ưng taxiiq lơq ga-uul đơơk n'dhươi. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Palââng rangat taai kakhin kapơn lơq đương nôôq bhrê hư ravang n'toh leq dhanuôr dhiq katiêk, ơi nôôq mataai karơ dhiq pleng e dha-ơr dhakơp. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Tatun ađek, piđó e bâân lêi Akóón Manưih bhral jaq dhiq kalóóng garboq dhaluk palơq mataai karơ lơq tabah taklaaq gamak. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Bơơi xók nôôq tarnêêng achêk tââp vaaih, nek yuur dyương lơq ngơơq payaal akoq ađêi, ơi đu paq jóói ưng adhi anó nôk xók tơk đan.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ađó truuih leq piđó mưi babi: “Nek lêi tââm tarung lơq tabhơt n'lóóng póóih. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Mak xók piđó tame m'bhôk tamlóh, adhi anó n'nal, xók tư chamet lêi kơi nil hapaang ơi đan vaq. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Kung kơi ađek, xók adhi anó lêi nôôq tarnêêng ađô vaaih, adhi anó phaai n'nal kơi katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng ơi đan. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Alua, thêi móón palơq adhi anó kơi klaang đơơi ađô lalua e kah lơh đóng tơk xók dyóp rau tarnêêng tôôh vaaih. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Pleng lơq katiêk e lơh bil, bơơi nôôq paraaq ưng thêi lalua e kah ve chóóm bil.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Bơơi phaai chagơn leq ađêi kala, đóng lóóm adhi anó yươq bâân têêng đóng pahaleng kalóóng chiên ơm cha, ból plơ lơq nôôq karaang đơơi ađôk, patơk mơ tangêi achêk ve chóóm parmat biêng dhiq adhi anó <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />kơi biêng taglêh, ơi rau ađek e vaaih tơk leq dyóp nak mamông dhiq plok hóng katiêk. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Bơơi phaai meh lóóm xók dyóp bhêêl, nhan gavơh hayơq đóng adhi anó ve dyóp praan đóng jalơh tabhơt nôôq rau ravang vaaih ađek, lơq đóng dyương toom mat Akóón Manưih.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Kơi ađek nek xók tangêi, Ađó truuih pachóóm kalóóng đong bhanuôih, dyơq xók habu kanam, xong xók đơk leq bôôl nek đóók Ô-liiu, Ađó dhêi drơq hayum. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Lơq dyóp ngaai tơk palơq Ađó xók yayóng marư rư đóng xâng Ađó dhiq kalóóng đong bhanuôih.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Bhiêk Beng Kah Piêng, bâân đóók nek bhiêk Jalơh, ravang tơk đan. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih lơq takóh pachóóm gani chik tabâân ng'kơi hơq piđó ve chóóm leng Ađó, ơi piđó biêh kakhin manưih dhanuôr.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Hayơq Sa-taan jaq leq Ju-đa, ađó bâân đóók nek Ich-ka-ri-ôôt, dhiq kalóóng sôôq majêt bơơr sưưq-đô. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Lơq, xók ơi tơk lum, ađó tapraaq palơq nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih lơq takóh kadhâng akoq linh đong bhanuôih leq kơi têêng ađó ve chóóm pajaau Chuôq leq piđó. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Piđó yayar bhlơng lơq đơơp hươq đóng ađó baak. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ađó đâh đơơp lơq tabâân ve bhêêl pajaau Chuôq leq piđó xók kah ve mat manưih dhanuôr.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Hayơq tangêi bhiêk Beng Kah Piêng tơk, nek tangêi đu palââng phaai bhuôih trưưu akóón Bhiêk Jalơh. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Ađó kayua Phi-e-rơ lơq Jang vôôiq, pató: “Nek vôôiq ravang bhiêk Jalơh leq nôôq he, đóng nôôq he cha.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Piđó tamóh Ađó: “Thêi kiêng nôôq yi dhoon ravang n'đó dhiq?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Hayơq Ađó ââi piđó: “Ni, xók adhi anó ơi mót kalóóng kanóón, mưi chanak padruuih đơơq jraai đơơk e lum adhi anó. Phaai vôôiq tapun ađó achêk mót kalóóng dhanong đong đu ađó ađek vôôiq mót. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Lơq adhi anó e móón palơq kala đong: ‘Thêi tamóh amei: “Buông tamóói dhiq thêi ve chóóm cha bhiêk Jalơh palơq nôôq môôn-đô ưng thêi n'đó dhiq?”’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ađó achêk e chaleq đóng adhi anó mưi buông gamak dhiq gaak ve sam ađô đaak. Nek dhoon vaar cha dhiq ađek.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Kơi ađek, xók ơi yuur vôôiq, nhiđó lêi rau tarnêêng pâng kre kơi Ađó ơi móón palơq nhiđó. Lơq nhiđó dhoon ravang đóng bhiêk Jalơh.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Xók jơ chacha tơk, Ađó tơơt leq baang, lơq nôôq sưưq-đô tơơt madhiq palơq Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Palơq lóóm rââm, thêi ơi kiêng cha bhiêk Jalơh ađô palơq adhi anó laloom xók thêi đơơp janah. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ơi thêi móón palơq adhi anó, kơi thêi lalua e kah cha bhiêk ađô đóng tơk xók bhiêk achêk bâân paxong kalóóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Lơq xong xók pei choom lơq ma-ơơn, Ađó móón: “Nek pei đơơp choom ađô lơq nh'xóóng xóng ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Ơi thêi móón palơq adhi anó, tââq ađô tơk tabhêêl, thêi lalua e kah ơm pale nho ađô, đóng tơk xók katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng bhral.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Lơq xong xók pei beng lơq ma-ơơn, Ađó veh lơq pađơơp leq piđó, móón: “Ađôk nek chak araang thêi, taai adhi anó hơq pajaau đóng. Nek têêng rau ađô đóng hei leq thêi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Kung makơi kơi ađek palơq choom, xong xók ơi cha, Ađó móón: “Choom ađô nek raket tame kalóóng ahaam thêi, nek ahaam bâân n'toh taai adhi anó. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Dhơ kơi ađek, lêi tôôh, tapaang têi ưng manưih baan thêi ng'gââng leq baang madhiq palơq thêi. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Ơi dhơ Akóón Manưih vôôiq lơh ting kơi rau ơi bâân patơơt, bơơi ayô đóng ađó achêk, nek manưih hơq tââq ađó, Chuôq bâân pajaau tabaan!” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Piđó vaaih tââp tarkaai xóng ađêi manưih kơi ađek nh'jau nek ngaai kalóóng kabhuh piđó, nek manưih xók kiêng têêng tarnêêng achêk.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Hayơq, mưi praaq tarkaai kung vaaih dhiq m'pơng piđó leq ngaai đu kalóóng sôôq piđó bâân lêi nek gamak lơh. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Hayơq, Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Nôôq bhua ưng nôôq katiêk pei praan karơ têêng kala palââng, lơq nôôq manưih kadhâng koq dhiq dhanuôr bâân đóók nek ‘manưih đóng ơơn.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Bơơi palơq adhi anó nek kah chóóm kơi achêk. Klóóih dhiq ađek, manưih gamak tââm kalóóng adhi anó phaai val xar kơi manưih katưưiq tââm, lơq manưih kadhâng koq kơi manưih têêng yaauq. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ơi ngaai taha lơh, manưih tơơt chacha môôiq manưih đu têêng yaauq? Eh dhơq nek manưih tơơt chacha alua? Ađek hơq thêi tơơt dhiq m'pơng adhi anó kơi mưi manưih têêng yaauq. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Bơơi adhi anó nek nôôq manưih ơi đan griêq palơq thêi kalóóng nôôq hadhaap ưng thêi. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Thêi kung đóng leq adhi anó, kơi Ama thêi ơi đóng katiêk leq thêi, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />đóng adhi anó ve chóóm ting ơm cha madhiq baang ưng thêi kalóóng katiêk pleng thêi, lơq tơơt dhiq tanơơt hơq xêi xanêi majêt bơơr kabhuh dhong nooi ưng I-sơ-ra-êên.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Si-môôn ơơi, Si-môôn, lêi tôôh, Sa-taan ơi nhan óm halóóch amei kơi aviq. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Bơơi thêi ơi nhan gavơh đóng amei đóng lóóm huuiq amei yươq bil. Lơq amei, xók ơi palâh val lóóiq, nek têêng đóng nôôq adhi anó amei karơ.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Bơơi ađó móón palơq Chuôq: “Kakoh Chuôq, aku taluôn ravang ting vôôiq palơq Amei patơk mơ leq đong kanam lơq tơk dham chêt.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Bơơi Ađó móón: “Phi-e-rơ ơơi, thêi móón palơq amei, hayum ađôk atưưch gôông e kah takar laloom xók amei dyiin kah n'nal thêi pe chu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Xók thêi kayua adhi anó vôôiq óóq ting đââng chadhung jêên, chadhung, jêi dheep, adhi anó kah ve rau thiêuq, pâng kah?” Piđó ââi: “Yươq rau ve.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Hayơq Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Bơơi xók ađôk, ngaai ve chadhung jêên, nek pei vaq, lơq chadhung kung kơi ađek. Ngaai kah ơi ve bhươt, nek baan aau chaguôk ađêi hơq kơl. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ơi thêi móón palơq adhi anó kơi paraaq ơi bâân xaraq ađô phaai tajaap dhiq thêi: ‘Lơq ađó ơi bâân gróóp madhiq palơq nôôq manưih kah vaaih gani.’ Ơi lalua rau chaleq leq thêi phaai paxong.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Hayơq, piđó ââi: “Kakoh Chuôq, lêi ađô, dhiq ađôk ve bơơr pala bhươt.” Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Kơi ađek nek dyóp aq.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Xong xók ơi gluh, Ađó vôôiq tơk leq bôôl Ô-liiu kơi kaxu, dyơq nôôq môôn-đô kung ting tapun Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Xók ơi vôôiq tơk leq dham, Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Nek nhan gavơh đóng yươq mơk leq dharơơl galơơk.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ađó xooq changaai tââq dham piđó mưi gral mơ glơm mưi kaliêng dhơl, lơq chakoh takól, Ađó nhan gavơh, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />kơi ađô: “Kakoh Ama, la Ama kiêng, nhan patââi choom ađô tââq Akóón. Dhơ kơi ađek, eh rau karnóq Akóón, bơơi nek, nhan karnóq Ama bâân vaaih.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />[Mưi dhơn pleng tââq pleng bhral leq Ađó, poor praan đóng Ađó.] <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />[Tơơt m'pơng đu hadhaap jarnah, Ađó nhan gavơh bhơt lóóm, lơq karhơuq Ađó xar kơi nôôq katraq ahaam haruôi leq katiêk.] <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Xók yuur dyương tââq dham nhan gavơh, Ađó vôôiq tơk leq dham nôôq môôn-đô, Ađó lêi piđó xók bêch taai ranguôq. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Hau adhi anó bêch? Yuur meh nhan gavơh aq, đóng adhi yươq mơk leq dharơơl galơơk.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Xók Ađó dyơq praaq, lêi tôôh, ve mưi kabhuh manưih bơk lơq ađó bâân đóók nek Ju-đa, mưi kalóóng majêt bơơr sưưq-đô, đââng koq piđó. Ađó tơk pađan leq Chuôq Jê-su đóng chum Chuôq. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Bơơi Chuôq Jê-su móón palơq ađó: “Ju-đa, amei baan pajaau Akóón Manưih palơq mưi chanum alua?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Xók nôôq manưih xir vir Ađó bâân lêi tarnêêng ravang vaaih, piđó tamóh: “Kakoh Chuôq, nôôq yi ve chóóm đenh chróót palơq bhươt kah?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Mưi manưih achêk kalóóng sôôq piđó ơi m'preh dhơn ratơơq ưng takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm, lơq m'preh tatươt katór tươm ưng ađó ađek. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Bơơi ââi lóóiq, Chuôq Jê-su móón: “Nek lơơi mak kơi đóng chiên ađô.” Lơq xók kapat dhiq katór ađek, Ađó payươh đóng ađó ađek. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Tatun ađek, Chuôq Jê-su móón palơq nôôq manưih tơk kóóp Ađó, chênh nek nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih, nôôq takóh kadhâng koq linh đong bhanuôih, lơq nôôq takóh bhươl, kơi ađô: “Nôôq pe bhral palơq bhươt lơq bhaniiq kơi kóóp đu tatông? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Dyóp tangêi, xók aku tơơt madhiq palơq nôôq pe kalóóng đong bhanuôih, nôôq pe kah pei têi kóóp aku. Bơơi ađôk nek jơ ưng nôôq pe lơq kataai karơ kanam kanheet.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Hayơq, xong xók kóóp jư Ađó, piđó đââng vôôiq lơq đââng tơk đong ưng takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm. Dyơq Phi-e-rơ ting Ađó tââq changaai. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Xók ơi jrưưng mưi garboq óih dhiq m'pơng taang lơq tơơt karong lóóiq xóng piđó, Phi-e-rơ tơơt madhiq palơq piđó. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Xók achêk, dhơn ratơơq pađiil achêk, xók đóók lêi ađó tơơt tóór óih aang nek lêi li mrang leq ađó, pađiil móón: “Ađó ađô kung tơơt palơq manưih tôôh.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Bơơi ađó dyiin, kơi ađô: “Amei ađek, aku ve n'nal ađó ađek dhơq.” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Maxưưiq tââq ađek, mưi nak đu lââng, xók lêi ađó, nek móón: “Amei kung mađó leq kabhuh piđó.” Bơơi Phi-e-rơ dyiin: “Amei ađek, eh rau aku.” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Kơ mưi jơ ơi lơh, mưi nak đu lââng dyơq praaq tabhlơng kơi ađô: “Pâng nek ađó ađô kung tơơt palơq ađó tôôh, taai ađó ađek kung nek dhanuôr Ga-li-lê.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Bơơi Phi-e-rơ ââi: “Amei ađek, aku kah n'nal amei praaq hau rau.” N'drươh, xong xók ađó dyơq praaq, mưi tưưch gôông pei takar. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Chuôq palâh koq lêi Phi-e-rơ, lơq Phi-e-rơ hei lóóiq paraaq ưng Chuôq, ng'kơi Ađó ơi móón palơq ađêi kơi ađô: “Mađôk laloom xók atưưch gôông takar, amei e dyiin thêi pe chu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Lơq xók ơi gluh leq nguôi, ađó nhiim griit kơi ka-ai karuôq.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Nôôq manưih đương jư Ađó ơi praaq paxê, m'bhiiq vei Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Pươr mat Ađó lóóiq xong, kabhuh piđó padhơơch Ađó kơi ađô: “Paraaq taruuih loom n'nal! Ngaai nek manưih đu m'bhiiq amei?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Piđó praaq palơq Ađó bơk rau praaq chôlô lââng dyơq.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Xók pleng tââp brương, nôôq takóh bhươl kalóóng dhanuôr, dhơơm nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih lơq takóh pachóóm gani, ơi hoop lóóiq lơq piđó đââng Ađó tơk Kabhuh Takóh Xêi Xanêi ưng ađêi, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />móón: “La amei nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek móón palơq nôôq yi.” Bơơi Ađó móón palơq piđó: “La aku móón nôôq pe, lalua nôôq pe kah huuiq; <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />dyơq la aku tamóh, lalua nôôq pe e kah ââi. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Bơơi tââq ađôk leq tabhêêl, Akóón Manưih e tơơt hót tươm ưng Yaang Pleng mataai raman.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Xók achêk, piđó maar tamóh: “Kơi ađek, amei nek Akóón ưng Yaang Pleng kah alua?” Hayơq Ađó ââi palơq piđó: “Chênh nôôq pe xók móón kơi aku nek Yaang achêk.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Hayơq nek piđó móón: “Nôôq he dyơq kơng đươi praaq truuih harau dyơq? Taai chênh nôôq he ơi xâng tââq bóóp ađó.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Luch kabhuh piđó yuur dyương, đââng Ađó tơk leq Phi-laat. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Piđó tââp praaq kaauq Ađó, kơi ađô: “Nôôq yi lêi ađó ađô têêng pangôôk dhanuôr nôôq yi, kajơq pagoop jêên leq Xê-xa, lơq tư móón ađêi nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, chênh nek bhua.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Xók achêk, Phi-laat tamóh Ađó, kơi ađô: “Ve alua amei nek Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq eh?” Bơơi xók ââi ađó ađek, Chuôq móón: “Chênh amei móón kơi ađek.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Tatun ađek, Phi-laat móón palơq nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih lơq ganơr manưih; “Aku kah rau lêi matu aak marau marâ dhiq manưih padruuih ađô.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Bơơi piđó bhiêk praaq mưi kơi móón kơi ađô: “Ađó paxuq manưih dhanuôr, truuih pachóóm plok luch xưưq Ju-đê, tarnââp tââq Ga-li-lê patơk mơ leq ađô.” <verse eid="LUK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Xók Phi-laat xâng kơi achêk, ađó tamóh Chuôq ve alua nek dhanuôr Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Xók bâân n'nal kơi Chuôq tơơt raal kataai ưng Hê-rôôt, ađó ađek pajaau Chuôq lóóiq leq Hê-rôôt, chênh bhua kung xók tơơt dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem kalóóng nôôq tangêi achêk.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Xók Hê-rôôt lêi Chuôq Jê-su, ađó ađek yayar bhlơng taai ađó biêh ơi kiêng lum Chuôq tââq đươnh bhlơng, taai ơi xâng truuih leq Chuôq, hayơq ađó ađek rââm bâân lêi mataai chrih marau marâ bâân têêng tââq Chuôq. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Hayơq nek, ađó ađek tamóh Chuôq leq bơk rau xayar, bơơi Chuôq kah ââi lóóiq ađó marau marâ. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Dyơq nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih lơq takóh pachóóm gani dyương dhiq ađek tabhlơng kaauq patu Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Hayơq luch Hê-rôôt lơq nôôq linh ưng ađó ađek praaq kađiq Chuôq, lơq xong xók praaq paxê Chuôq, paxơp aau bhreh bhrel leq Chuôq, ađó ađek pagơơi taval Chuôq lóóiq leq Phi-laat. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Xók achêk, tââq Hê-rôôt lơq Phi-laat ơi vil xar parjơơk xóng nhiđó kalóóng tangêi achêk, ơi laloom ađek xók ve vaaih rau tageet tamôôp bhlưa bơơr nhiđó ađek.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Tatun ađek, xong xók Phi-laat đóng panhoom karong nôôq takóh kala kadhâng bhanuôih, nôôq kuôn gamak lơq dhanuôr, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ađó móón palơq piđó: “Nôôq pe đââng tơk leq aku manưih padruuih ađô kơi manưih pangôôk dhanuôr, lơq lêi ađô, xong xók tamóh ađó ađek toom mat nôôq pe, aku kah rau lêi kalóóng ađó ađô matu aak đu nôôq pe xók kaauq jơl lóóiq ađó ađek. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Bơơi eh rau chapiên kơi ađek, Hê-rôôt kung kah rau lêi, taai bhua ơi pajaau ađó ađek lóóiq leq nôôq yi, lơq lêi aq, kah ve rau ơi bâân têêng taai ađó ađek nek đaang chêt. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Taai kơi ađek, xong xók m'bhiiq ađó, aku e paloh.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />[Kơi lââng, leq dyóp ganah bhiêk, ađó ve praaq hươq phaai paloh mưi manưih matu leq piđó.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Bơơi piđó markơi mandrươh bóóp lalơu karơ, kơi ađô: “Phaai yông ađó, lơq paloh Ba-ra-ba đóng nôôq yi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Manưih ađô bâân takról dhiq đong kanam ơi ting têêng mưi chu panhôôn panhaauq achêk vaaih dhiq kalóóng kanóón bơk manưih lơq ơi matu leng manưih.) <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Xók achêk, Phi-laat praaq tamóh piđó machu dyơq, taai kiêng paloh Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Bơơi piđó dhaloong lalơu kơi ađô: “Nek teeng đinh! Teeng đinh ađó dhiq n'lóóng bang chatông!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Hayơq ađó ađek móón palơq piđó chu đu pe: “Ơi hau rau aak đu manưih ađô ơi têêng? Aku kah rau lêi matu aak rau chóóm chêt dhiq ađó ađek. Hayơq kơi ađek, xók m'bhiiq xong, aku e paloh ađó ađek.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Bơơi piđó bhiêk karơ dhariêng kah tadhơ nhan Ađó phaai bâân tateeng đinh, lơq dhariêng ưng piđó ơi jươi lơh. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Phi-laat ơi pakah praaq xêi đóng rau nhan ưng piđó bâân tatêêng. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Xók achêk, ađó paloh manưih bâân takról kalóóng đong kanam taai matu panhuh nhôôn nhaauq lơq leng manưih, nek manưih đu piđó ơi nhan, bơơi ađó ađek pajaau Chuôq Jê-su ting karnóq piđó.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Xók palââng đââng Chuôq vôôiq, taai ơi kóóp kayua Si-môôn, mưi manưih Si-reen achêk, tơk tââq bhươl kanóón, hayơq piđó tabóq n'lóóng baang chatông leq ađó achêk đóng đơơq ting tapun Chuôq Jê-su.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Mưi tanóói dhanuôr bơk bhlơng ting tapun Chuôq, lơq nôôq manưih pađiil nhiim kalau leq Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Bơơi xók palâh lêi piđó, Chuôq Jê-su praaq: “Akóón pađiil Jê-ru-sa-leem ơơi, óóq nhiim taai aku, bơơi nek, phaai nhiim taai chênh ađêi lơq taai akóón anaaq nôôq pe. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ơi lêi nô, nôôq tangêi ravang tơk, hơq kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek, palââng e móón: ‘Phươk đóng pađiil kah pabhaq, lơq luônh kah makóón, lơq toh kah đóng mam.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Xók achêk, palââng e tââp móón palơq nôôq bôôl dhơl, ‘Hakơh katơq nôôq yi,’ lơq palơq nôôq bôôl yaal, ‘Nek buur tơp nôôq yi.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ơi la palââng têêng kơi ađek dhiq n'lóóng dyơq taviêng, nek hau tarnêêng vaaih dhiq n'lóóng rang?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Xók achêk, bơơr nak matu lââng kung bâân takóóp đââng đóng đơơp leng madhiq palơq Ađó.<verse eid="LUK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Xók piđó vôôiq tơk leq dham nek bâân đóók “Paliing Akoq,” nek piđó teeng đinh Ađó dhiq ađek, palơq bơơr chanak matu lơt — mưi nak hót atươm dyơq mưi nak hót ađaai. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Hayơq piđó padhơơch nh'xóóng xóng piđó aau ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Manưih dhanuôr dyương dhiq ađek ting đương lêi, hayơq kabhuh đu kadhâng koq dhanuôr nek praaq paxê Ađó, kơi ađô: “Ađó ơi paq manưih đu lââng, nek tư paq ađêi kala, la kơi ađó nek Yaang Paq Manưih ưng Yaang Pleng, Yaang bâân Ađó chââih.” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Kabhuh linh kung praaq paxê Ađó, vôôiq pađan pađơơp đơơk kadyuôq leq Ađó, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />hayơq móón: “La amei nek Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq nek mơq tư paq ađêi kala.” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Hót piing Ađó kung ve mưi kalơng chư: “Ađô nek Bhua dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Mưi nak kalóóng bơơr nak manưih matu xók pâng tayông kung praaq paxê Ađó, kơi ađô: “Amei eh dhơq Chuôq Paq Manưih alua? Phaai tư paq ađêi kala lơq nôôq yi dyơq.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Bơơi xók ââi lóóiq, manưih matu tôôh trêh ađó, ađó ađek móón: “Amei dyơq kah n'nal kakhin Yaang Pleng xók amei ting đơơp palơq mưi phanaak alua? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Dhơ bơơr nhang kơi ađô nek pâng, taai bơơr nhang xók đơơp lóóiq rau ađaang palơq tarnêêng ađêi ơi têêng, bơơi manưih ađô kah têêng marau marâ lơt.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Lơq ađó ađek móón: “Thêi Jê-su, xók thêi mót leq kalóóng katiêk amei, nhan hei tơk aku.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Chuôq móón ađó: “Alua, aku móón palơq amei mađôk amei e bâân tơơt palơq aku kalóóng Ba-ra-đi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Xók achêk nek leq meen jơ đu chapat vaq, hơq kanam kanheet blo dhuum klum plok xưưq đóng tơk jơ đu takiêh. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Mat tangêi nek yuur kanam. Hayơq bhaai yoong kalóóng đong bhanuôih bâân taheek têêng bơơr. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Xong xók lalơu karơ dhariêng, Chuôq Jê-su móón: “Kakoh Ama, Akóón pajaau ravaai Akóón kalóóng têi Ama.” Tatun ađek, xók praaq luch paraaq ađô, Ađó pat parhââm xariêq. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Xók achêk, xong xók linh têêng koq lêi tarnêêng ơi vaaih, ađó bhi haanh Yaang Pleng, kơi ađô: “Manưih ađô lalua nek bhơt liêm.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Xók luch tanóói manưih bơk karong madhiq taai tarnêêng leng manưih ađô ting lêi rau dhơơm ơi vaaih, nek piđó tơm tadhưa xooq chô. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Dyơq paluch nôôq ngaai n'nal Ađó palơq nôôq manưih pađiil ting tapun Ađó tââq Ga-li-lê, piđó biêh ơi dyương tââq changaai đương lêi nôôq chiên achêk.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Tôôh, mưi nak achak Jô-seep, nek mưi nak kalóóng kabhuh takóh xêi xanêi, nek manưih ve lóóm nh'nhơr lơq bhơt liêm, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />(Ađó biêh ơi kah markơi karnóq palơq nôôq kabhuh takóh lơq tarnêêng têêng ưng piđó) ađó gluh tââq A-ri-ma-thê, mưi kanóón ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq, nek ađó xók đương rââm katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Xók vôôiq lum Phi-laat, chênh ađó ơi nhan xaak Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Lơq xong xók padhaluônh xaak Chuôq dhuônh, ađó raleng xaak palơq bhaai mahaak, lơq tơp Chuôq kalóóng mưi đong ping bâân têêng kalóóng dhơl, dhiq dham kah ơi ve ngaai glêh tatơp. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Tangêi ađek nek tangêi Ravang, lơq tangêi Sa-baat ravang tơk. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Xók achêk, nôôq adhi anó pađiil, nek nôôq manưih ơi buôn ting vôôiq palơq Chuôq tââq Ga-li-lê, xók vôôiq ting tapun hót hóng, piđó chalaang lêi ping lơq kơi xaak Chuôq bâân tabêch. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Hayơq xók ơi val chô, piđó ravang janươu lơq dhơu thum.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Tơk tangêi Sa-baat, piđó dhêi drơq ting kơi gani.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Hayơq, yayóng tarưưp marư rư ưng tangêi laloom mưi tun, piđó vôôiq tơk leq ping, đââng janươu thum đu piđó ơi ravang. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bơơi piđó lêi bhangôh dhơl ơi bâân tachir tââq ping, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />dhơ kơi ađek, xók mót leq kalóóng, piđó kah rau lêi xaak Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók piđó dyơq kah n'nal kơi kanóq leq chiên ađô nek, lêi tôôh, bơơr nak manưih padruuih xơp aau brương cha-iil dyương tóór piđó. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Xók piđó bhrơn kadrêq lơq chip mat leq katiêk nek bơơr nak achêk móón palơq piđó: “Hau nôôq pe chik chêk manưih mamông bhlưa kalóóng manưih chêt? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ađó kah tơơt dhiq ađô, bơơi Ađó ơi mamông lóóiq! Nek hei lóóiq Ađó ơi praaq ng'kơi palơq adhi anó xók dyơq tơơt dhiq Ga-li-lê, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />móón kơi ađô Akóón Manưih phaai bâân pajaau leq têi nôôq manưih matu lơt lơq phaai bâân tateeng đinh dhiq n'lóóng baang chatông, hayơq tơk tangêi đu pe, nek mamông lóóiq.” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Piđó hei lóóiq paraaq Ađó, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />lơq xók tââq ping val chô, piđó truuih lóóiq dyóp rau chiên leq majêt mưi sưưq-đô palơq tabhơt nôôq manưih đu lââng. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Nôôq pađiil achêk dhơơm nek Ma-ri Ma-đơ-leen, Jaan-nơ, Ma-ri amêêq Ja-kơ, lơq nôôq pađiil đu lââng nek palơq piđó, truuih lóóiq leq nôôq sưưq-đô nôôq tarnêêng achêk. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Nôôq paraaq truuih ađek xâng ngóq kơi paraaq bhông haau palơq nôôq sưưq-đô, hayơq piđó kah huuiq nôôq pađiil ađô. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Dhơ kơi achêk, Phi-e-rơ yuur dyương mut tơk ping, lơq kóp akoq bhange leq kalóóng, ađó chapiên lêi bhaai raleng giêl. Kơi ađek nek ađó val chô leq đong, tư tamóh hau chiên ơi vaaih.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Tôôh, chênh kalóóng tangêi achêk, bơơr chanak dhiq kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô xók vôôiq leq mưi bhươl changaai achak nek Em-ma-uut, tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem chapat jêt êch-ta-đơ, <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />lơq nhiđó xók tapraaq xóng ađêi leq dyóp rau tarnêêng ơi vaaih. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók nhiđó praaq chiên lơq tapraaq, nek chênh Chuôq Jê-su tơk pađan vôôiq mandrươh palơq nhiđó. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bơơi mat nhiđó bâân tapađơp đóng kah n'nal Ađó. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Xók achêk, Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Nôôq chiên achêk nek hau hơq bơơr nhưa tapraaq xóng nhưa xók vôôiq kalơng ha?” Nhiđó dyương parngau dhiq ađek, ranguôq rabaang bhlơng. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Hayơq xók ââi, mưi nak achak nek Kơ-lê-ô-ba móón palơq Ađó: “Ve alua chapiên mưi amei nek tamóói tham Jê-ru-sa-leem kah n'nal nôôq chiên ơi vaaih dhiq ađek nôôq tangêi ađôk?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Ađó tamóh nhiđó: “Hau rau chiên kơi ađek?” Hayơq nhiđó móón palơq Ađó: “Chiên pâng tơk Jê-su manưih Na-xa-reet, hơq ađek nek mưi manưih, mưi manưih đââng taruuih bing mataai raman kalóóng tarnêêng lơq bóóp paraaq toom mat Yaang Pleng palơq luch manưih dhanuôr, <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />lơq ng'kơi hơq nôôq takóh kala bhanuôih palơq kabhuh kuôn gamak ưng nôôq he ơi pajaau Ađó đóng đơơp tabóq matu leng, lơq ơi teeng đinh Ađó dhiq baang chatông. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Dyơq nôôq yi biêh đương rââm kơi Ađó ađek nek Yaang tơk đóng paq jóói I-sơ-ra-êên. Palâh lóóiq, eh rau mandrươh palơq tabhơt nôôq tarnêêng piing, tarlum achêk ơi lơh tơk tangêi mađôk nek tangêi đu pe, tââq tââp xók nôôq tarnêêng tôôh vaaih. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Bơơi, nôôq manưih pađiil bhlưa kalóóng nôôq yi lalua têêng nôôq yi phaai hêq xâng, xong xók piđó tơơt dhiq ping bhêêl yayóng tarưưp <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />lơq xók kah rau bâân lêi xaak Chuôq, piđó chô, truuih lóóiq nek ơi lêi rau tapalêi leq nôôq dhơn pleng móón Chuôq dyơq mamông. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Nôôq manưih kalóóng nôôq yi vôôiq leq ping lơq ơi lêi dhalam kơi ađek, pâng kơi nôôq manưih pađiil ơi móón, bơơi piđó kah rau lêi Ađó.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Hayơq Ađó móón palơq piđó: “Ơơi, nôôq manưih ngôôk ngaak lơq nôôq manưih kah đâh n'nal kalóóng lóóm đóng huuiq dhiq dyóp rau đu nôôq manưih đââng taruuih ơi móón! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Eh dhơq Chuôq Paq Manưih kơng đơơp nôôq rau ađek, đóng mót leq kalóóng cha-iil tabah ưng Ađó ha?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Hayơq tarnââp tââq Môôi-se lơq tââq tabhơt nôôq manưih đââng taruuih, Ađó lók kluôh đóng nhiđó rau dhơơm pâng tơk leq Ađó kalóóng luch Bha-aar Paraaq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Nhiđó vôôiq đan tơk bươl dhiq nhiđó kanóq vôôiq, nek Ađó têêng pakơi kiêng vôôiq changaai lơh. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Kơi ađek nek nhiđó chut kayua Ađó, kơi ađô: “Nhan tơơt lóóiq palơq bơơr yưa, taai pleng ơi đan blót lơq tangêi ravang luch.” Ađó vôôiq mót đóng tơơt lóóiq palơq nhiđó. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók Ađó ơi tơơt leq baang palơq nhiđó, pei kadhâng beng, Ađó ma-ơơn, lơq xong xók veh, Ađó pađơơp leq nhiđó. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Xók achêk, mat nhiđó tapơơh lơq nhiđó n'nal nek Chuôq, hayơq Chuôq ơi xooq tabil tââq nhiđó. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Nhiđó tapraaq xóng nhiđó: “Eh dhơq lóóm ưng nhang puih karxaal lóóm xók Ađó praaq chiên palơq nhang xók vôôiq kalơng, kung kơi xók Ađó lók kluôh Bha-aar Paraaq Yaang Pleng đóng nhang alua?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Kơi ađek nek xók yuur dyương kung leq chênh jơ achêk, nhiđó val chô tơk leq Jê-ru-sa-leem. Lơq nhiđó chik chêk lum majêt mưi sưưq-đô xók nhoom madhiq, palơq nôôq manưih ve mat palơq piđó, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />truuih kơi ađô: “Chuôq ơi mamông lóóiq lalua, lơq Ađó ơi bâân Si-môôn lêi.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Hayơq nhiđó truuih đuui dyóp rau chiên dhiq kalơng vôôiq, lơq ng'kơi Ađó ơi pakah leq nhiđó n'nal bhêêl xók veh beng.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Xók achêk, xók piđó dyơq praaq nôôq chiên achêk, chênh Ađó dyương dhiq m'pơng piđó, lơq móón palơq piđó: “Yươq rauha leq adhi anó.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Bơơi taai kakhin kapơn lơq kadrêq lêi, piđó ngóq nek xók lêi yaang. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ađó móón piđó: “Hau adhi anó nhok karnóq lơq ơi taai hau hơq rau paangra yuur vaaih kalóóng lóóm adhi anó? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Nek lêi têi ưng thêi lơq dyung ưng thêi, kơi chênh nek thêi ađôk. Nek xuui leq thêi lơq chamet lêi. Taai yaang kah ve m'bech lơq ng'haang, kơi adhi anó lêi thêi nek ve.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Praaq xong paraaq ađek, Ađó đóng piđó lêi têi lơq dyung ađêi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Xók bhêêl piđó dyơq kah ơi khin huuiq lơq hêq lêi taai bhuui marhaal bhlơng, Ađó tamóh piđó: “Dhiq ađôk, adhi anó ve rau chóóm cha kah?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Xók achêk, piđó pađơơp leq Ađó mưi paleh kadhóóng boh; <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Xong xók pei kadhâng, Ađó đah toom mat piđó.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Ađô nek nôôq paraaq ưng thêi đu thêi ơi praaq palơq adhi anó xók dyơq tơơt palơq adhi anó, nek dyóp rau ơi xaraq leq thêi dhiq kalóóng gani Môôi-se, nôôq bha-aar manưih đââng taruuih lơq nôôq bha-aar Haanh Pleng maar phaai bâân tajaap.” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Bhêêl achêk, Ađó lóng lóóm karnóq piđó đóng n'nal Bha-aar Paraaq Yaang Pleng, lơq Ađó móón piđó: <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />kơi ađô: “Kơi ve paraaq xaraq: Chuôq Paq Manưih phaai đơơp janah, lơq tââq akan chêt mamông lóóiq leq tangêi đu pe, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />hayơq rau klôôq lóóm đóng bâân lơơi matu phaai bâân truuih pachóóm vơn achak Ađó đóng tabhơt nôôq dhanuôr, tââp tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Adhi anó nek manưih truuih đuui leq nôôq tarnêêng ađek. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Thêi ravang pagơơi rau ơi hươq ưng Ama thêi tơk leq adhi anó. Bơơi adhi anó phaai tơơt kalóóng kanóón đóng tơk xók adhi anó bâân pei xơp mataai raman tââq piing yaal.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Hayơq Ađó đââng piđó gluh leq nguôi đóng tơk leq Bê-tha-ni, lơq xók hayuur têi ađêi yuur, Ađó đóng phươk leq piđó. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók Ađó đóng phươk leq piđó, Ađó xooq tââq piđó lơq bâân đââng padyók leq pleng. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Xong xók bhuôih kakoh Ađó, piđó val chô leq Jê-ru-sa-leem palơq lóóm bhuui marhaal bơk bhlơng, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />lơq tabhơt piđó bhiêk tơơt dhiq kalóóng đong bhanuôih, bhi haanh Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>